<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Tsaangi: Tsangu yimbwe ya Luuka</book>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="rem">Tsaangi Revision</para>
  <para style="rem">TSC le groupe Tsaangi de Mossendjo et de Pointe-Noire, ROC. 2020. Albert Makita, Serge Mboungou, Gilbert Moukanou, Pierre Sanza</para>
  <para style="h">Luuka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luuka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsaangu Yimbwe ya Luuka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsaangu Yimbwe ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luuka</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Musonihi ni nde mumosi wu bali mu uteele Luuka, asonihi mihanda mi myole mya Tsaangu Yimbwe ya Luuka na Mavaanga ma Biluumbi. Mu muhanda a nde watsomi, musonihi Luuka li mu usungamana bamukristo ba baavele Bayudaayo, baa bubaayambila Ingereke. Nde li mu usaangula bo tsiki bikuma bi binono na ikulu hi Bayudaayo hi bo baaveleyaaba. Buuna, ba bavele Bayudaayo ba tsi yoosi na ba taangu yoosi, utwala utsikaha ti Yisu ni mufuuhisi a bo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wu mubwe wu asonehe Luuka, li mu uduukala mulahi a nzila wu mihanda mimitatu myatsomi mya tsaangu yibwe. Ka muhanda wa Luuka wunuuwu, li mu usinzayambila mu mudyenge a Yisu umata hu Ngalili natee hu Yeruselemi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:28">9.51–19.28</ref></char>). Mu kuma yi <char style="em">udyata hu tsyelo a Yeruselemi</char>, hu Yisu haafwana ukwa, Luuka li mu uta misamu na masahu ma maavele mu mihanda mikima mya tsaangu yimbwe. Bu hu li we musamu wu Yisu haayamono Malata na Mariya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:38-42">10.38-42</ref></char>), kuma ya musi Samariya nga lingebe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:29-37">10.29-37</ref></char>), na sahu la tata wu miisoolo mwaana a nde wu adiimbili (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 15:11-32">15.11-32</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Musonihi muhanda mo wunuuwu, li mu usuungaha bi byaafulala tsoongo mu nde, hutso musamu na idiingu hya Yisu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nzambi miitsindaha Yisu Kristo, mu ufuuhasa boosi ba baamiivangama mu uyaka nde. Yisu li mu ubingalala fula-fula baatu ba baanyanza: basumihi, bangebe, biyaha, babeedu na byenyi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bamukristo ba Luuka ali mu uyambila mu bo, baabeedi peleve na busina. Luuka li mu ubehe masahu ma malahi ma Yisu haakayambila mu mo, ma matali busina, we mu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:16-21">12.16-21</ref></char>) na mu (buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 16">16</ref></char>). Nde li mu usuusa ŋa hati li bayihi ba nde, mu usoolo usalila busina mu Nzambi na mu bakima.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bayihi ba Yisu baaka mu nzila na nde na baamiivangama mu usobo mbiili. Bo bamiitsikaha ti Nzambi li wu mubwe, na atondo baatu boosi. Mu matsi ma bisu Looma baamiikala, baatu bubaaleele: «Mutumi ni pfumu.» Ka bamukristo bubaaleele: «Ni Yisu Kristo li Pfumu.» Mu mbuli, Nzambi amiisuula Yisu mu lipfu, na amiiva nde matwala ŋa yulu a byosi. Mu Tsaangu Yimbwe ya Luuka, bali mu usinzateele Yisu <char style="em">Pfumu</char> ufulala mihanda mya tsaangu yimbwe mikima.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsaangu Yimbwe ya Luuka, yili mu usuka hu Yeruselemi (buli li <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24">24</ref></char>), hu nde haabaandihi (mabuli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1-2">1–2</ref></char>). Yisu miiyamonehele wa moonyi huli bayihi ba nde, na bo baaka mu kinya. Ŋa mbaandu idiingu hya nde hi musunya, Yisu amiiluula mu livupu li limiimata huli Nzambi, Livupu la Ngidi (mabuli <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3-4">3–4</ref></char>). Bayihi ba nde kaka buuyaka lo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">24.49</ref></char>). Bo buutwala usambila na uyimba bubwe bwa Nzambi, we Yisu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Kotili Muhanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Ngeele Tehofile, baatu ba banzuhisini basonihi moosi ma maavyohi ŋa hati la bisu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Baatu mo baana ba baasonihi mambu mo maana, bo bali bambangi umata mbandu. Bambangi mo baana, baakituhi basalili ba baakalongese mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ni mu buuna, hufwani huli me kaka mu usonehele we mambu we bu mo maavangimi umata beleve, humbisa a hu me atsahi mo mu bukuhu. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Me tsiidi buuna, mana we yaba imbuli hya ndongisili yi we ayaki.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pofi miiyabisa mbutili a Yowani Mutondihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mu taangu a Eloode mutumi a tsi a Yuda, hwaba na ngaanga a Nzambi wu baakateele Zakariya. Nde aba wu a kabu li bangaanga ba Nzambi la Abiya. Mukadi a nde wu baakateele Lisabeti, aba wu imbisa hya Aroni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bo baboole baaba baasungama ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, na baakaduukala mikele mya Pfumu na tumili a nde we bu hwafwana. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ka bo a baaba na mwaana ve, mu tooni ati Lisabeti aba inguma, na bo abeedi aka binunu.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ilumbu imosi, Zakariya akasa isalu hya nde hi bungaanga bwa Nzambi, ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu tooni ati aba bilumbu bya kabu la bo mu usala. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />We bu hwaba ipfu hi isalu hi bangaanga ba Nzambi, batiidi ngodo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ngodo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tsoolili, yi ba baaduta nduhi mu iliba.</char></note> mu usoolo nde mu ukoto mu nzo a Pfumu, na mu utsuha paha a tsulu yimbwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Mu taangu yi Zakariya hakatsuha bungodu bwa paha a tsulu yimbwe, baatu ba banzuhisini baaba mu usambila Nzambi hu mbadi. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Mu taangu mo yiina, pofi a Pfumu ayamonehele ŋa busu bwa Zakariya. Pofi mo aba ateleme ŋa mbahala a diiku la paha a tsulu yimbwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Bu Zakariya hamoni pofi, nde akimuhi na aluuli mu boomo.<verse eid="LUK 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ka pofi aleeli nde: «Zakariya, a baa na boomo ve. Nzambi miyuha lisambulu la we: Mukadi a we Lisabeti ubutala we mwaana wa bahala, na we uluha nde nduhi Yowani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Buuna Yowani uba huli we dyaambu la kinya yindahi, na musangu. Mu tooni a mbutili a nde, ba banzuhisini bu umono kinya. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Nde uba wu munene ŋa busu bwa Pfumu. Nde a hunywa vinye ve, tso pasi malamu ma mu ubaakolese ve. Nde uluula mu Livupu la Ngidi, ubaandiha mutso a moonyi a ngu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ni nde Yowani, wu ubwefutala bisu Isereli ba banzuhisini, huli Pfumu Nzambi a bo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Nde uyene ŋa busu bwa Nzambi mu livupu na mifudi bi mumbihuli Eliya. Nde unongese mitima mi bataata na mya baana. Nde ufutala baatu ba baaveleyuhala Nzambi, mu uba ba baasungama. Na nde uvanga ibaandu hya Pfumu hi hyafwana.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya aleeli huli pofi: «Buni me umono imbuli? Mu tooni ati, me na mukadi a me, laaka binunu.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Pofi afutili nde: «Me ni Ngabiyeli, wu ubaateleme ŋa busu bwa Nzambi mu ukumbasa nde. Nzambi miitsindaha me mu umohese we, na uyabisa we musamu mo wunuwu, wu mubwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ka bu we velisa hiitu ti mambu ma me nde li we mu uvangama, we uba iduka. We a ubwetwala uyambila ve, natee mu ilumbu hi mo mu uvangama. Mambu mo maniima mu uvangama mu taangu yi yafwana.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mu taangu mo yiina, baatu baakakeele Zakariya, na baakimuhi bu nde hadiingi mu nzo a Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Bu hapali mu nzo a Nzambi, nde a hatwali uyambila na bo ve. Ka nde akavese bo, na nde akwilili buduka. Na bo baayaabi ti nde amoni imono-miisu mu nzo a Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Bu bilumbu bya nde bi isalu hya Pfumu byafwidi, nde afutihi hu nzo a nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Mwana taangu bu yavyohi, mukadi a nde Lisabeti abahi yimi. Mukadi mo, aswemi mu batsungi bataanu, na akaleele: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Mono ma Pfumu hamiisiila me. Mu taangu yi, nde miisukasa ma maakamweese me tsonyi ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pofi miiyabisa mbutili a Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Bu yimi la Lisabeti laakuhisi batsungi basamunu, Nzambi atsindihi pofi wa nduhi Ngabiyeli hu Nazareti, musyenge a Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Nde atsindihi pofi huli nuumba yi baakateele Mariya. Nde aba mutangula a Yosefi, muutu wu imbisa hya pfumu Davidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Pofi akoti huli nde na aleeli: «Bwehe! Ba mu kinya mu tooni ati, Pfumu amiisa we hyese, na nde li na we.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mariya bu hayuhi mambu mo maana, akimuhi hu unzuhisini na akafuula hutso mutima a nde: «Ki pila a bwehe bwa bunuubu?»<verse eid="LUK 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Pofi aleeli Mariya: «A baa na boomo ve! Mu tooni ati, we miibaha hyese ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Mono, we ubaha yimi, we ubuta mwaana wa bahala, na we uluha nde nduhi Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Nde uba wu munene, na bu ukaateele nde Mwana a Nzambi a Pungu. Pfumu Nzambi uva nde itsiha hi ipfumu hya Davidi, kaaha a nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Nde utuma ŋa yulu ibaandu hya Yakobi mu bilima na bilima, Ipfumu hya nde a hyufwa ve.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mariya aleeli huli pofi: «Buni mambu mo maniima mu utswiha? Mu tooni ati, me a hanzaba bahala ve!» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Pofi afutili nde: «Livupu la Ngidi lu ukulamana ŋa yulu a we, na matwala ma Nzambi a Pungu mu ufuuha we mu posi a mo. Ni mu buuna, mwaana wa ngidi wu bu ubuta, sa bateele nde Mwana a Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />«Mono, Lisabeti ikuta hya we kaka amiibaha yimi, mu ubuta mwaana wa bahala hu bununu bwa nde. Nde wu baakateele inguma, yimi laaka batsungi basamunu. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi a baakondo dyaambu ve.»<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mariya aleeli: «Me ndi musalili a Pfumu wu mukaasu. Nyaha mambu ma we mavangama ŋa yulu a me.» Ka buuna, pofi asiisi nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariya ayeni hu nzo a Lisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mu matsuhu mo maana, Mariya atelimi na ayeni mawasa hu musyenge wu bisyelo wa Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ni huuna nde hakoti mu nzo a Zakariya, na asuuli Lisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Mu taangu yi Lisabeti hayuhi bwehe bwa Mariya, mwaana anyingimi mutso a moonyi a nde. Lisabeti aluuli mu Livupu la Ngidi, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />na afulihi mu mifudi: «Nzambi asyeme we hwafula bakaasu boosi, na mwaana wu we ubuta li wu baasyeme. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Buni hutwala uba ti ngu a Pfumu a me aya huli me? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Me ndeeli buuna mu tooni ati, mu taangu yi me nzuhi bwehe bwa we mu matswi ma me, mwaana nyingimi mu kinya mutso a moonyi a me. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Kinya yili na we mukaasu wu siidi hiitu, ti Pfumu sa avangimasa ma nde hayabisi we.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dymbu la Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Titswene Mariya aleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Muvumu a me yusa Pfumu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />na livupu la me lili mu kinya mu Nzambi, Muyobili a me.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Mu tooni ati, nde amiisusa miisu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">ŋa yulu musalili a nde wu mukaasu wu akulamana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Eye, bunuubu, baatu ba matungi moosi bu ukaaleele me:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">nga hyese.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi nga Matwala miisa me mavaanga mamanene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">Nduhi a nde yili ya ngidi.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Kwili lingebe a Nzambi, yi baaba taangu yoosi mu matungi na matungi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">Nde ubaava yo huli boosi ba bubaakiinza nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Nde miimweese mifudi mya hoho hwa nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">Nde miitsala boosi ba babeedi na matsimi ma isaayi mutso mitima mya bo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Nde miikulamasa banga matwala ŋa yulu makiti ma bo ma ipfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">ka nde miisyenolo banga bulembo.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Banga nzala, nde miiywatisa bo mu ma mabwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">ka miifutala bisina myoho bunyanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Nzambi amiiyobolo Isereli musalili a nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">a havusana baa bubaasalila nde ukwila lingebe ve.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi hamisa nzuhisini huli bakaaha ba bisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">huli Abrahami na imbisa hya nde mu bilima na bilima.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mariya atsahili huli Lisabeti batsungi bebele na batatu, na nde afutihi hu bula bwa nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbutili na ketili a Yowani Mutondihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Tangu Lisabeti yi ubuta bu yatoodi, nde abuti mwaana wa bahala. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Tungi la bula, na baatu ba ibaandu hya Lisabeti, baayuhi ti Pfumu amweesi kwili a nde lingebe huli nde. Na bo baasangili itwadi na nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Bu mwaana hakwasi bilumbu pombo, baatu baayidi hu ukete nde. Bo baakatondo uteele nde mu nduhi a taata a nde, Zakariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ka ngu a nde aleeli: «Naana, bu uteele nde: Yowani.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bo baabisi na baaleeli nde: «Mu ikuta hya we, a huli na muutu nga nduhi mo yiina ve.» <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Na mu biliimbu, bo baafuuli taata a nde Zakariya, mu uyaba ki nduhi nde atondi uva mwaana. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakariya avondi itini hya baya mu usonehe, na nde asonihi: «Nduhi a nde: Yowani.» Na baatu boosi baakimuhi.<verse eid="LUK 1:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Mawasa-mawasa, ndaha a nde yadibumi. Zakariya akatoyo na uyusa Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Baatu boosi ba ibingi mo hiina baaba na boomo, na baa itaanzi hi bisyelo bya Yuda, baakayambila mu tooni a moosi ma maabwidi. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Boosi ba baakayuha maana, baakakeelese mo hutso mitima, na baakaleele: «Imwa-mwana mo hinihi na hu uba?» Hoho hwa Pfumu mu mbuli, hwaba ŋa yulu a nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dymbu la Zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakariya, taata a Yowani, aluuli mu Livupu la Ngidi na abihuli bunuubu:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Muyusu huli Pfumu Nzambi mabuli ma Isereli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">mu tooni ati, nde ayidi mu uyobolo baatu ba nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Na bu nde abehili bisu Muyobili nga matwala, wu imbisa hya Davidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">musalili a nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ni maana ma nde hayabisi mu minywa mi mimbihuli mya nde mya ngidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">umata matangu ma maavyohi.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Nde asiidi nzuhisini ti, nde uyobolo bisu mu myoho mi baboho ba bisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">na mu matwala ma babali mu ubelele bisu.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Nzambi amweesi kwili a nde lingebe huli bakaaha ba bisu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">Na nde ayibwili moonyi mu nzuhisini a nde ya ngidi.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Ni mulabu wu nde halabi huli Abrahami, kaaha a bisu.<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Nde ayobili bisu ŋa myoho mi baboho ba bisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">mana bisu libaasalila nde hwavele a boomo,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />napa mu bungidi na butsiitsa bu bwafwana mu nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">Bisu libaasalila nde mu bilumbu byosi bi idiingu hya bisu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Na we, mwaana a me, bu uteele we mumbihuli a Nzambi a Pungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">mu tooni ati, we uteehele Pfumu mu uvangila nde nzila,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />mu uyabisa baatu ba nde ti nde uyobolo bo, mu umaasa masumu ma bo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Nzambi a bisu usa buuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">mu tooni bunene bu lingebe la nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Litondo mo liina lu uba we ŋa nyangu ubaapala hu yulu, na umwedeme ŋa yulu a bisu.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Nde kaka uyalusa ba bali mu pipidi na mu posi lipfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">mana babita bisu mu nzila a hyenze<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.79 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:1">Esa 9.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Ka Mwana akakula na uhwada mu livupu la nde. Nde akatsahala hutso a kumu, natee ilumbu hi nde hayamonehele ŋa busu bwa bisu Isereli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mbutili a Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Kayisaali Angustu, pfumu a itaanzi hya Looma, apalisi mukele mu usa litangu la baatu mu toto yoosi ya Looma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Litangu mo liina aba ni latsomi, li laatswihi mu taangu yi Kirinyusi haba pfumu a itaanzi hya Siriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Mabuli moosi maakayene hu usonehe manduhi ma bo, muutu-muutu hu bula bwa nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosefi kaka ayeni hu musyenge a Nazareti hu tsi a Ngalili. Nde ayeni hu musyenge a Betelemi hu tsi a Yuda. Nde hasiidi buuna, mu tooni ati nde aba muutu a bula mo buuna, na musi ibaandu hi mutumi Davidi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Nde ayasonehe nduhi buna a Mariya mutangula a nde. Mariya aba na yimi.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Bu bo baaba huuna, taangu a Mariya yi ubuta yatoodi. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Nde abuti mwaana a nde watsomi wa bahala. Nde apoti nde tsanda na alaasi nde mu idiili hi biboodi, mu tooni a bu baavelibaha itini mu nzo a byenyi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 2:7">Pofi a Nzambi amonihili huli bakeelisi babiboodi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:7">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Koonge yinene yi bapofi" file="CN01642b.tif" size="col" loc="2.8" copy="David C. Cook New Testament Illustrations" ref="2.9">Konge yinene yi bapofi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Mu tsi mo yiina kaka, hwaba na bakeelisi ba biboodi ba baakakiilala mu bwadi, mu ubaakeelese biboodi bya bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Buuna, pofi a Pfumu ayamonehele ŋa busu bwa bo, na muyusu a Pfumu ayadiinga bo mu liyalala. Bo baabahi boomo bu bulahi. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ka pofi aleeli bo: «A liba na boomo ve, ka me miinza mu uyabisa benu Musamu wu Mubwe wa kinya yindahi mu baatu boosi: <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Loloyi, hu bula bwa Davidi, bamiibutala benu Muyobili, ni nde Kristo, wu uli Pfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ka monwaani iliimbu hi baaviidi benu: Benu sa lisoolo mwaana ikenyi wu baapoto tsanda, baalaasa mu idiili hi biboodi.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Na mu mawasa, konge yinene yi bapofi ba hu yulu, baapfutini na pofi mowuna. Baakayusa Nzambi na baakaleele:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Muyusu huli Nzambi hu hati mayulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">na hyenze ŋa toto huli baatu ba nde hatondo.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Bu bapofi baatahuhi na bo mu ufutaha hu yulu, bakeelisi babiboodi baalelisini: «Ni tswendaani natee hu Betelemi na limonwaani ma maamiibwa, we ma Pfumu hayabisa bisu a benu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bo baayeni huuna mu mawasa, na baamoni Mariya, Yosefi na imwa-mwana baaba baalasa hutso idiili hi biboodi. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Bu baamoni imwa-mwana, bo baayabisi ma baleeli bo mu imwa-mwana mo hinihi. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Baatu bu baayuhi ma bakeelisi babiboodi baakaleele, bo baakimuhi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mariya akayibwala moonyi mu maana moosi, na akatsima mo hutso mutima a nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Bakeelisi babiboodi baafutihi mu ubaayusa na ubaakiinza Nzambi mu moosi ma bo baayuhi na baamoni, we bu pofi hayabisi bo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baatu bamiiluha mwaana nduhi Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Bu mwaana hakuhasi bilumbu pombo, baaketi nde, na baaluhi nde nduhi Yisu, we bu pofi haateeli nde, tswamina ngu a nde abaha yimi.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosefi na Mariya baamweesi Yisu ŋa busu bwa Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Bu ilumbu hya tsyemili hyatoodi, Yosefi na Mariya baayeni hu Yeruselemi. Bo baayamweese Yisu ŋa busu bwa Pfumu, we bu huli mukele a Moose. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Ni we bu baasonehe mu mukele a Pfumu: «Pasi mwaana watsomi wa bahala, nde li wa ngidi ŋa busu bwa Pfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Pal 13.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Titswene, bo baayava bungodu bu makunda moole, buuve mabembe moole, we bu mukele a Pfumu ubaatuma.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Hu musyenge a Yeruselemi hwaba na muutu mumosi, nduhi a nde Simeyoni. Nde aba wu asungama na nga likiinzu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Nde akakeele muutu wu Nzambi hafwana utsindaha mu uyobolo bisu Isereli, na Livupu la Nzambi laaba ŋa yulu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Lo laayabisi nde ti tswamina nde mu ukwa, nde afwana umamono Kristo wu Pfumu hutsindaha.<verse eid="LUK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Livupu la Ngidi laabiti Simeyoni hu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. Na babuti ba Yisu, baabiti nde mu ukuhasa ma bafwana usa mu nde, we bu huli mukele. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeyoni avoli mwaana mu myoho mya nde, afutili matondo huli Nzambi:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Bunuubu, Pfumu, ni nyaha musalili a we ayene mu hyenze, we bu huli nzuhisini la we.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ka miisu ma me ma miimono liyobolo la we,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />li we avangimasa ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Liyalala mu uyalusa matsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">na muyusu ibaandu hya we, Isereli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Esa 42.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52.10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simeyoni abihuli mu Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Mambu ma Simeyoni hakaleele, maakimusi taata na ngu a Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeyoni asyemi bo na aleeli Mariya ngu a Yisu: «Mwana mo wunuwu miiya mu ubwisa na mu utelemese ba banzuhisini mu Isereli. Nde uba iliimbu hya Nzambi, ka baatu bu unyanza nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Matsimi ma mitima mi milahi mu uyabaana. Na we mo, mutima a we umono pasi we muutu wu sabila amiikotelele.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana abihuli mu Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Ŋa litandala la nzo a Nzambi, hwaba kaka na mumbihuli mumosi wu mukaasu, nduhi a nde Ana. Nde aba mwaana a Fanweli, wa buli la Azeri. Nde aba amiinuna. Nde avyosi bilima tsambu na mulumi a nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Ŋa mbisa ŋana, nde asaali bukwili. Nde atoosi maku pombo na bilima bina (84). Ana a hakatahuha na nzo a Nzambi ve, na nde akasalila Nzambi butsuhu na nyangu, na udya ikaandi mu usambila. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Bo baayato bikuma mu ngunga yi Simeyoni hamani uyambila, nde kaka ayusi Nzambi na ayambili mu Yisu, huli boosi ba baakakeele liyobolo la Yeruselemi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Bu Yosefi na Mariya baamani ukuhasa moosi, we bu huli mukele a Pfumu, bo baafutihi hu Nazareti musyenge a bo, hu tsi a Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana akakula na akahwada. Nde aba aluula mu nzaabili, na hyese hya Nzambi hyaba na nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ayeni hu nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Pasi ilima, babuti ba Yisu baakayene hu musyenge a Yeruselemi hu mukungi a Paake. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Bu Yisu hakuhisi kuumi bilima byole, bo baakumi hu mukungi we bu huli ipfu hya bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Bu mukungi hafwidi, bo baakafutaha. Ka Yisu asaali hu Yeruselemi, hwavele ngu a nde na taata a nde uyaba. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bo baakatsima ti nde aba na bakaanga ba nde mu nzila. Bo baasiidi muyilala mumosi mu nzila mu ubaasaha nde ŋa hati li ikuta na bambaahi ba bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Bu baavelimono nde, bo baafutihi hu Yeruselemi na ubaasaha nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ni humbisa bilumbu bitatu, bo baayasoolo nde hu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. Huuna, nde aba atsahala ŋa hati li milongisi, mu ubaayuha bo na ubaava bo byuhu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Boosi ba baakayuha nde baakakimuha mu buyedi bwa nde na bu nde hakafutala byuhu. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Bu babuti ba nde baasooli nde, bo baakimuhi. Na ngu a nde aleeli nde: «Mwana a me, mu hima we vaangi la pila yiina huli bisu? Mono, bisu a taata a we lili mu usaha we na boomo.»<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yisu afutili bo: «Mu hima benu lili mu usaha me? Benu liyaabi ti me apfwana ubaaba mu nzo a Taata a me.» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ka bo a baatsikihi ma Yisu hakaleele bo ve. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Titswene nde afutihi na bo hu Nazareti na nde akayuhala bo bubwe. Ka ngu a nde akakeelese misamu myosi hutso mutima a nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Na Yisu akakula mu nzaabili na mu mutele. Nde akamweese kinya huli Nzambi na huli baatu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yowani Mutondihi akalongese baatu hutso a kumu a nzala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-6">Mty 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2-6">Mlk 1.2-6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-23">Yow 1.19-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Hwaba ilima hya kuumi na bitaanu, hi Kayisaali Tiberiyu haba mutumi matsi moosi ma Looma. Ponse Pilaato aba mutumi a tsi a Yuda, mu ilima mo hiina. Eloode aba pfumu itaanzi hya Ngalili, na mwaana a ngu a nde Filipo, pfumu itaanzi hya Iturya na Takonita. Lisanyasi aba pfumu itaanzi hya Abilena. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ane na Kayifa baaba bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi. Mu taangu mo yiina, Yowani mwaana a Zakariya aba mutso a kumu a nzala. Nzambi ayabisi nde mambu ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Ni mu buuna, Yowani hataangili itaanzi hyoosi hya Yolodani, nde akata ibila: «Sobwaani mbiili, Yakaani tondihili mana Nzambi anyahula masumu ma benu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ni we bu baasonehe mu muhanda a mumbihuli Esaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Yiniiyi ni ndaha a muutu wuuna wu li mu uta ibila mu kumu a nzala:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Vangimasaani nzila a Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">suungahaani misoho mya nde! <verse eid="LUK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kisalaani mitsundu myosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">syengaani bisyelo na bitukidi bikituha bidede.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Suungahaani manzila ma maatengeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">na syengaani misoho mi milahi mi mabaku.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Buuna baatu boosi bu umono liyobolo la Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Esa 40.3-5</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Konge a baatu yayidi huli Yowani, mana nde atondehe bo. Nde akaleele huli bo: « Benu ibaandu hi bapili, na alongese benu mu ubata kesi a Nzambi? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ni mu buuna, butaani mbutu yi yukaata imbangi ti benu limisobo mbiili a benu. Na a lilelesene mu mitima mya benu ve ti: “Bisu lili na taata a bisu Abrahami.” Ka me ndeele benu ti, mamanya mo maniima, Nzambi utwala ukitusa mo baana ba Abrahami. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Pa pibi bamiivangimasa mu ukwanga muti mu manganzi. Ni mu buuna, pasi muti wu uvelebuta mbutu yimbwe, bu ukwanga nde na ubwaha nde hu mbaahu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Konge a baatu yakafuula nde: «Bisu hima lafwana usa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Nde afutili bo: «Nyaha muutu wu uli na biyunga byole, akaba imosi huli wu avele na hyo. Na wu uli na byudya, akabila bana.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Hwayidi kaka bakuukihi ba limandu, mana batondehe bo, na bo baafuuli Yowani: «Mulongisi, bisu hima lafwana usa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Nde aleeli bo: «A linono bibyafulala ŋa yulu a bi baava benu muswa ve.» <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Masadaadu kaka maayafuula nde: «Ka bisu kaka, hima lafwana usa?» Nde aleeli bo: «A lipatula mbongo a muutu ve, a lileele dyaambu li upfuta mu muutu ve, ka baatalaani ndulu pfuta a benu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowani Mutondihi ayabisi wuna wu uli mu uya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:11-12">Mty 3.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">Mlk 1.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:24-28">Yow 1.24-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Baatu bu baaba mu ukeele na hiitu hyoosi, boosi baakafulasana byuhu bo mwakulu hutso mitima mya bo, tso Yowani ni Masiya. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yowani afutili huli boosi: «Me, me ndi mu utondehe benu mu mamba. Ka, wu uli mu uya, afulala me matwala, na me a handi tso wu akuha mu uba muviha, mu unyangula midi mi bikodi bya miilu mya nde ve. Nde wuuna utondehe benu mu Livupu la Ngidi na mu mbaahu. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Nde li na iyengese hya nde ŋa hoho, mu ukahula mbutu na biimbu. Nde ukukaha muhunu hutso iswehili hya nde, ka nde utsuha biimbu hu mbaahu yi yuuveledima.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yowani akayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli konge, na uva bo kwadisili kima yindahi. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ŋa yulu a ŋaana, Yowani asyembi mutumi Eloode wu avoli na ukwele Elodyadi, mukadi a mwaana a ngu a nde. Na nde abwesyembe Eloode mu tooni mavaanga moosi ma mabi ma nde hasiidi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ŋa yulu a maana moosi, Eloode akotisi Yowani mu kondaayi.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tondihili a Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mty 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:29-34">Yow 1.29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Humbisa utondehe baatu boosi, Yowani atondihi kaka Yisu. Na bu Yisu hakasambila, yulu laadibumi, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Livupu la Ngidi laakulimini ŋa yulu a nde we libembe. Na ndaha mosi yamati hu yulu: «We ni Mwana a me wu litondo, wu me umbapfulala utondo.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bukulu bu ibaandu hya Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Bu Yisu habandihi isalu hya nde, nde aba bebele na bilima maku matatu. Baatu baakatsima ti nde aba mwaana a Yosefi. Na Yosefi mwaana a Eli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Eli aba mwaana a Matati, Matati mwaana a Leevi. Leevi aba mwaana a Meleki, Meleki mwaana a Yanayi. Yanayi aba mwaana a Yosefi, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefi mwaana a Matatyasi. Matatyasi aba mwaana a Amosi, Amosi mwaana a Nahumi. Nahumi aba mwaana a Esely, Esely mwaana a Nangayi. <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nangayi aba mwaana a Mahate, Mahate mwaana a Matatyasi. Matatyasi aba mwaana a Semeni, Semeni mwaana a Yoseki. Yoseki aba mwaana a Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda mwaana a Yowanani. Yowanani aba mwaana a Resa, Resa mwaana a Zorobabele. Zorobabeli aba mwaana a Salatyele, Salatyele mwaana a Neri. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri aba mwaana a Meleki, Meleki mwaana a Adi. Adi aba mwaana a Kosami, Kosami mwaana a Elemada. Elemada aba mwaana a Eri, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eri mwaana a Yisu. Yisu aba mwaana a Elyezeri, Elyezeri mwaana a Yorimi. Yorimi aba mwaana a Matati, Matati mwaana a Levi. <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Levi aba mwaana a Simeyoni, Simeyoni mwaana a Yuda. Yuda aba mwaana a Yosefi, Yosefi mwaana a Yonami. Yonami aba mwaana a Elyakimi, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Elyakimi mwaana a Meleya. Meleya aba mwaana a Mena, Mena mwaana Matata. Matata aba mwaana a Natani, Natani mwaana a Davidi. <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Davidi aba mwaana a Yese, Yese mwaana a Obedi. Obedi aba mwaana a Booze, Booze mwaana a Sala. Sala aba mwaana a Nasoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nasoni mwaana a Aminadabi. Aminadabi aba mwaana a Adimini, Adimini mwaana a Alani. Alani aba mwaana a Esiloni, Esiloni mwaana a Falesi. Falesi aba mwaana a Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda mwaana a Yakobi. Yakobi aba mwaana a Isaki, Isaki mwaana a Abrahami. Abrahami aba mwaana a Tara, Tara mwaana a Naholi. <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naholi aba mwaana a Seruki, Seruki mwaana a Ragahu. Ragahu aba mwaana a Faleki, Faleki mwaana a Heberi. Heberi aba mwaana a Sela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sela mwaana a Kayinami. Kayinami aba mwaana a Alfasade, Alfasade mwaana a Semi. Semi aba mwaana a Nowa, Nowa mwaana a Lemeki. <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lemeki aba mwaana a Matusalemi, Matusalemi mwaana a Enooke. Enooke aba mwaana a Yaleti, Yaleti mwaana a Maleleheli. Maleleheli aba mwaana a Kayinami, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kayinami mwaana a Enosi. Enosi aba mwaana a Seti, Seti mwaana a Adami. Adami aba mwaana a Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mukuyi alobisi Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mty 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1.12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yisu amati hu Yolodani wu alula mu Livupu la Ngidi, na lo laabiti nde hu kumu a nzala. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Mukuyi alobisi nde mu maku mana ma bilumbu. Mu bilumbu mo biina, nde a hadiidi ve. Nde amoni nzala. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Buuna mukuyi aleeli nde: «Tso we li Mwana a Nzambi, tuma manya mo linili likituha lipa.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yisu afutili nde: «Baasonehe: “Muutu a hubaha moonyi ndulu mu mapa ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Pfu 8.3</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Mukuyi abiti Yisu ŋa mbuha yi yasyenoho, amweesi nde mu mwaana taangu hole bipfumu bya toto yoosi, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />na aleeli huli nde: «Me upa we lituma na muyusu a bipfumu mo biniibi. Mu tooni ati, biloho mo biniibi byosi baava me, na me ndi mu upa byo huli wuuna wu me tondi. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Tso we tsokimi ŋa busu bwa me mu ukuunda me, byo byosi sa biba bya we.»<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yisu afutili nde: «Mu Libuku la Ngidi baasonehe: “We afwana ukuunda na usalila ndulu Pfumu Nzambi a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Pfu 6.13</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Titswene mukuyi abwebita nde hu Yeruselemi, asusi nde hu yulu mubundu a nzo a Nzambi na aleeli nde: «Tso we li Mwana a Nzambi, dumaha na bwa, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />mu tooni ati baasonehe: “Nde utuma bapofi ba nde mu usyele we.” <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Na: “Bo bu uyaka we mu myoho mya bo, mana hulu hwa we a hukubana mu manya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Mkg 91.11-12</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yisu afutili nde: «Baasonehe kaka mu libuuku la Nzambi ti: “A lobese Pfumu Nzambi a we ve.”»<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Pfu 6.16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Bu nde hamani ulobese Yisu, mukuyi atahuhi na nde, natee mu ukeele taangu kima.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abaandihi isalu hya nde hu Ngalili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mty 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:1-3">Yow 4.1-3</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 4:43-46">43-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1.14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yisu afutihi hu Ngalili wu aluula mu matwala ma Livupu la Ngidi, na lidumu la nde layeni mu itaanzi hyoosi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nde akalongese baatu mu manzo ma lisambulu ma Bayudaayo, na boosi baakayusa nde.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baabisi Yisu hu Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mty 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yisu ayidi hu Nazareti, hu nde habuuhi. Mu ilumbu hya saba, nde akoti mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, we bu huli ipfu hya nde. Nde atelimi mu utanga libuku la ngidi, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />na baviidi nde muhanda mumbihuli Esaya. Bu hadibuli muhanda, nde asooli mbuha yi baaba baasonehe bunuubu:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Livupu la Pfumu lili ŋa yulu a me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">mu tooni ati, Pfumu amiisoolo me</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli biyaha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Nde atsindihi me mu uleele huli ba baakangama: “Benu ka bunyanga!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Mu uleele huli binzimana: “Benu lu umono!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Nde atsindihi me mu uyobolo babali mu munyongi,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />na mu uyabisa ilima hi lisyeme la Pfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Esa 61.1-2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yisu afuti muhanda, afutili nde huli musalili a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, na atsahili. Mutso a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, boosi baaba miisu ŋa yulu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Buuna, nde aleeli bo: «Mabasonehe mu Libuuku la ngidi, ma benu li miyuha, loloyi mamiitswiha.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Na boosi baakasilasa nde, na baakakimuha mu mambu ma mabwe ma maakapala mu munywa a nde na baakaleele: «Nde wunuwu a ni mwaana a Yosefi ve?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Me ndi na hiitu, ti benu lu uta me kuma mo yiniiyi: “Ngaanga, beeloso we, we mwakulu.” Na benu lu uleele kaka bunuubu: “Vanga kaka huni hu tsi a we mwakulu, mambu moosi ma bisu layuhi mamavyohi hu Kapernahumi.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Yisu aleeli: «Mu mbuli me nzabisa benu: mumbihuli a bubaayaka bubwe mu tsi a nde mwakulu ve. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Mu mbuli yoosi me ndi mu unzabisa benu: mu tsi a Isereli yoosi, hwaba na bakwili ba bakaasu ba banzuhisini mu taangu mumbihuli Eliya. Mu bilima bitatu na batsungi basamunu hwaba lwanga, na limbunga laakoti mu tsi yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Mu bakwili mo baana, Nzambi a hatsindihi Eliya tso huli mumosi mu bo ve. Ka nde atsindihi nde ndulu huli mukwili a bula bwa Sarepita, hu tsi a Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Hu tsi a Isereli mu taangu mumbihuli Elisa, hwaba kaka na banga bwatsi ba banzuhisini. Tso mumosi mu bo a baabelusi ve, ka ndulu Namani musi tsi a Siriya.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Baatu boosi ba baaba mu nzo masambulu yi Bayudaayo bu baayuhi maana, baluuli mu kesi. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Bo baatelimi, baapalisi Yisu hu mbadi musyenge a Nazareti, natee hu yulu isyelo hi bo baaba baatunga musyenge a bo, mana batsindahala nde hu baanda. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ka Yisu avyohi ŋa hati la bo na avyasuhi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso bahala nga livupu lilibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mty 7.28-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk 1.21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yisu ayeni hu Kapernahumi, musyenge a Ngalili, na nde akalongese baatu mu ilumbu hya saba. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Ndongisili a nde yakimusi baatu, mu tooni ati, nde akalongese mu mbuli na matwala ma Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, hwaba na muutu mumosi wu tengo laaba laalwata. Na muutu mo wuuna, akafulaha mu ndaha yi mifudi: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Ah! We hima na bisu, Yisu musi Nazareti, we miiya mu uyadimbasa bisu? Me nzaabi na we li, wa Ngidi wa Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yisu afwengili livupu lilibi: «Ba swi! Pala mu muutu mo wunuuwu!» Bu tengo labwisi muutu ŋa busu bwa bo, lo lapali mu muutu mowuna hwavele usa nde pasi dyaambu. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Boosi baakimuhi, na baakalelesene: «Ki pila a dyaambu li? Nde ni ubaatuma mavupu ma mabi mu matwala na mifudi, na mo ni ubaapala mu baatu!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Na lidumu la nde laayabiini mu mala moosi ma itaanzi mo hina.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso babeedu baa pila mu pila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mty 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1.29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Bu Yisu hamati hu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, nde akoti mu nzo a Simoni. Huuna, nde amoni buko bwa Simoni bu mukaasu wu aba na bahu li mifudi. Na baatu baavondi Yisu mu ubeeloso nga bahu. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yisu atelimi ŋa bebele a nde, na aleeli baahu mu udimbala, ka bahu laapali. Mu mawasa, mukaasu atelimi na akabili bo byudya.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Bu taangu yadyami, boosi ba baaba na babeedu baa pila mu pila, baabehi bo huli Yisu. Nde asuusili bo myoho mya nde, na baabeeluhi. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Matengo ma malahi maapali mu baatu, na ubaafulaha: «We ni Mwana a Nzambi.» Ka Yisu akafwengele mo na ubaaliha mo mu utoyo mu tooni ati, mo maaba mayaba ti nde ni Masiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ŋa busi bwakiidi, Yisu apali na ayeni hu tsi yi busiha. Makonge ma baatu maasahi nde, na maayasoolo nde. Bo baasahi ukwisa nde ibata, mana nde avelesiisa bo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ka Yisu aleeli bo: «Me apfwana kaka uyayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe, wu Ipfumu hya Nzambi hu misyenge mikima mu tooni ati, ni mu liina Nzambi hatsindaha me.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Na buuna, nde akalongese mu manzo ma lisambulu ma Bayudaayo hu itaanzi hya Yuda.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu asooli bayihi ba nde baatsomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mty 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:35-51">Yow 1.35-51</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:1-11">21.1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Ilumbu imosi, Yisu aba ŋa simu la dyanga la Ngenezareti, mu uyihasa mambu ma Nzambi. Konge a baatu yakavinyala Yisu mu usaha uyuha nde. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" /><figure style="fig" alt="Yisu akayihasa makoonge" file="CN01705B.TIF" size="col" loc="5.2" copy="David C. Cook New Testament Illustrations" ref="5.2">Yisu akayihasa makonge</figure>Ŋa simu la dyanga, Yisu amoni maluungu moole ma balobi basutihi mu uswaha malihi ma bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yisu avati hutso a luungu limosi, li laaba la Simoni. Na nde aleeli Simoni, mu utahuha hole na simu. Buuna nde atsahili, na hutso a luungu, nde akayihasa makonge.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Bu nde hamani uyihasa, nde aleeli huli Simoni: «Susaha hu idongi, na lihani malihi ma benu mu ulobo.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni afutili: «Mulongisi, bisu limiisaala butsuhu bwosi, hwavele ubaha isiha. Ka bu we miileele, me tsa ndiiha malihi.»<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Ni mu buuna, Simoni na bakima baalihi malihi ma bo mu dyanga. Bo baabahi batswi ba banzuhisini, na malihi ma bo maakakana utudaha. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Na bo baavesi bakaanga ba bo, baa mu luungu likima mu uyakumbasa bo. Bu bo baayidi, bo baaluusi maluungu mamoole mu batswi ba banzuhisini, natee bu mo maakakana udyama.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Bu Simoni Peetelo hamoni buuna, nde atsokimi ŋa busu bwa Yisu na aleeli: «Pfumu, tahuha na me, ka me ni nga masumu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Nde haleeli buuna mu tooni ati, nde na bakima baamoni tsisu, mu iteesi hi batswi ba bo baabahi. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Yaki na Yowani, baana ba Zebede ba baaba itwadi na Simoni, bo kaka baamoni tsisu. Yisu aleeli huli Simoni: «A baa na boomo ve! Umata loloyi, we uba mulobi a baatu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Titswene, Simoni na bakima baabehi maluungu ma bo hu simu, bo baasiisi byosi, na baaduukili Yisu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abeelusi nga bwatsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mty 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1.40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Ka bu Yisu hatoodi hu musyenge mumosi, bahala limosi nga bwatsi, aba huuna. Bu nde hamoni Yisu, nde atsokimi, hiinzi mu toto ŋa busu bwa Yisu, na nde asambili ti: «Pfumu, tso we tondi, we utwala utsyemese me.»<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yisu alabi kaka la nde, abembi nde, na aleeli: «Me tondi buuna: baa watsyeme!» Mu taangu mo yiina, bwatsi bwamati mu nde. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Na Yisu aviidi nde tumili mo yiniiyi: «A hayabisa musamu mo wunuuwu huli pasi muutu ve! Ka yene yamonehele huli ngaanga a Nzambi, na va bungodu bwa tsyemili bu Moose hatumi. Ni hyo hi umweese huli baatu boosi ti we miibeeloho.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Lidumu la Yisu laakafulala uyenelele, na makonge ma malahi maakakuukama mu uyuha nde, mana nde abeeloso babeedu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ka nde asiisi bo, na ayeni hu mambuha ma busiha mu usambila Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abeelusi ikata</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mty 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Ilumbu imosi, Yisu bu hakayihasa baatu, Bafarisi na milongisi mi mikele baaba batsahala ŋa muvanga a nde mu uyuhala nde. Baatu mo baana baamati mu mala moosi ma Ngalili, na ma Yuda natee hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. Na matwala ma Pfumu maaba mu Yisu. Nzambi aviidi nde matwala mu ubeeloso babeedu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Hwayidi kaka baatu ba baakabita ikata ŋa yulu ipoyi. Bo baakasaha ukotese nde mu nzo, mu ususa nde ŋa busu bwa Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ka bo a baatwali ukotese nde ve, mu tooni a konge a baatu yi yaba yafulala. Na bo baavati hu yulu a nzo, baatubi mwanzi, na baakulimisi mubeedu na ipoyi hyoosi ŋa busu bwa Yisu, wu aba ŋa hati la baatu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Bu Yisu hamoni imiinu hya bo, nde aleeli: «Mbaahi a me, masumu ma we bamiinyahula.»<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Milongisi mi mikele na Bafarisi baatsimi na baakalelesene: «Ki pila a muutu wu ubaasumana Nzambi? Na utwala utsindula masumu tso a ni Nzambi nde mwakulu ve?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Ka Yisu ataasi matsimi ma bo, nde afutili bo: «Mu hima libaatsima buuna mu mitima mya benu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Hima hyafulala ulenge mu uleele: “Masumu ma we bamiitsindula”, buuve mu uleele: “teleme na takula”? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Me tondi ti benu liyaba ti Mwana a muutu li na matwala ŋa toto mu utsindula masumu.» Nde aleeli huli ikata: «Me mindeele we, teleme! Volo ipoyi hya we, na yene hu nzo a we.»<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Mu mawasa, ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi, nde atelimi. Nde avoli ipoyi hi nde haba habwamina ŋa yulu a hyo, ayeni hu nzo a nde na ubaayusa Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Baatu boosi baakimuhi na baakayusa Nzambi. Bu baaluuli mu tsisu, bo baakaleele: «Loloyi bisu limiimono mambu ma kimuhili.»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiteele Leevi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mty 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk 2.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Humbisa a maana, Yisu apali na atalili mukaambi limandu, nduhi a nde Leevi, atsahala mu nzo isalu yi bakaambi ba limandu. Yisu ateeli nde na aleeli: « Duukala me.» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Leevi asiisi byosi, atelimi na aduukili Yisu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Buuna, Leevi avangili Yisu mukungi wu udya wu munene hu nzo a nde. Konge yinene yi bakaambi ba limandu na baatu bakima, baakadya itwadi na bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Bafarisi na milongisi mi mikele baakaŋono na baakaleele huli bayihi ba nde: «Mu hima benu lili mu udya na unywa na bakaambi ba limandu, na banga masumu?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yisu afutili bo: «A ba bali polo bubaasaha mubuhi ve, ka ni babeedu. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Me a hanza mu uteele babaakuha ve, ka banga masumu. Me anzateele bo mana bo basobo mbiili a bo, na uya huli Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baakafuula Yisu mu ikaandi hi ukiinza Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mty 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2.18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Buuna baatu baaleeli Yisu: «Bayihi ba Yowani mu lisambulu, bubaadya ikaandi mu ukiinza Nzambi. Bayihi ba Bafarisi kaka bubaasa pila mosi. Ka ba we ndulu udya na unywa.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Benu utwala uliha byudya huli baatu ba benu laatsiha hu mukungi makweele, bu mulumi akini na bo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ka taangu yi uto, yi bu umaasa bo mulumi. Mu taangu mo yiina, bo bu udya ikaandi.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Buuna Yisu abweta bo kuma mo yiniiyi: «A hu li na muutu wu ubaalondo ikutu hi ikulu mu ireende hya tsanda hi inyatihi ve. Kini, ireende hi inyatihi hyubwekasula tsanda yikulu. Buuna, vulu luubwefulala bunene. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Ni bumosi kaka, muutu utwala usyeholo malamu ma tsohele mutso mirumbu mi mikulu ve, kini malamu ma tsohele muubula mirumbu. Buuna, na malamu, na mirumbu, byosi byunyambahana. Ka baafwana usyeholo malamu ma tsohele mutso mirumbu mi minyatihi! <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Ka baafwana usyeholo malamu ma manyatihi mutso mirumbu mi minyatihi. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Na a huli na muutu wu amiinywa malamu ma maayele, na ubwetondo unywa myenge ve. Mu tooni ati, baatu bubaleele: “Malamu ma maayele maafulala bubwe.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu Pfumu ilumbu hya saba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mty 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2.23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Mu ilumbu imosi hya saba, Yisu akataangila matsyehe ma masangu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">matsyehe ma masangu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu taangu mo yiina baatu baakakuna mbutu yi uvanga mapa.</char></note>. Bayihi ba nde baakakoolo mivoovo mi masaangu. Bu bo baakabuula na uhololo mo mu myoho mya bo, bo baakadya masangu. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mwana a kabu li Bafarisi laaleeli bo: «Mu hima benu lili mu uvanga mi baaliha usa mu ilumbu hya saba?»<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yisu afutili bo: «Benu a lataanga ma mutumi Davidi hasiidi bu haba na nzala, nde na baatu ba nde ve? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Nde akoti mu nzo a Nzambi, avoli mapa ma baayeholo huli Nzambi, adidi mo na aviidi ka huli bambaahi ba nde. Mapa mo maana, muutu mukima a hali na muswa mu udya mo ve, ka ndulu bangaanga ba Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yisu aleeli huli Bafarisi mo baana: «Mwana a muutu li Pfumu a saba.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abeelusi muutu mu ilumbu hya saba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mty 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ilumbu ikima hya saba, Yisu akoti mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, na abwi mu uyihasa. Muuna, hwaba na bahala limosi li kaka la mbahala laaba lavolo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi baakatala Yisu mu umono, tso nde ubeeloso muutu mu ilumbu hya saba. Bo baakasa buna mu usaha buni bo bubahila nde tooni. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ka Yisu aba ayaba matsimi ma bo. Nde ni uleele bahala li kaka la mbahala laaba lavolo: «Teleme, na baa ŋa, ŋa hati la baatu.» Bahala laatelimi na laaba ŋana. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Na Yisu aleeli bo: «Me ndi mu upfuula benu, huli na muswa mu ilumbu hya saba mu uvanga lilibwe buuve lilibi; mu ufuuhasa muvumu a muutu tso mu unyambasana nde?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yisu atali bo boosi, na aleeli huli bahala: «Laba kaka la we!» Nde ni usa buuna, na kaka la nde ni ubeeloho. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ka milongisi mi mikele na Bafarisi baakwidi kesi, na ubaalelesene ma bukutala Yisu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu asooli kuumi na biluumbi byole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1">Mty 5.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3.13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mu taangu yina, Yisu avaati isyelo mu uyasambila, na asambili Nzambi butsuhu bwosi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Bu busi bwakiidi, nde ateeli bayihi ba nde boosi na asooli kuumi na boole ŋa hati la bo, nde aviidi bo nduhi biluumbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Manduhi ma bo: Simoni wu nde haluhi Peetelo, Andele muhehe a Simoni, Yaki, Yowani, Filipo, Batolomayi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Mataayi, Toma, Yaki mwaana a Alafe, Simoni nga kuumbu mu Zelote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zelote: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nga lehemene, nga litondo li lilahi mu misamu mya tsi a nde.</char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yude mwaana a Yaki, na Yuda Isikaryoti wu asumbisi Yisu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu akalongese baatu na ubeeloso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mty 4.23-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-11">Mlk 3.7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yisu bu hakakulamana isyelo na bayihi ba nde, nde atsikimi ŋa mbuha mosi yi idede ŋa hwaba konge yinene yi bayihi ba nde. Hwaba ka na baatu ba banzuhisini ba baamati hu itaanzi hyoosi hya Yuda, hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, na baa misyenge mya Tiilo na Sidoni mi myaba mu muvanga mubu. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Baatu mo baana baayidi mu uyuha nde, na mana nde abeeloso bo mu mabeedu ma bo. Baatu ba mavupu ma mabi maakakwamisa, baabeeluhi. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Baatu boosi baakasaha ubembe Yisu, mu tooni ati matwala mamosi maakapala mu nde na maakabeeloso bo boosi.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ayihisi mu mambu ma makinya na ma lingebe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mty 5.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yisu atali bayihi ba nde, na aleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Kinya huli benu biyaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">ipfumu hi mayulu hili hya benu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Kinya huli benu baa lili na nzala mu taangu yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">ka benu sa liywata!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Kinya huli benu baa lili mu ulila taangu yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">benu sa lisyebe!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Kinya homo huli benu tso baatu bali mu ubele benu, bali mu unyasula benu, bali mu utuha benu na ubaakusa benu, mu tooni a Mwana a muutu. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Mu ilumbu mo hina, baani mu kinya na mwesaani musaangu mu ukina, musyendo wu munene li mu ukeele benu hu yulu. Ni buuna bakaaha ba bo baakakwamisa mimbihuli.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Tsyembili huli benu bisina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">benu laamitswamina ukaanga mbombisili a benu!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Lingebe huli benu baa lamikuha mu byosi taangu yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">benu sa libaha nzala!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Lingebe huli benu baa lili mu usyebe taangu yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">benu sa liba mu bukwili na benu sa lilila!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Lingebe huli benu tso baatu boosi bali mu utoyo bubwe mu benu, ni bumosi ka bakaaha ba bo baakaleele mu mimbihuli mi mapfuta!»<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu akayihasa mu litondo li baboho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:39-47">Mty 5.39-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Benu baa lili mu uyuha me, me ndeele benu bu: tondwaani baboho baa benu; baasaani lilibwe huli ba bali mu ubelele benu. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Syemaani ba bali mu usinga benu; sambilaani Nzambi mu ba bali mu ukwamisa benu. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Tso muutu teti we lipali mu tama la mbahala, bwetehele nde kaka tama lina. Muutu avolo iyunga hya we, a liha nde mu uvolo ka simiisi a we ve. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Pasi muutu wu uvondo we iloho, va nde hyo. Na tso muutu voli hya we, a kaamba nde hyo ve. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Ma benu litondi ti bakima bavangila benu, vaangaani bumosi ka huli bo.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Tso benu libaatondo ndulu baa bubaatondo benu, ki tsalu benu luubaha? Banga masumu ka babaatondo baa bubaatondo bo. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Na tso benu libavangila lilibwe ndulu huli baa bubaavangila benu lilibwe, ki tsalu benu luubaha? Banga masumu bomo ka bali mu usa buuna. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Na tso benu libasombese huli bo baana ba benu libaakeele ti bafutala benu, ki tsalu benu libaakeele? Banga masumu ka bubasombesene bomo na bomo, mana mumosi afutala wuna bi iteesi mo hina. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ka baatondwaani baboho baa benu, baasiilaani bo ma mabwe, baasombesaani hwavele ubaakeele ti bafutala benu. Buna musyendo a benu sa aba wu munene. Benu sa liba baana ba Nzambi a Pungu, mu tooni ati nde li wu mubwe huli banga nyinga na banga bukanyi.<verse eid="LUK 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A litsundasa bambaahi ve</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mty 7.1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />«Kwilaani lingebe we bu Taata a benu haluula mu kwili lingebe. <verse eid="LUK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />A litsundasa ve, mana Nzambi a hatsundasa benu ka. A lisyembe ve, baasaani bana kolo-kolo, mana Nzambi asa benu ka kolo-kolo. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Vaani, na Nzambi sa ava benu. Sa basyeholo hyetso hi hyafulala, hi hyakomo hutso bihode bya benu. Mu tooni ati Nzambi sa afutala benu hyetso hi benu libaava bambaahi.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yisu abweleele bo kuma moyi: «Bee inzimana utwala ubita inzimana na nde? Naana! Inzimana utwala ubita inzimana na nde ve; bo baboole sa babwa hutso iyuna. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Musalili a haluta pfumu a nde ve. Ka pasi musalili wu ayiha sa aba we pfumu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Mu hima we li mu umono isyesyele hi hili mutso a diisu la mwaana a ngu a we, hwavele utala kuunzi li lili mutso a diisu la we? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Buuve, buni we utwala uleele mwaana a ngu a we: “Nyaha me maasa isyesyele hi hili mutso a diisu la we!” Ka we mwakulu mutso a la we na kuunzi? We nga muwala, maatswamina umaasa kuunzi li lili mutso a diisu la we, titswene we mono bubwe mu umaasa isyesyele hi hili mutso a diisu la mwaana a ngu a we.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muti na mbutu a nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-21">Mty 7.16-21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-37">12.33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />A huli na muti wu mubwe, wu ubaabuta mbutu yimbi ve. A huli na muti wu mubi, wu utwala ubuta mbutu yimbwe ve. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Mu tooni ati, pasi muti ubayabaana mu mbutu a nde. A bubaakoolo bafiinge mu yulu matsyende ve. Bumosi kaka, utwala ukoolo mbutu a vinye mutso miti mi ifundi ve. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Muutu wu mubwe ubamweese mavaanga ma mabwe ma mali hutso iswehili hi ibwe hi hili mu nde. Muutu wu mubi ubamweese mavaanga ma mabi ma mali hutso mutima a nde. Munywa a muutu ubapalisa mambu ma maluula hutso iswehili hi ibi hi hili mu nde.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuungili yimbwe na yimbi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mty 7.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Mu hima benu libaateele me: “Pfumu! Pfumu!” – Na benu a libaayuhala me ve? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Me tsa mweese benu naana muutu wu uya huli me hafwanina, wu ubaayuha mambu ma me na usalila mo. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Nde li mu ufwanina na muutu mumosi wu atunga nzo a nde. Muutu mowuna avahi hu hati a tsina natee hu manya, atelimisi yene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yene: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">isyengi hi mamanya hiba baatelemese bibaha bya nzo a sima. </char></note> ŋa yulu a manya. Mu ilumbu hi nzali haluli, nyamba yayidi, mamba maayabwa mu nzo na mifudi. Ka nyamba a yatwali unyingasa nzo ve, mu tooni ati, baatungi yo bu hwafwana. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ka muutu wu ubaayuha mambu ma me, hwavele usalila mo, nde afwanina na muutu wu atunga nzo hwavele utelemese yo ŋa yulu a manya. Mu ilumbu hi nzali haluuli, nyamba bu yabwidi mu nzo, mu mawasa, yo yabwidi, na “yatsamuhi tsaa”.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu mibelooso musalili a mukuutu a kama li masadaadu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mty 8.5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:46-54">Yow 4.46-54</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Bu Yisu hamani uleele mambu mo maniima mosi huli baatu ba baababaadiinga nde, nde ayeni hu musyenge a Kapernahumi. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Huuna, hwaba na mukuutu a kama li masadaadu, wu aba na musalili mumosi wu nde haba hatondo. Musalili mo wuuna abeedi na ubeele hwa ŋa pedu lipfu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Bu nde hayuhi tsangu a Yisu, nde atsindihi mwaana kabu li bakuutu ba Bayudaayo, mana bayalembesene nde mu uyabeeloso musalili a nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Bo baayato ŋa hwaba Yisu, baayayini nde: «Ufwani ti ni we uva bahala moli likumbasa, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />mu tooni ati, nde atondo tsi a bisu. Nde ni wu atunga nzo a bisu yi lisambulu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yisu ayeni na bo. Bu bo batoodi bebele na nzo mukuutu mo, nde atsindihi bambaahi ba nde huli Yisu mu uleele nde: «Pfumu, amono nzuhu ve mu tooni ati, me andi wakuha ti we koto mu nzo a me ve. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ni mu buuna, me wu aveleyelemene pelinza me mwakulu mu uyamonehele na we. Ka leele dyaambu limosi, na musalili a me sa abeeloho. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Mu tooni ati, me mwakulu ndi hu tsina lituma li bakuutu ba me. Ka me kaka na masadaadu hutso lituma la me, na me undeele huli mumosi mu bo: “Yene!” – Na nde yeni. Na huli mukima: “Yanga!” – Na nde yidi. Huli muviha a me, me undele: “Sa bu!” – Na nde siidi.»<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yisu ayuha mambu mo maana, nde asilisi mukuutu masadaadu. Nde akinguhi huli konge yi yakaduukala nde, na aleeli: «Me ndeele benu, tso hu Isereli, me a hamoni imiinu hya pila moyi ve.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Bambaahi baa mukuutu bafutihi hu nzo a nde, na baayabiisa musalili a nde amiibeeloho.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu asuuli mu lipfu mwaana mukwili wu mukaasu hu Nayini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ilumbu hi hyaduuki, Yisu ayeni hu musyenge wa nduhi Nayini. Bayihi ba nde na konge yinene baakayene na nde mu nzila. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Bu nde hatoodi bebele na musyenge, nde abwani konge a baatu yi yakayadiiha mwaana mukwili. Mwana mo aba livingu la bahala. Bisu bula ba banzuhisini baakaduukala ngu a mwaana.<verse eid="LUK 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Pfumu amoni mukwili na aluuli mu lingebe mu nde, na aleeli: «Nyaha ubwe lila!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Titswene, nde ayasusaha na abembi kasu. Ba baakabita yo baatsikimi. Nde aleeli: «mupfudu-mbahala! Me tumi we, teleme!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Na mwaana wu akwa atsahili, abaandihi utoyo. Yisu afutili nde huli ngu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bu baatu baamoni maana, boosi baakiinzi na bayusi Nzambi. Bo baakaleele: «Mumbihuli wu munene mimonele ŋa hati la bisu. Nzambi miyakumbasa baatu ba nde.» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Musamu mo wunuuwu atsaamuhi itaanzi hya Yuda hyoosi, natee mu mala ma ibiingi hina hyoosi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowani Mutondihi li mu ufuula hyuhu huli Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-6">Mty 11.2-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Bayihi ba Yowani baayabisi nde moosi ma makavyoho. Yowani ni uteele boole ŋa hati la bo. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Nde ni utsindaha bo huli Pfumu mu ufula: «We ni Masiya wu afwana uya, vo bisu lafwana ukeele mukima?»<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Bo bato huli Yisu, bo ni uleele nde: «Yowani Mutondihi mitsindaha bisu huli we mu ufuula we bu, “We ni Masiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Masiya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ni nde wuna, wu mimbihuli mi Bayudaayo myayabisi ti Nzambi sa atsindaha huli bo mu uyobolo bo. </char></note> wu afwana uya, vo bisu lafwana ukeele mukima?”» <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Ka mu taangu mo yiina, Yisu abeelusi baatu ba banzuhisini: babeedu, bikata, na banga mavupu ma mabi. Na nde abeelusi ka binzimana bi bilahi.<verse eid="LUK 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yisu afutili bo: «Ya yabisaani Yowani ma benu limiimono, na ma benu limiiyuha. Binzimana bili mu umono, bikata bili mu uteleme na uyene, banga bwatsi bali mu utsyeme, bikwa-matswi bili mu uyuha, babaakwa bali mu usuuha, na biyaha bili mu uyuha musamu wu mubwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Kinya yili na muutu wuna wu uvelebwisa imiinu hya nde mu tooni a me.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbangi mu tooni a Yowani mu tondihi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:7-11">Mty 11.7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Biluumbi bya Yowani bu byafutihi, Yisu abwidi mu utoyo mu tooni a Yowani huli konge a baatu: «Benu hima layatala hu kumu? Litsotso li ifula hili mu unyingasa? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ka benu na laayamono? Muutu walwata bikutu bibibwe? Naana! Ba bubaalwata bikutu bibibwe na babali hutso busina, ubaatsahala hutso bibaanga bi batumi. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ka na benu laayamono? Mumbihuli? Eye, me ndeele benu, wa luta paa mumbihuli. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Yowani, nde wuna wu baasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“Mono, me tsa tsindaha iluumbi hya me hu busu bwa we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">mu uvangila nzila a we.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Me ndeele benu ti ŋa hati la baatu a huli wu alutaala Yowani ve. Ka wuli ikenyi mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi, alutaala nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Baatu boosi, na paa bakaambi ba limandu baayuhi ndongisili a Yowani. Bo baasilisi ti Nzambi li wakuha, na baayaki tondihili a Yowani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ka Bafarisi na milongisi mi mikele baanyasuli hwa bo litondo la Nzambi, na baabisi tondihili a Yowani.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Baatu ba taangu moyi, na baana me utwala ufwanisa bo? Bo na baana baafwanina? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bo baafwana we baana ba bangebe ba baatsahala ŋa saandu, ba bali mu utelesene na bali mu uleele: “Bisu lafulili benu munzololo, benu a laakini ve! Bisu layimbili benu nyimbu yi ikwili, benu a laalili ve.” <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Bu Yowani Mutondihi hayidi, nde lipa udya ve, nde malamu unywa ve, na benu lili mu uleele: “Tengo lamilwata nde.” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana a muutu miiya. Nde li mu udya, nde li mu unywa, na benu lili mu uleele: “Monwaani bahala moli, nga mubaka na ikolo-mbungu! Nde wu, mbaahi bakaambi ba limandu na baatu banga masumu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ka baatu ba bubaadyata we buhuli tsiki a Nzambi, bu baamweese imbuli hya tsiki mo yiina.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu asiidi mukaasu wu imbembo kolo-kolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mufarisi mumosi atsihi Yisu mu uya dya huli nde. Yisu akoti mu nzo Mufarisi, na atsahili ŋa metse. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Mu musyenge mowuna, hwaba na mukaasu mumosi wu imbembo. Nde ayaabi ti Yisu aba mu udya mu nzo Mufarisi. Nde abehi itutu hya alabati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">alabati </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manya lilifuka li baakatsula bisiha. </char></note> hi hyaluula mu nyafi. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Na nde avyohi Humbisa a Yisu bebele a miilu mya nde, abaandihi ulila. Matsanga ma nde maabolisi miilu mya Yisu, na nde akombili myo mu naanga a nde. Nde abumbi miilu mya Yisu, na ayitili myo nyafi. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Mufarisi wu ateeli Yisu mu udya amono buuna, aleeli hutso mutima a nde: «Tso muutu mo wunuuwu beedi mumbihuli wa mbuli, kini nde kiyaba na li mukaasu wu mibembe nde, na mbiili a nde. Nde kiyaba ti mukaasu mo wunuuwu imbembo ali.»<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yisu afutili huli Mufarisi: «Simoni, me na dyaambu li uleele we.» Simoni afutili: «Eye Mulongisi, leele lo.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yisu ti: «Baatu boole baaba na mukanu a muutu mumosi. Watsomi aba asombo biteesi maakama mataanu (500) ma makuta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bakuta </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu taangu mo yiina likuta limosi aba pfuta a isalu hi muyilala.</char></note>. Waboole aba asombo biteesi maku mataanu ma bakuta. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ka bu baaveli na bakuta baa ufuta, musombisi asiidi bo kolo-kolo na anyahuli mukanu a bo. Mu ma we matsimi, na mu bo baboole nde hafula utondo?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni afutili: «Me tsimi, ni wu mukanu hafulala bunene.» Yisu afutili nde: «We miikese dyaambu bu hwafwana.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Titswene Yisu akinguhi huli mukaasu, na aleeli huli Simoni: «We li mu umono mukaasu mo wunuuwu? Bu me koti mu nzo a we, we a vidi me mamba ma uswaha miilu mya me ve. Ka mukaasu mo wunuuwu swahi miilu mya me mu matsanga ma nde, na nde kombili myo mu naanga a nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />We a buumbi me ve, ka nde, umata bu me anzakoto, nde a hakolo mu ubaaviva miilu mya me ve. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />We a tsatsili me maadi hu yulu mutswe a me ve, ka nde puhili nyafi mu miilu mya me. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ni mu buuna, me ndeeli ti nde miyaka linyahula li masumu ma nde ma malahi, mu tooni ati nde mweesi litondo li lilahi. Ka huli wu bali mu unyahula hole, ubamweese litondo la hole.»<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Na Yisu aleeli huli mukaasu: «We miyaka linyahula li masumu ma we.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Baatu ba baaba ŋa metse bu baayuhi maana, baakalelesene mu mitima mya bo: «Nde wu na! Wuli mu uyehele unyahula paa masumu?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ka Yisu aleeli huli mukaasu: «Imiinu hya we hi mifuuhasa we, yene mu hyenze.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ba baakaduukala Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:40-41">Mlk 15.40-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Humbisa a maana, Yisu akataangila misyenge na mala. Huuna nde akalongese na uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe wu Ipfumu hya Nzambi. Biluumbi bya nde kuumi na byole byaba na nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Hwaba ka na bakaasu ba baabeeluhi mu mavupu ma mabi, na mu mabeedu ma pila mu pila, bo ka baaba na nde. Mariya muusi Magadala, wu Yisu hapalisi matengo tsambu mu nde, aba ka na bo. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Mukima Zana mukadi a Kuza, ikanga-koome hya nzo a Eloode, mukima ka Suzaana, na bakima ba baakahwadisa Yisu na bayihi ba nde mu mbahili yi bo baaba na yo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuma yi mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mty 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4.1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Bu konge a baatu yinene yi yamaati hu pasi musyenge, ya yadiinga Yisu, nde atiidi bo kuma moyi: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Hwaba na muutu mumosi wu ayeni hu ngundu a nde hu unyanza muhunu. Bu nde hakanyanza mbutu, mbutu yina yabwidi mu musoho, baadyati yo, na banyunyi baadiidi yo. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Mbutu kima yabwidi ŋa yulu a manya. Mbutu bu yameni, mitswihala myakanyi mu tooni ati a myabahi mamba ve. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Mbutu kima yabwidi hutso bangamba, bu byakuli itwadi, bangamba baaswekimisi mitswihala. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ka mbutu kima yabwidi hunaa ŋa toto a mbolese. Bu yameni, na yabuti mbutu kama kama.» Na Yisu asyenuli ndaha: «Muutu nga matswi ma uyuha, ayuha!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu hima Yisu ali mu uta makuma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mty 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4.10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Bayihi ba Yisu baafuuli nde mbindulili a kuma mo yiina. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yisu aleeli huli bo: «Huli benu Nzambi amiiva bungodu bu uyaba matswehi ma Ipfumu hya nde. Ka huli baatu bakima, me ndi mu unzabisa bo mo mu makuma, mana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">“Tso bo baatala, bo umono ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">na tso bo baayuha, bo utsikaha ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Esa 6.9</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abinduli kuma mukuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />«Mbindulili a kuma mo yiniiyi: muhunu ni mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Mbutu yi yabwidi mu muvanga a musoho, ni baatu ba bali mu uyuha mambu ma Nzambi. Ka Mukuyi ubayamaasa mo mu mitima mya bo, mana bo bavelesa hiitu na bavelefuuha. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Mbutu yi yabwidi ŋa yulu a manya, ni baatu babali mu uyuha mambu ma Nzambi na babaayaka mo na kinya. Ka bo a bali na manganzi ve, imiinu hya bo hili hya taangu yi keehe. Ŋa taangu lobese, bo bamiitimba byosi. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Mbutu yi yabwidi ŋatso matsyende, ni baatu ba bubayuha mambu ma Nzambi. Mu mambu ma idiingu hya bo ma we minyongi, busina na makinya ma tsi, bibaakwamisa bo mana bo bavelebuta mbutu yi yayele. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Titswene, mbutu yi yabwidi ŋa toto ya mbolese, ni baatu baana ba bubaayuha mambu ma Nzambi. Bo ba baakaanga mo mutso mitima mi mibwe na mya mbuli. Mu mukonono a bo, bo bali mu ubuta mbutu.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu atiidi kuma a mwinda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mlk 4.21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Muutu a hubabaangisa mwinda mu uswehe nde hutso itehili, buuve mu ususa nde hu tsina a taangi ve. Ka bubaasuusa nde ŋa isuusili hya nde hi hyasyenoho, mana baatu ba bu ukoto mu nzo bamono liyalala. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Ka pasi isiha hi hyasweme, sa himonehele ŋa liyalala. Na moosi ma maaswemene, sa mayabaana. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ni buuna, baakebaani bu benu libaayuha misamu. Mu tooni ati, sa babwese uva huli woosi wu amiibaha. Ka huli wu avele na isiha, tso bi nde hamiisa hiitu mu ubaha, sa bapatula.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibandu hya Yisu hya mbuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mty 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3.31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Ngu a Yisu na baana ba ngu a nde baayidi hu uyamono nde, ka a baamoni nde ve mu tooni a konge a baatu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Ni mu buuna, baatu baayabisi Yisu: «Ngu a we na baana ba ngu a we bali hu mbadi, na batondi umono we.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ka Yisu afutili bo: «Ngu a me na baana ba ngu a me, ni baana boosi ba bubaayuha mambu ma Nzambi na baa bubaasalila mo.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu avudimisi ifula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:18">Mty 8.18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4.35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Ilumbu himosi, Yisu akoti mu bootehe na bayihi ba nde. Nde aleeli bo: «Tswendaani hu simu lina la dyanga.» Buuna, bo baayeni. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Bu bo baakayene mu bootehe, Yisu abwamini tolo. Bu baaba mu dyanga, masulubete, ifula hi mifudi hyayabwa. Bootehe laluuli mu mamba na bo baaba mu pasi yi lipfu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Bayihi bayasusaha ŋa pedu a Yisu, na baaleeli: «Mulongisi! Mulongisi! Bisu likwi!» Yisu asuuhi, apamini ifula na mapo. Ifula na mapo byakulimini, na byasiidi «swi». <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Buuna, Yisu aleeli bayihi ba nde: «Imiinu hya benu, ka hya hyo?» Ka bo baamoni tsisu na kimuhili, na bo baakalelesene: «Ki pila a muutu wu, wu ubaatuma ifula na mapo bibaayuhala nde?»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abeelusi muutu nga matengo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mty 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5.1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yisu na bayihi ba nde, bu baasabuhi dyanga la Ngalili te hu simu lina, bo baayato hu itaanzi hya Ngelaseneya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Bu Yisu hakasutaha mu bootehe, muutu mumosi mu musyenge mo wuuna wu matengo maaba maamilwata, ayabwana na nde. Umata beleve, nde a hakabwelwata bikutu ve. Nde a hakabwetsahala hutso a nzo ve, ka ndulu hu mapembe.<verse eid="LUK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28-29" />Ka mataangu ma malahi, tengo moli laakakaanga nde. Ni mu buuna, mu uliha nde mu ubaayene, baaba bakuta nde mapanga na uhada nde bitali mu miilu. Ka nde akabaakese byo. Tengo lakabaabita nde hu kumu a nzala. Bu muutu mo hamoni Yisu, nde ayami, na nde ayabwa ŋa miilu mya Yisu. Yisu atumi tengo mu upala mu muutu mo wunuuwu. Muutu mo aleeli mu mifudi myosi: «Bisu a we ki tooni, Yisu Mwana a Nzambi a Pungu? Kolo-kolo a we, a hakwamisa me ve.»<verse eid="LUK 8:28-29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yisu afuuli nde: «Nduhi a we na?» Nde afutili: «Nduhi a me “konge”.» Nde hafutili buuna mu tooni ati, konge matengo yaba yakoto mu nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Mihisi mo miina myayayini Yisu mana nde aveletuma myo mu uyene hu mbeenge ya doheselee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mbeenge ya doheselee </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbeenge a mbaahu buuve mbungulu, kondaayi mihisi. </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ka ŋa pedu a ŋana, hwaba na konge yinene yi bangulu yi yaba mu udya ŋa yulu isyelo. Matengo mayayini Yisu mu uva mo muswa mu ukoto mutso bangulu mo baana, nde asiingisi mo. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Buuna matengo maapali mu bahala mo lina, na maayakoto mu bangulu. Na konge bangulu yoosi, yayabungamana hu tsina isyelo natee hutso a dyanga, na yadyami «ndwi».<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Bakeelisi babangulu bamono ma maavyohi, baabati, na baayayabisa musamu hutso musyenge mo na mu mala. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Baatu bubaayidi hu yamono ma maavyohi, bo bato ŋa Yisu haba, baamoni muutu wu matengo maapali mu nde. Nde aba atsahala ŋa miilu mya Yisu, nde aba alwata bubwe, matsimi ma nde mafutihi ŋa mbuha. Bu bo baamoni nde, bo baaba na boomo. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Ba baamoni ma maavyohi, baayabisi bo buni nga matengo hayobihi.<verse eid="LUK 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ni mu buuna, bisu Ngelesaneya boosi baabahi boomo bu bulahi. Na baayavondo Yisu mu utahuha na bo. Nde abwekoto mu bootehe na afutihi. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Muutu mo wu ayobihi mu matengo, afuuli Yisu tso nde utwala uyene na nde. Ka Yisu afutili na aleeli nde: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Futaha hu nzo a we, na yayabisa moosi ma Nzambi amiisiila we.» Na muutu mo ayeni mu uyayabisa mu musyenge woosi ma Yisu hasiidi nde.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu asuuli mwaana a Yayiro mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mty 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5.21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Bu Yisu hayafutaha, konge yinene yayaki nde, mu tooni ati boosi baakakeele nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Na bahala limosi nduhi Yayiro wu aba mukuutu a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo ayidi. Nde ayabwa ŋa miilu mya Yisu, na avondi nde mu uyene hu bwa nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Nde haleeli buuna, mu tooni ati, liviingu la mwaana a nde wu mukaasu, wu aba tungi la kuumi na bilima byole, aba ŋa lipfu. Bu nde haba mu dwe huuna, konge a baatu yakavinyala nde.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Hwaba na mukaasu nga bubeedu bu makila: makila maakapuuha nde hwavele ukanya umata bilima kuumi na byole. Na nde amani bya nde byosi huli babuhi, ka tso mumosi mu bo a habeelusi nde ve. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Nde ayasusaha ŋa mbisa a Yisu, na abembi tsoso ikutu hya nde. Mu mawasa, makila ma nde maakanyi. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Na Yisu aleeli: «Na mibembe me?» Bu boosi baakatuna, Peetelo aleeli nde: «Mulongisi, ni konge yi yadiinga we yili mu uvinyala we matsyelo moosi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ka Yisu afutili: «Muutu mibembe me. Me mimono ti mufudi mipala mu me.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Bu mukaasu mo wunuuwu hamoni ti nde a hakibwesweme ve, nde ayasusaha na likamba, na abwi ŋa miilu mya Yisu. Na ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi, nde ayabisi tooni yi nde habembi Yisu, na buni nde habeluhi kidumana. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Mwana a me, imiinu hya we hi mifuuhasa we, yene mu hyenze.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Bu nde hakatoyo, muutu mumosi amati huli mukuutu a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, ayidi na ayaleele: «Mwana a we mikwa, nyaha ubwekwamisa mulongisi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Ka Yisu bu hayuhi buuna, aleeli Yayiro: «A haba na boomo ve! Sa ndulu hiitu mu Nzambi, na nde sa afuuha.»<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Bu Yisu hayato hu nzo a Yayiro, nde a hasingisi pasi muutu mu ukoto na nde ve. Ka ndulu Peetelo, Yowani na Yaki, na taata na ngu a mwaana baakoti na nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Baatu boosi baakalila na baaba mu lingebe mu tooni a mwaana. Ka, Yisu aleeli: «A lilila ve, nde a hakwa ve, ka nde tolo ali.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Na bo baakakwede nde, bo baaba baayaba ti nde amiikwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ka Yisu akaangi mwaana mu hoho, na aleeli mu mifudi: «Mwana a me, teleme!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Muvumu a mwaana ayafutaha: mu mawasa mwaana asuuhi na atelimi. Yisu atumi mu uva nde byudya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ngu na taata a mwaana baakimuhi hu unzuhisini, na Yisu alihi bo mu uveleyabisa pasi muutu ma maavyohi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu mitsindaha kuumi na biluumbi byole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-9">Mty 10.1-9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:6-13">Mlk 6.6-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yisu bu hakungi kuumi na biluumbi byole, aviidi byo matwala na lituma mu ubingasa matengo moosi, na mu ubeeloso mabeedu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Nde atsindihi byo mu uyalongese mambu ma Ipfumu hya Nzambi, na ubeeloso babeedu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Nde aleeli byo: «A li volo pasi isiha mu tooni mudyenge ve: tso huli likaanda, tso huli koome, tso huli lipa, tso huli mbongo. Na a liba na bikutu byole ve. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Mu pasi nzo yi benu lu ukoto, kwilalaani mu yo, natee bu benu lu upala mu musyenge mo wuuna. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Tso baatu a bayaki benu ve, ŋa benu lu upala mu musyenge mo wuuna, kubalaani mufundu a miilu mya benu. Sa huba nzibusili huli bo.»<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Biluumbi byayeni, byo byakavyoho mutso a mala moosi, byakayabisa musamu wu mubwe na byakabeeloso babeedu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eloode li mu usaha uyaba Yisu na ali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mty 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-16">Mlk 6.14-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Eloode mutumi a Ngalili akayuha mambu moosi ma Yisu hakavaanga, ni mu buuna nde haba tsika-tsikaa. Baatu baakaleele ti Yowani mu Tondihi asuuhi mu ba baakwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Baatu bakima ti nde ni mumbihuli Eliya amiibweya, bakima ka ti nde ni mumosi ŋa hati li mimbihuli mya tsikulu miisuuha. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ka Eloode akaleele: «Me atumi ukese Yowani mutswe. Ka wu na, wu me ndi mu unzuha misamu momi?» Na Eloode akasaha mu umono nde.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abungili biveeve bitaanu bya baatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mty 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6.30-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Bu biluumbi byayafutaha, bo baayabisi Yisu moosi ma bo bavangi. Nde abiti bo, na avengimi na bo hu tsyelo musyenge wa nduhi Betesayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Bu makonge maayabi buuna, mo maaduukili Yisu. Nde ayaki mo, na nde akayambila mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi. Yisu abeelusi ka boosi ba baaba na mabeedu. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Bu busi bwakulimini, biluumbi kuumi na byole byayasusaha ŋa pedu a Yisu, na byaleeli nde: «Futala konge moyi, mana yo yiyene mu mala ma bebele na mu bitsaka mu uyasaha mbuha yi ubwamina na byudya. Mu tooni ati, bisu a benu ŋa ive na ive lili.»<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Yisu aleeli byo: «Vaani bo byudya benu mwakulu.» Ka bo baafutili: «Bisu lili ndulu na mapa mataanu na batswi boole. Ka bisu liyasumbala baatu moba boosi byudya?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Bo baaleeli buuna mu tooni ati, hwaba ŋana biveeve bitaanu (5 000) bi babahala. Yisu aleeli bayihi ba nde: «Tsahisaani bo mu mabuli ma maku mataanu ma baatu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Biluumbi ni uvanga bu Yisu hatumi. Na bo baatsahisi bo boosi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yisu avoli mapa mataanu na batswi boole. Asimbuli miisu hu yulu, na afutili matondo huli Nzambi mu byo. Titswene, nde akesi byo, na aviidi byo huli bayihi mu ukabila konge yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Baatu bosi badiidi we bu hwafwana na baywati. Biluumbi baatsonzihi byebe kuumi na byole bi bitsudu bi byasaali.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo mileele ti Yisu ni Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-21">Mty 16.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-31">Mlk 8.27-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Yisu bu haba ŋa muvanga mu usambila, bayihi baaba itwadi na nde. Nde afuuli bayihi ba nde: «Mu uyuha bitoyili bya baatu, ti na me ndi?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bo baafutili: «Bamosi bali mu uleele ti, we Yowani Mutondihi we li, bakima ti, we Eliya we li; bakima kaka ti, we mumosi mu mimbihuli we li.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Nde aleeli huli bo: «Ka benu, buni lileeli, ti me na me ndi?» Peetelo afutili: «We ni Masiya wu Nzambi hatsindaha.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yisu atumi bo mu mifudi mu uveleyabisa musamu wu huli pasi muutu. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Na nde abinduli ti: «Hwafwana ti Mwana a muutu amono pasi yindahi. Bapfumu, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele sa banyanza nde. Hwafwana ti baduba nde, na nde sa asuuha mu lipfu mu ilumbu hi bitatu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buni mu udukala Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Mty 16.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Mlk 8.34–9.1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Titswene, Yisu aleeli bo boosi: «Tso muutu tondi uduukala me, anyaha utsima ma nde mwakulu, nde abita kuruwa a nde pasi ilumbu, na aduukala me. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ni mu buuna, pasi nde wu atondo ufuuhasa muvumu a nde, sa anyambasana nde. Ka pasi nde wu unyambasana muvumu a nde mu tooni a me sa afuuhasa nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ki kaluha muutu hubaha tso nde bahi toto yoosi, na uvinda muvumu a nde? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Pasi nde wu uba na tsonyi mu tooni a me, buuve mu tooni a mambu ma me, Mwana a muutu sa amonele nde ka tsonyi. Nde umoneele nde tsonyi. Nde umoneele nde tsonyi bu nde hu uya hutso muyusu a nde, na hutso muyusu a Taata na wu bapofi bangidi. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Mu mbuli, me ndeele benu, mwaana kabu la baatu bakima babali ŋa, a bukwa ve, hwavele umono Ipfumu hya Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muyusu a Mwana a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mty 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mlk 9.2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Bu Yisu hamani utoyo, bilumbu poombo byavyohi. Yisu avoli Peetelo, Yowani na Yaki, na bavaati hu yulu isyelo mu uyasambila Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Bu Yisu hakasambila, hiinzi hya nde hyakimbuhi, na ikutu hya nde hyafuuki lifuuku li mifudi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Na babahala boole baakamoho na nde, aba Moose na Eliya. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bo bamonihili hutso muyusu a bo, na bo baakayambila mu tsukusu isalu hya Yisu mu mambu ma lipfu la nde hu musyenge a Yeruselemi.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Peetelo na bambaahi ba nde ba boole baaba hutso a tolo li mifudi. Na bu bo baasuuhi, bo baamoni muyusu a Yisu na babahala boole ba baaba baateleme na nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Mu taangu yi bakiikabuha na Yisu, Peetelo ni uyaleele nde: «Mulongisi, hu li bubwe ti bisu a benu libaani ŋaniiŋa. Bisu sa litelemese bitudu bitatu. Imosi hya we, imosi hya Moose na imosi hya Eliya.» Ka Peetelo a hakayaba ma nde hakaleele ve.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Bu nde haba mu utoyo buuna, yidu layafuha bo. Na bayihi baabahi boomo, bu bo baakoti hutso a yidu. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Na hutso a yidu, ndaha mosi yapali na yaleeli: «Nde wu ni Mwana a me wu me atsoolo, yuhalaani nde!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Bu ndaha yayuhini, Yisu asaali ndulu nde siha. Bayihi baaswehi musamu wuna, na mu taangu mo yiina, a baayabisi nde huli pasi muutu ve.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso mwaana nga livupu lilibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mty 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mlk 9.14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ilumbu hi hyaduuki, Yisu na bayihi ba nde baakulimini hu tsina isyelo. Konge a baatu yinene yayabwana nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ŋa hati la konge, bahala limosi lafulihi: «Mulongisi, kolo-kolo a we, tala ati mwaana a me, me nde ni livingu. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Livupu lilibi libaabwa mu nde, lo libaatuma nde mu ubaafulaha. Lo libanyingasa nde mu mifudi, na ubapalisa nde mafudi mu munywa. Lo ubaanyahula nde mu pasi, na lo libaakolese nde hu unzuhisini ŋa yulu unyongese nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Me ambondili bayihi ba we mu ubinga lo, ka bo a batwali ve.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yisu aleeli: «Benu, ki pila a baatu babavele na imiinu, baa libaavaanga bubi. Natee ki taangu me apfwana uba na benu na ukunda benu? Behe mwaana a we ŋa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Bu mwaana hakayasusaha, tengo laabwisi nde ŋa toto, na lanyingisi nde mu mifudi. Ka Yisu afwengili tengo, abeelusi mwaana na afutili nde huli taata a nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Na baatu boosi baamoni matwala ma Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yisu abweyabisa lipfu la nde</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mty 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Bo boosi baakimuhi. Bu baatu boosi baakakimuha mu moosi ma Yisu hakavaanga, Yisu aleeli bayihi ba nde: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Yuhaani bubwe ma me undeele benu: Mwana a muutu sa bayeholo nde ŋa myoho mi baambeene.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ka ma Yisu hakayabisa bayihi, bo a baakatsikaha mo ve. Bo a baakatsikaha ve, mu tooni ati tsiki a mo yaba yasweme mana bo baveletsikaha. Bo baaba na boomo mu ufuula nde mu tooni a mambu mo maana.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muutu wu afula bukuutu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mty 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk 9.33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Bayihi baakatsundana ŋa hati la bo mu wu afula bukuutu. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yisu bu hayabi matsimi ma bo, nde avoli ikenyi, na asuusi hyo ŋa pedu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Na nde aleeli: «Pasi muutu wu uyaka ikenyi mohi mu nduhi a me, ni me nde ayaki. Na muutu wu miyaka me, miyaka ka wuna wu atsindaha me. Mu tooni ati, wu afula bungebe ŋa hati la benu boosi, ni nde wu afula bukuutu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muutu wu avele muboho a benu, li mbaahi a benu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yowani aleeli: «Mulongisi, bisu lamono muutu wu ubaabinga matengo mu nduhi a we. Na bisu laasaha uliha nde mu ubwevelesa buuna. Mu tooni ati, nde a hali wa kabu la bisu ve.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ka Yisu aleeli nde: «A liliha nde mu usa buuna ve. Mu tooni ati, wu avele muboho a benu, li mbaahi a benu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ka mu uyene hu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ka bu bilumbu bya nzyenili a Yisu hu yulu byaba byaka bebele, nde ataasi uyene hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Nde atehisi utsindaha biluumbi. Bu baaba mu nzila, bo baakoti mu bula bumosi bwa Samariya mu uvangila nde mbuha yi hubwamina. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ka bisu Samariya, baabisi uyaka nde. Bo baabisi uyaka nde, mu tooni ati, nde akayene hu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Bo bamono buuna, boole mu bayihi ba nde, Yaki na Yowani baaleeli: «Pfumu, we tondi ti bisu lituma mbaahu a yulu yibwila baatu moba mana yo yinyengese bo?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ka Yisu akinguha mu utala bo, ni usyembe bo. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Na bo baayeni hu bula bukima.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utimba byosi mu uduukala Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mty 8.19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Bu bo baaba mu nzila, bahala limosi laaleeli Yisu: «Me tsa nduukala we pasi tsyelo yi we uyene.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yisu afutili nde: «Mibahu na biswemili byabo, na banyunyi babaaba na byanza bya bo. Ka Mwana a muutu a hali na mbuha yi uvuma ve.» <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yisu aleeli huli muutu mukima: «Ya duukala me.» Ka muutu mo wunuuwu aleeli nde: «Pfumu, va me muswa me maanzandiiha taata a me.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yisu afutili nde: «Nyaha babaakwa badiiha babaakwa. Na we, yene ya yabisa baatu mambu ma Ipfumu hya Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Mukima ka aleeli nde: «Me tsa nduukala we Pfumu. Ka, maava me muswa mu ufutaha hu uyalanisa ikuta hya me.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yisu afutili nde: «Woosi wu ukaanga ikaanga mu usala ngundu, na ubaabwetala mbisa, a havangama mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi ve.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Isalu hi bayihi maku tsambu na boole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mty 9.37-38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:7-16">10.7-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mlk 6.8-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ŋa yulu ŋana, Pfumu asooli bayihi maku tsambu na boole, na a tsindihi bo boole-boole mu misyenge myosi na mu mambuha ma nde mo hakayene. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nde akaleele bo: «Ngundu yili yinene, ka basali bali babakeehe. Ni mu buuna, vondwaani Pfumu a ngundu, mana nde atsindaha basali mu uyakoolo mbutu mu ngundu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Yenaani! Me ndi mu utsindaha benu we baana ba mameme ŋa hati la miinzi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />A libita paala ve, tso koome, tso bikoodi, na a liva bwehe huli pasi muutu mu nzila ve. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Mu pasi nzo yi benu lu ukoto, maaleelaani ti: “Hyenze hiba mu nzo moyi.” <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Mu nzo yi benu lu ukoto, tso muutu nga hyenze li muuna, hyenze hya benu sa hiba mu nde. Tso a buuna ve, hyo sa hiyafutaha huli benu mo. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Tsahalaani mu nzo mo yiina, dyanaani na nywanaani bi bu uva benu. Mu tooni ati, ngamba afwana na pfuta a nde. A lipala mu nzo mo yiina ve, mu yabwamina mu nzo kima. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Ŋa benu likoti mu musyenge wu buyaka benu, dyanaani byosi bi bu uva benu. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Beeloswaani babeedu baa bu uba mu musyenge mowuna, na leelaani huli boosi: “Ipfumu hya Nzambi hyaka bebele mu uyabyala ŋa yulu a benu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ka mu pasi musyenge wu benu lu ukoto na hu bu uveleyaka benu, palaani mu maluuha, na leelaani: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Bisu limikubalala benu paa mufundu musyenge a benu wu amiikatita mu miilu mya bisu, mu uyibusa benu. Ka yaabaani ti, Ipfumu hya Nzambi hyaka bebele huli benu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Me ndeele benu ti, mu ilumbu hi Nzambi hutsundasa musyenge mowuna, tsyembili a baatu mo baana, sa yifulala ya bisu Sodoomo.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misyenge mi myavelesa imiinu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mty 11.20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Lingebe huli benu bisu Korazini! Lingebe huli bisu Betesayida! Benu sa liba mu lingebe mu tooni ati, tso bipadi byosi bi baasiidi ŋa hati la benu baayasa byo huli bisu Tiilo na bisu Sidoni. Kini basiidi buuna huli bo, kini umata beleve, baatu ba misyenge momina baamiikingula buyedi. Bo baakiimweese lingebe la bo ŋa busu bwa Nzambi mu ulwata basaahu na uyobo mufutu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ulwata basaahu na uyobo mufutu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bilwatili na mbiili Bayudaayo mu taangu bukwili.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ni mu buuna, mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, tsyembili yi benu luuyaka yi uvyohelele ya baatu ba misyenge mya Tiilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Benu bisu Kapernahumi! Benu libaatsima ti Nzambi sa asyenolo benu te hu yulu? Naana! A buna ve. Sa bakulamasa benu natee hu tsi a babaakwa.» <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Nde abweleele huli bayihi ba nde: «Muutu wu uyuhala benu, li mu uyuhala me. Wuli mu unyasula benu, li mu unyasula Nzambi wu atsindaha me.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maku tsambu na bayihi boole baayafutaha huli Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Bayihi maku tsambu na boole baayafutaha mu kinya, na ubaaleele: «Pfumu, paa matengo masiingili bisu, bu likabinga mo mu nduhi a we!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yisu afutili bo: «Me amoni Saatana wu amati hu yulu na abwidi ŋa toto we muvedyavedi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Yuhaani! Me apiidi benu lituma li udyata ŋa yulu bataadi na bangeenge, na uhesolo matwala moosi ma muboho. A huli na isiha hi hyutwala ukwamisa benu ve. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ka a lisa muyali bu mavupu mali mu usiingala benu ve, ka saani muyali bu Nzambi hasonehe manduhi ma benu hu mayulu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ufutala matondo huli Taata a nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mty 11.25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Ndulu mu taangu mo yiina, Livupu la Ngidi laluusi Yisu mu kinya, na nde afulihi: «Taata, Pfumu a yulu na toto, me ndi mu uyusa we mu tooni ati we miimweese huli bikenyi mambu ma we avelimweese huli biyedi. Eye, Taata, ni buuna bu we mwakulu atondo. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Taata a me aviidi me byosi ŋa myoho mya me. A huli na muutu wu uyaba Mwana ni na, tso a ni Taata ve. Na muutu a hayaba Taata ni na, tso a ni Mwana ve, na huli nde wuna ka wu Mwana atondi usaangula lo.» <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Titswene, Yisu akinguhi huli bayihi ba nde na nde aleeli ndulu huli bo: «Kinya huli benu baa lili mu umono mambu ma benu lili mu umono! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ni mu buuna me ndi mu undeele benu, mimbihuli mi milahi na bapfumu baatondi umono mambu ma benu lili mu umono, ka bo a baamono mo ve. Bo baatondi ka uyuha mambu ma benu lili mu uyuha, ka bo a baayuhi mo ve.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuma a musi Samariya wu mubwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Ngeele mikele mumosi, atelimi na afuuli Yisu mu uyebe nde: «Mulongisi, hima me apfwana usa mu ubaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yisu ka afuuli nde: «Buni baasonehe mu mikele? Hima we li mu utaanga muuna?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Ngeele mikele afutili: «We sa tondo Pfumu Nzambi a we mu mutima a we woosi. Mu muvumu a we woosi, mu mifudi mya we myosi, na mu matsimi ma we moosi. We sa tondo muna a we, we we mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Pfu 6.5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yisu aleeli nde: «We futili bubwe! Vanga buuna, na we sa baha moonyi.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ka Ngeele mikele bu hasahi umweese ti hyuhu hya nde hyakuha, nde afuuli Yisu: «Muutu naawe a me na?»<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yisu afutili nde: «Bahala limosi lakamata hu musyenge a Yeruselemi mu ukulamana hu musyenge a Yeriko. Baataani baabwi mu nde, bo baapatuli nde byosi bi nde haba na byo. Titswene bu bo baabeeti nde, baabati, na bo baatimbi nde hutso a nyambu. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Ngaanga a Nzambi mumosi wu aba mu uvyoho mu nzila mo yiina, bu hamoni bahala mo, amiinguhi na avyohi hwa nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Mulevi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mulevi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">musalili a mu nzo a Nzambi.</char></note> ka mumosi wu ayato ŋana, bu hamoni, asabuhi nzila na avyohi hwa nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ka musi Samariya mumosi wu akadyenge, bu hayato ŋa hu aba bahala mo lina, bu hamoni lo, akwili lo lingebe. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Nde ayasusaha, na apuupili mbuma maadi na malamu, na akuti yo birende. Titswene nde avaatisi nde ŋa yulu a buuru a nde mwakulu, abiti nde hu nzo a byenyi, na akumbisi nde mu myosi. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ŋa ngwali, nde apalisi makuta moole, aviidi huli pfumu a nzo, na aleeli: “Kumbasa nde bubwe, bi we usalila ŋa yulu mu tooni a nde, me tsa pfutala we byo ŋa me unzapfutaha.”» <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yisu abweleele: «Mu we, mu bo ba batatu na abeedi “muutu naawe” a muutu wu baataani baabeeti?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ngeele mikele ni ufutala nde ti: «Wuna wa kwili nde lingebe.» Na Yisu ni uleele nde: «Yene, na we ka yasa buuna.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariya na Malata bamiiyaka Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Bu Yisu haba mu nzila na bayihi ba nde, nde akoti ŋa bula bumosi. Ni huuna mukaasu mumosi nduhi Malata, ayaki nde mu nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Nde aba na muhehe nduhi Mariya. Wu ayatsahala ŋa pedu a miilu mya Pfumu, mu uyuha mambu ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Malata aba isalu hya miifulala, mu uvangimasa byudya. Ni mu buuna nde hayidi na aleeli: «Pfumu, a huli mu umweese we pasi bu mwaana a ngu a me amiisiisa me siha mu ubasa byudya ve? Leele nde ayakumbasa me.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Pfumu afutili nde: «Malata, Malata, we li na matsimi helini-helini, we li mu ukina matsada mu bisiha bi bilahi. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ka isiha himosi hiluti tsalu. Mariya amiisoolo uvanga lilibwe, li bu uvelepatula nde.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ulongese baatu usambila Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mty 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Ilumbu imosi, Yisu akasambila ŋa mbuha mosi. Bu nde hamani, muyihi a nde mumosi ni uleele nde: «Pfumu, longese bisu usambila Nzambi, we bu Yowani halongisi bayihi ba nde.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yisu ni uleele bo: «Ŋa benu libaasambila, baaleelaani bu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Taata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">nyaha nduhi a we bakiinza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">nyaha Ipfumu hya we hibaaya!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Byudya bya bisu bya pasi tsuhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:3">va bisu loloyi.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Nyahula masumu ma bisu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">we bu bisu ka libaasa kolo-kolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">huli baa bubaavaanga bisu ma mabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">kaakala bisu mu ukoto mu ma mabi.”»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yisu abweleele bo: «Buhuli muutu mumosi mu benu li na mbaahi, na nde yamono nde hu hahati a busi na uleele nde: “Mbaahi a me, soombese me mapa matatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Mu tooni ati, mumosi mu bambaahi ba me miimata hu mudyenge miya huli me, me andi na hi me upa nde ve.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Na tso wu uli hu hati a nzo futili mbaahi a nde: “A kwamisa me ve, bunuubu munywa a nzo baamiidibuha, bisu a baana ba me laaka tolo, me a utwala usuuha mu uyava we mapa ve.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Me ndeele benu, nde a huteleme mu uyava nde mo mu tooni bumbaahi bwa bo ve. Ka nde sa ateleme mu tooni mukebudu a nde, na nde sa ava nde byosi bi nde ali na byo nzala.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Na me ndi mu undeele benu: Vondwaani, na benu sa liyaka; sahaani, na benu sa lisoolo; doodwaani, na sa badibula benu munywa a nzo. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Mu tooni ati, pasi nde wu ubaavondo, ubaayaka; woosi wu ubaasaha, ubaasoolo; bu baadibula munywa a nzo huli wu li mu udoodo. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ki taata ŋa hati la benu, tso mwaana a nde li mu uvondo nde tswi, nde uva nde taadi na myangala myosi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Buuve tso nde vondi nde ki, nde sa ava nde ngeenge? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ni mu buuna, tso benu baa lili banga bubi, benu li yaabi uva baana ba benu bisiha bibibwe. Tandisini a Taata wa hu yulu, buni nde hu uveleva Livupu la Ngidi huli boosi ba bali mu uvondo nde lo!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abeelusi iduka imosi nga matengo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-37">Mty 12.22-37</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-30">Mlk 3.22-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yisu abingi tengo li laasiidi muutu mumosi buduka. Bu tengo laapali, muutu mo ayambili, na konge a baatu yaba hutso a kimuhili. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ka bakima ŋa hati la bo baaleeli: «Mu matwala ma Belesebuli, pfumu matengo, nde ubaabinga matengo!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Na, bakima mu umese nde, mu utehele nde mweto. Bo baakasaha iliimbu hya kimuhili hi hyumata hu yulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ka Yisu bu haba hayaba matsimi ma bo, nde ni uleele bo: «Pasi ipfumu hi baatu bali na buraandu ŋa hati la bo, hi baafwa mu utsamuha; manzo ma hyo ni ubaasyengomono ŋa yulu a mana. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Tso Saatana kabuhi na nde mo, ipfumu hya nde utwala ukwilala ve. Ka benu lili mu uleele ti me umbambinga matengo mu tooni a Belesebuli wu ubaava me matwala. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Tso mu mbuli me umbambinga mo mu Belesebuli, ka bayihi ba benu, na ubaava bo matwala mu ubingasa mo? Ni mu buuna, bayihi ba benu sa baba bo mwakulu baatsundisi baa benu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ka tso mu matwala ma Nzambi me ndi mu umbinga matengo, Ipfumu hya Nzambi ka hyamiiyato natee huli benu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Bu muutu nga mifudi na bilwanili bya nde ubaakeelese nzo a nde, bya mu nzo a nde byosi bili ŋa mbuha ya tsiki. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ka tso muutu wu aluta nde mifudi yalwanisa nde na biingili nde, nde sa apatula nde bilwanili byosi bi nde abeedi hasa hiitu. Na nde sa apatula bya nde byosi na ukaba byo. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Woosi wu avele itwadi na me li muboho a me. Woosi wu aveleyakumbasa me mu ukuukaha baatu, nde li mu utsala.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Ŋa livupu lilibi limiipala mu muutu, lo libaayene yayuhu mu mambuha ma kumu a nzala, mu usaha ivumili. Bu lo livelibaha ivumili, lo ka ubaaleele: “Me ka ufutaha hu nzo yi me apali mu yo.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Ŋa lo lufutaha hu nzo mooyina, lo sa libiisa nzo yi baakombolo, yi baavanga bubwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Na lo libaayene mu uyavolo mavupu ma mabi tsambu makima ma maluta lo bukanyi, na lo libaayafutaha na mo. Mo mabaakoto mu nzo na ukwilala muuna. Na idiingu hya tsyelele hya muutu mo wunuuwu hibaafula pasi na hyatsomi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ŋa Yisu hakaleele buuna, mukaasu mumosi afulihi ŋa hati la konge a baatu: «Kinya yili na mukaasu wu abuta we na wu anywisi we mabeelo!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ka Yisu afutili: «Kinya homo yili na ba bali mu uyuha mambu ma Nzambi na baa bubaasalila mo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baatu baakavondo ti Yisu amweese bo iliimbu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mty 12.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Bu makonge ma baatu maakakula mu muvanga a Yisu, nde abweleele: «Baatu ba tungi moli, bali baatu bababi. Bo bali mu usaha iliimbu hi humweese ti Nzambi ni wu atsindihi me. Ni mu buuna, a busiila bo iliimbu ikima ve ŋa yulu a hi mumbihuli Yonasi. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />We bu Yonasi haba iliimbu huli bisu Niniive, ni buuna ka, Mwana a Muutu sa aba iliimbu mu baatu ba loloyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, mutumi wu mukaasu hu tsi a Sude uteleme ŋa busu bwa baatu ba tuungi mo liniili, na ukese bo. Nde huusa buuna, mu tooni ati nde amati hu matsi ma maafulala lala ŋa toto. Nde uya mu uyaayuha mambu ma maaluula mu tsiki ma mutumi Soolomo. Ka ŋaniiŋa huli na nde wuuna wu aluta Soolomo. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, baatu ba Niniive sa bateleme ŋa busu bwa baatu ba tungi moli, na sa bakeese bo. Mu tooni ati baatu ba tsi a Niniive baasobi mbiili a bo, mu tooni a ndongisili a Yonasi. Ka ŋaniiŋa huli na nde wuuna wu aluta Yonasi!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />A huli na muutu wu ubabaangisa mwinda mu ususa nde ŋa mbuha yi yasweme ve, buuve hutso a poonzi. Ka bubaasuusa nde ŋa isuusili hya nde hi hyasyenoho, mana babali mu ukoto mu nzo, bamono liyalala. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Diisu la we lili mwinda a nyutu a we. Tso diisu la we lili polo, nyutu a we yoosi yili hutso liyalala; ka tso diisu la we lili li laabeele, nyutu a we yili hutso a piipidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ni mu buuna, baakele, mana liyalala li lili mu we a liyilasa we busi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Bumosi ka, tso nyutu a we yoosi yili hutso liyalala, hwavele inama imosi hutso a piipidi, yo yoosi sa yiba hutso liyalala. Nyutu a we, sa yiba we bu mwinda huyalusa we mu liyalala la nde.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu asyembi Bafarisi na Milongisi mi mikele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-16">Mlk 7.1-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mty 23.1-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Bu Yisu hamani uyambila, Mufarisi mumosi avondi nde mu uyadya huli nde. Yisu akoti na atsahili mu udya ilaambu hi itwadi. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mufarisi akimuhi bu nde hamoni ti Yisu a haswahi myoho ve tswamina mu udya. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Pfumu ni uleele huli nde: «Mono buni benu lili, benu Bafarisi: benu libaaswaha mu utsyemese imbadi hi mambuungu na bikoombe bya benu, ka hutso mitima mya benu hwaluula mu nzala uyiba na ma mabi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Benu a lili na buyedi ve! Bee Nzambi wu avanga mbadi a havanga ka hati ve? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ni mu buuna, baavaani biyaha bisiha biina bi bili hutso mambungu na bikoombe bya benu. Na byosi sa biba bi byatsyeme huli benu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Lingebe huli benu Bafarisi! Mu tooni ati, benu libaava Nzambi ikuuku hya kuumi-kuumi hya bi benu libaakuna hutso matsyehe ma benu we lenge, banduungu baa mbala, na paa misooso mya pila mu pila. Ka benu li baatimba mbiili yimbwe na litondo la Nzambi: biina ti ni bisiha bya tsiki bi benu lafwana usalila, hwavele uvusaana bina. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Lingebe huli benu Bafarisi! Benu laatondo bitsiha bi byafula umonehele mu manzo ma masambulu ma Bayudaayo. Benu ubaatondo ti baava benu mabwehe ma maaluta butsitu ŋa miisu ma baatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Lingebe huli benu! Mu tooni ati benu lili we bidunda bi baaveletsikaha, na baatu bu baasumaha ŋa bubaadyata byo hwavele uyaba.»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Ngeele mikele mumosi ni uleele Yisu: «Mulongisi, ŋa we li mu utoyo buuna, we paa bisu li mu utuha!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yisu afutili: «Lingebe ka huli benu bangeele baa mikele! Benu libaakwiha baatu mipfuna mi myaleme mu ubita. Ka mipfuna mo miina benu mwakulu a libaabembe myo mu ukumbasa bo mu utsyete tso mu mulembo a benu mumosi ve. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Lingebe huli benu! Mu tooni ati benu libaatuunga mangila ma mimbihuli, mimbihuli mi bataata baa benu baadubi. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Ni buuna benu lili mu umweese ti benu lili mu usilasa mavaanga ma bakaaha ba benu. Mu tooni ati bo baadubi mimbihuli, na benu, benu lili mu utuunga mangila ma myo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ni mu buuna Nzambi mu bungeele bwa nde aleeli: “Me tsa tsindaha bo mimbihuli mya me, na biluumbi bya me. Baatu sa baduba bakima ŋa hati la bo, na sa batsuta bakima.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ni mu buuna, baatu ba taangu yi, Nzambi ukwiha bo mupfuna mapasi ma lipfu li mimbihuli myosi umata pangili a tsi. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Nzambi ukwiha bo mupfuna umata lipfu la Abeli natee la Zakariya, wu baadubi ŋa hati la diiku la tsuhili bungodu na nzo a Nzambi. Eeye, me ndi mu utsilasa benu, baatu ba taangu yi sa bafuta mapasi ma, mu tooni mapfu moma. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Lingebe huli benu, milongisi mi mikele! Mu tooni ati benu lamaasa tsaafi a ndibulili munywa a nzo a nzaabili: benu mwakulu a libaakoto ve, na benu libaakala ukoto huli boosi ba bali na nzala ukoto.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ŋa Yisu hapali mu nzo mo yiina, milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi baabahili nde kesi yi mifudi. Bo baabwi mu uva nde byuhu mu misamu mya pila mu pila. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Bo baatehili nde myeto mu uyehele usoolo dyaambu lilibi mu ma nde hakaleele.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ukele na baatu banga mapfuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mty 10.26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mu taangu mo yiina, limya la baatu laakuukimi na baakadyata miilu mya bana. Yisu atswamini uleele huli bayihi ba nde: «Baakelaani mu iloho hi hibaadanisa paate a Bafarisi, hyo hibaamweese muwala a bo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Mambu moosi ma maasweme sa mamonehele; na mambu ma tswehi sa mayabaana. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ni mu buuna, mambu moosi ma benu luleele hutso a piipidi sa bayuha mo ŋa liyalala. Na mambu ma benu luleele wadi-wadi mu matswi ma bambaahi mu bitini bi manzo. Baatu sa bata mo ibila ŋa yulu bibaanga bi manzo.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Me ndeele benu bambaahi ba me: A libata boomo bwa babaali mu uduba nyutu na uveletwala usa isiha ikima ŋa yulu ve. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Me tsa mweese benu wu benu lafwana ubata boomo. Baataani boomo bwa Nzambi, nde wuna Humbisa uduba muutu, li na lituma li ubwaha nde hu mbeenge a mbaahu. Eeye, me ndeele benu, ni nde wuna benu lafwana ubata boomo. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Masyehe mataanu bali mu usumbasa mu mwa makuta moole. Ka a huli na tso limosi mu mo li Nzambi havusaana mutima ve. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Na paa naanga mitswe mya benu baayaba yoosi litangu. Ni mu buuna a liba na boomo ve. Talu a benu yafula yi masyehe moosi.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Me ndi mu undeele benu: pasi muutu wu utiila me imbangi ŋa busu bwa baatu, Mwana a Muutu ka sa atiila nde imbangi ŋa busu bu bapofi ba Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ka muutu wu utunala me ŋa busu bwa baatu, Mwana a Muutu sa atunala nde ka ŋa busu bu bapofi ba Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Na pasi muutu wu utoyo bubi mu Mwana a Muutu, sa ayaka kolo-kolo. Ka pasi muutu wu uyambila bubi mu Livupu la Ngidi, Nzambi a husa nde kolo-kolo ve. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Sa baabita benu hu utsundasa hu manzo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo, ŋa busu bu bakuutu na lituma la tsi. A litsima buni benu lukalila nyutu a benu ve, tso ki mambu benu lupalisa ve. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Nyahaani hwa benu, Livupu la Ngidi sa lilongese benu mu taangu mo yiina mambu ma benu lafwana uleele.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sahu li isina hi itsuudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Muutu mumosi ŋa hati la konge aleeli Yisu: «Mulongisi, leele huli mwaana a ngu a me akaba na me mukobe wu taata hasiisa.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yisu afutili nde: «Mbaahi a me, na asoolo me mu uba nzonzi a benu, buuve mu ukabila benu mukobe a benu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Titswene Yisu aleeli huli baatu boosi: «Kebaani! Baabataani manzala moosi ma busina; tsoongo a idiingu hya muutu a hyakangama mu bisiha bya nde ve.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yisu atiidi bo sahu moli: «Isina imosi hya bahala hyaba na bwadi bu bwabuti mbutu yindahi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Nde akabaatsima hutso mutima na ubaaleele: “Me ka buni utsa! Me a ndi na mbuha yinene mu uswehe mbutu a me yoosi ve.” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Na nde abweleele mu nde mo: “Mono bu me utsa: me tsa tsala biswehili bya mbutu a me, me tsa mbwetunga biswehili bi byafulala bunene. Ni huuna me ukuukaha mbutu a me yoosi, na bisiiha bya me byosi. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Titswene me tsa ndeele muvumu a me: ‘Mbaahi a me, we li na biloho bi bilahi bya ŋa muvanga bi byudiinga bilima bi bilahi. Vuma hwa we, dya, nywa na baa mu kinya.’” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ka Nzambi aleeli nde: “Iyahudi! Ndulu mu butsuhu mo bunuubu, me umaasa muvumu a we. Na bi we akuukaha biina byosi, na uvolo byo?”» <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yisu abwesi: «Ni buuna ka huli muutu wu ubatsonzehe busina mu nde mo, na wu aveletsonzehe biloho bi byayelemene ŋa busu bwa Nzambi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baani na hiitu mu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Titswene Yisu abweleele bayihi ba nde: «Ni mu buuna me ndi mu undeele benu: a liba na matsimi mu idiingu hya benu, mu bi benu luudya, buuve mu nyutu a benu, mu bi benu lu ulwata ve. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ka idiingu hyaluta byudya talu, na nyutu bele bikutu ve. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Talaani mingongoyo, myo a mibaakuna ve, tso ukuukaha ve, myo a mili na iswehili hya mbutu ve, tso inzunihi ve, ka Nzambi ubaabuungala myo! Benu lalutala myo tsoongo! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Na ŋa hati la benu mu tooni minyongo mya nde, utwala ubwese bilumbu bya idiingu hya nde? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ka tso benu a lili na matwala mu bisiha bya hole ve, mu hima benu libaaba na matsimi mu bisiha bi byafula tsoongo?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Talaani buni bifulu bya bwadi bibaakula. Byo a bibaasala ve, tso utuunga bikutu ve. Ka me ndeele benu ti: tso mutumi Soolomo na busina bwa nde bwosi, a hali na bikutu bibibwe we imosi mu bifulu mo bi ve. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Tso Nzambi ubaalwatisa himbu hya bwadi loloyi, na hi bubwaha hutso a mbaahu ngwali, tandisi a benu, nde sa alwatsisa benu ka! Benu baatu banga imiinu hi ikeehe. <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Benu, nyahaani matsimi mu bi benu luudya na bi benu lunywa, tso byukwana. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ka ni bangoyi baa tsi moyi ba baasaha taangu yoosi. Ka benu, benu lili na Taata wu ayaba ti benu lili na nzala a byo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ma tswaminaani usaha Ipfumu hya Nzambi, na Nzambi sa ava benu bisiha byosi bi benu lili na byo nzala.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />A baa na boomo ve, we mwaana a konge biboodi! Mu tooni ati Taata a benu mimono bubwe mu uva benu Ipfumu hya nde. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Sumbasaani bisiha bi benu lili na byo byosi, na vaani mbongo huli biyaha. Vaangaani bapaala baa mbongo ba baavelebiiya, kukahani busina bu bu uvelefwa hu yulu, hu bwo bu uveledimbala. Mu tooni ati, huuna biibi utwala uto ve, na batsyedidi utwala ubiyasa bwo ve. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa huli busina bwa we, ni ŋana ka huli mutima a we.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinya huli basalili ba bali likanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Banaani balaavangama, lwataani bikutu bya benu bi isalu, na baangisaani minda mya benu. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Banaani we basalili ba bali mu ukeele pfutihili a pfumu a bo wu ayene hu mukungi makweele. Mana bu nde hu uyato ŋa nzo a nde, na nde adoodo, bo badibula nde munywa a nzo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Kinya huli basalili moba baa pfumu hu uyabiisa musihi ŋa nde hu uyafutaha! Ni mbuli, mu pfutihili a nde, nde ni wu ulwata ikutu hya nde hi isalu, wu utsahisa bo ŋa metse, na usuhala bo byudya. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Nde tso hayato hu hahati a busi, buuve ŋa ngwali, a dyaambu ve, kinya huli basalili, tso nde yabiisa bo musihi!<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Yaabaani lo bubwe, tso pfumu a nzo kini ubaayaba ki taangu muyibi hu uya, nde ukala nde mu ubula nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Benu ka, baavangamaani, mu tooni ati Mwana a Muutu sa aya, mu taangu yi benu laaveletsima.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musalili wu asungama na wu avelesungama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Na Peetelo afuuli: «Pfumu we sahu moli ndulu mu bisu we tiidi lo, vo mu baatu boosi?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Pfumu afutili: «Mukuutu basalili wu asungama na nga tsiki ni na? Ni muutu wu Pfumu hasuusala mutima a nde mu ubakeelese basalili, mana nde abaava pasi muutu mu taangu yi yafwana kabu la byudya. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kinya yili na mukuutu mo wunuuwu, tso pfumu mu pfutihili a nde, yabiisa nde mu ubaasa isalu hi nde hasiila nde! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Me ndeele benu, ni mbuli: Mukuutu sa ava nde lituma ŋa yulu bisiha bya nde byosi. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ka tso musalili li mu uleele hutso mutima a nde ti: “Pfumu a me li mu utaamba mu uya.” Nde abwa mu ubeete basalili bana ba babahala na ba bakaasu, na udya, na unywa, na ukolo malamu. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Buuna mukuutu sa ayafutaha mu ilumbu hi nde haveletsima, na mu taangu yi nde haveleyaba. Mukuutu sa asyembe musalili mo wunuuwu mu tsyembili yi nono, na uva nde musyendo mumosi na ba baavelesungama.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Musalili wu ayaba litondo la pfumu a nde, ka velivangimasa lo, nde sa ayaka bikooti bibyafulala. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ka musalili wu aveleyaba ma pfumu a nde hatondo, na li mu uvanga mambu ma mabi, afwana uyaka tsyembili, na bikooti byatsiitsa. Huli muutu wu ayaka bi bilahi, sa bavondo bulahi. Na sa banono bibyafulala bulahi huli wu ubaasoombese bi bilahi.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu Yisu sa huba na kabwili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mty 10.34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Me miinza mu ubehe mbaahu ŋa toto, na me na nzala yindahi ti yo yiba yi yamibaangama! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Me apfwana uyaka tondihili mapasi, na me na lehemene mu uyaka yo. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Benu libaatsima ti me hyenze ambehe ŋa toto? Naana, me ndeele benu, ka kabwili ŋa hati la baatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Umata bunuubu, nzo yi yili na baatu bataanu, bo sa bakabuha. Baatu batatu sa babelele baatu boole, na baatu boole sa babelele baatu batatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Taata sa abelele mwaana a nde wa bahala, na mwaana wa bahala sa abelele taata a nde. Ngu sa abelele mwaana a nde wu mukaasu, na mwaana wu mukaasu sa abelele ngu a nde. Ngu a mwaana wa bahala sa abelele mukadi a mwaana a nde, na mukadi a mwaana nde sa abelele buko bwa nde bu mukaasu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyaba na utsikaha biliimbu bya taangu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mty 16.2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yisu abweleele huli konge a baatu: «Ŋa benu lumono yidu mu upala hu Wesete, mu mawasa benu libaaleele ti: “Mvula sa anoho”, na nde ubaanoho. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Na ŋa benu libaamono ifula hya Sude mu usa, benu libaaleele: “Nyangu sa abenge”, na bubaaba buuna. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Benu baatu banga muwala! Benu libaayaba utsikaha biliimbu bya toto na bya yulu, buni benu laaveletsikaha mambu ma mali mu uvyoho mu taangu mo yiniiyi? <verse eid="LUK 12:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Benu mwakulu a laatwala utsikaha mambu ma mbuli ve! <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa we li mu uyene hu utaanda na muboho a we ŋa busu bwa nzonzi, bu benu likini mu nzila, ma yuhasana na nde. Tso a buuna ve, nde sa abita we ŋa busu bwa nzonzi, na nde sa ayeholo we huli bapulusu baa buyatimba we mu kondaayi. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ka me ndeele we, we a upala huuna ve hwavele ufuta mukanu a we woosi te likuta laatsiitusu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Usobo mbiili na ukangama mu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Mu taangu mo yiina, baatu baayayabisa Yisu buni mutumi Pilaato hatumi uduba bisu Ngalili bamosi ba baakatsuhala Nzambi bungodu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yisu ni ufutala bo bu: «Benu litsimi ti bisu Ngalili mo baana aba baaluta bisu Ngalili boosi mu masumu, mu ubwana na tsundusu yi lipfu ya pila yina? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Naana, me ndeele benu! Ka livelesobo mbiili, benu ka sa likwa we bo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Buuve kuumi poombo la baatu ba baakwidi ŋa ibaanga hinene hya Silowa hyahudihi bo. Benu litsimi ti bubi bwa bo bwaba bwaluta bwa baatu ba musyenge a Yeruselemi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Naana, me ndeele benu! Ka benu livelesobo mbiili, benu ka sa likwa boosi we bo.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sahu li muti a fiinge wu aveleva mbutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yisu abweta ka sahu moli: «Muutu mumosi aba akuna muti a fiinge hutso a ngundu a nde ya vinye.<figure style="fig" alt="Muti a Fiige" file="HK 00088B.TIF" size="col" loc="Lik 13.6" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="13.6">Muti a Fiinge</figure> Ilumbu imosi, nde ayasaha mbutu, ka nde a habahi tso limosi ve. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Nde ni uleele huli musalili a ngundu a nde: “Mono bilima ka bitatu me ndi mu unzatsaha mbutu mu muti a fiinge mo wunuuwu, hwavele ubaha isiha. Kwanga nde! Mu hima nde ali mu uvolo mbuha a mupu mutso a ngundu?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Musalili mo afutili nde: “Pfumu a me, maabwenyaha ati nde ilima mohi. Me tsa pahila nde iyuna hi hyudiinga nde, na me tsa mbwaha mbolese hutso a hyo. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Tangu yi nde ubava mbutu, avelebuta, bakwanga nde.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abeelusi mukaasu nga ipiha mu ilumbu hya saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Ilumbu hya saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">saba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ilumbu hya pumili hi Bayudaayo mu usukasa limingu. </char></note>, Yisu akalongese mutso a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Ka hwaba huuna mukaasu mumosi wu livupu lilibi lavidi ipiha umata bilima kuumi na poombo. Nde aba wabaandama, na a hakabwetwala unonoho ve. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Bu Yisu hamoni mukaasu mowuna, ateeli nde na aleeli: «Mukaasu, we miyoboho mu ipiha hya we.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yisu asuusala nde myoho, mawasa-mawasa, mukaasu anonihi na nde ayusi Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ka mukuutu mumosi a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo abahi kesi bu Yisu habeelusi mubeedu mu ilumbu hya saba. Na nde aleeli huli konge a baatu: «Huli bilumbu bisamunu bi baafwana mu usala. Baayani hu ubuha nyutu mu bilumbu mo biina, ka a mu ilumbu hya saba ve!» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Pfumu afutili huli nde: «Benu banga muwala! Na mu benu, ilumbu hya saba, ubaakondo unyangula ngombe a nde, buuve buuru a nde mutso idiili hi biboodi, mu ubita nde hu uyanywisa nde mamba? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ka mukaasu mo wunuuwu, wuli mwaana a Abrahami, wu Saatana haba hamihada umata bilima kuumi poombo, a hwafwana mu uyobolo nde mu ilumbu hya saba ve?»<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Bu Yisu haleeli buuna, baboho ba nde boosi baamoni tsonyi, na konge a baatu yaba na kinya mu tooni a ma muyusu ma nde hakasa.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuma a tsangu a mutade na kuma a iloho hi ibaadanisa mapa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Mty 13.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yisu abweleele: «Ipfumu hya Nzambi, na hima hyafwanina? Me na ki iloho me upfwanisa hyo? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Hyo hili we libutu la mutade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">libutu la mutade: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayudaayo baakatsima ti ifwaani hi iloho hi ikehe. Ka hu manili yo yibaakituha muti.</char></note> li muutu amiivolo na unyanza hutso a woto. Tsangu mo yiina yibaakula, yibaakituha musumana, na banyunyi bubaatunga byanza bya bo mu matabi ma nde.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yisu abweleele: «Ipfumu hya Nzambi, na hima me upfwanisa hyo? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Hyo hili we iloho hi ibaadanisa mapa, hi mukaasu amiivolo, na upfuuta mu byetso bitatu bya farine, te bu mapa mu udaana.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munywa a nzo wu aswekeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Bu Yisu hakayene hu tsyelo a Yeruselemi nde akataangila misyenge na mala, na nde akalongese. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Muutu mumosi aleeli nde: «Pfumu, ndulu ka mwaana baatu hole bu uyoboho?» Yisu afutili bo: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Hwadaani mu ukoto mu munywa a nzo wu aswekeme. Mu tooni ati, me ndeele benu, ba banzuhisini busaha ukoto mu nde, na a butwala ve. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Ŋa nga nzo huteleme na udibuha munywa a nzo mu sabi, mu taangu mo yiina benu lusaala hu mbadi, benu sa libaandiha ubaadoodo ŋa munywa a nzo, na ubaaleele: “Pfumu! Dibula bisu munywa a nzo!” Nde sa afutala benu: “Me anzaabi benu baa huni limaati ve.” <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Na benu sa libaandiha uleele nde: “Bisu laadiidi na laanywidi itwadi na we, na we alongisi mu manzila ma manene ma mu misyenge mya bisu.” <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Nde sa akaala benu na uleele: “Me a nzaabi benu baa huni limaati ve. Matilaani me, benu boosi ba libaasa ma mabi!”<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Ni ŋana benu luulila na uhula miinyu. Ŋa benu luumono Abrahami, Isaki, Yakobi, na mimbihuli myosi, hutso Ipfumu hya Nzambi, na sa babwaha benu hu mbadi. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Baatu sa bamata hu Esete na hu Wesete, hu Noode na hu Sude, na sa baatsahala ŋa metse mu udya itwadi ilaambu hu Ipfumu hya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Na buuna, bakima ŋa hati la babali batsyeleele, sa baba baatsomi, na bakima babali baatsomi loloyi sa baba batsyeleele.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu unyongo mu bisu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mty 23.37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mu taangu mo yiina, mwaana kabu li Bafarisi laayaleele Yisu: «Mata ŋa, yene! Eloode tondi uduba we.»<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yisu afutili bo: «Ya leelaani mubahu mowuna: “Mono, me ndi mu umbinga matengo na me ndi mu umbeeloso babeedu lolo na ngwali. Na mu ilumbu hi bitatu me tsa mana isalu hya me.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ka me apfwana uhwada mu mudyenge a me loloyi, ngwali, na mulele. Mu tooni ati, a hwafwana ti baduba mumbihuli hu mbadi a Yeruselemi ve.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Yeruselemi, we musyenge a Yeruselemi, we wu ubaaduba mimbihuli na uduba mu mamanya baa Nzambi ali mu utsindaha we! Me tondi ukuukaha baana ba we, we bu tsusu ubaafuha baana ba nde hutso mapapi ma nde. Ka benu a laatondo ve! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Ni buuna Nzambi sa atimba nzo a benu. Me ndeele benu lo, a lubwemono me ve, natee mu taangu yi benu luuleele: “Nzambi asyeme nde wuna wuli mu uya mu nduhi a Pfumu!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu abeelusi mubeedu mu ilumbu hya saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Hwaba ilumbu hya saba imosi, Yisu akoti mu nzo a mumosi ŋa hati li bakuutu ba Bafarisi mu udya. Na Bafarisi baakakete nde. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Na ŋa busu bwa Yisu, hwaba na bahala limosi li laaba na bubeedu bwa nyutu udaana. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yisu aleeli huli milongisi mi Mikele na huli Bafarisi: «Mikele mya bisu mili mu uva muswa vo ti naana, mu ubeeloso mubeedu mu ilumbu hya saba?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />A baafutili pasi mvutu ve. Buuna Yisu abembi mubeedu, abeelusi nde na afutili nde. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Titswene Yisu aleeli bo: «Na mu benu, tso mwaana a nde wa bahala, buuve ngombe a nde miibwa hutso iyuna hya mamba, hu uvelepalisa nde mu mawasa mu ilumbu mo hina tso hyo hili hya saba?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ka bo a baatwali ukaala ve.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ulongese mu kulimini na mu uyaba ukaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yisu atsikaha buni ba baatsihi hu mukungi baakasoolo mambuha ma busu, nde aviidi bo ndoongi moyi: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Ŋa bamiitsiha we hu mukungi makweele, a tsahala ŋa mbuha ya busu ve. Peleve baatsiha muutu wu aluta we biita, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />na wu atsiha benu baboole ayaleele we: “Siisala nde mbuha moyi.” We sa mono tsonyi yindahi mu uyatsahala hu mbuha ya tsyelele. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ka ŋa bamiitsiha we hu mukungi, ya tsahala hu mbuha ya tsyelele, mana bu wu ateele we hu mukungi huya, nde aleele we: “Mbaahi a me, ya tsahala ŋa itsiha hi mifwende.” Buuna, baatu boosi babali mu udya na we sa bakiinza we. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ni mu buuna, pasi nde wuna wu usyenoho sa bakulamasa nde, na pasi nde wu ukulamana sa basyenolo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Titswene Yisu aleeli huli wu atsihi nde hu mukungi: «Ŋa we ubaava ilaambu hya mwangulu tso hya tsitsaha: a tsiha bambaahi ba we ve, tso baana ba ngu a we, tso ikuta hya we ve, tso banga busina babali bebele a we ve. We usa buuna, bo ka sa batsiha we hu udya, mu ufuta bi we vidi bo. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ka ŋa we tondi uvanga mukungi wu udya, tsiha biyaha, banga bipiha, banga maatsode na binzimana. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Na we sa baa mu kinya, mu tooni ati bo a bali na bi usyende we ve. Nzambi sa afuta we, humbisa a tsuuhili lipfu ya ba baasungama.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sahu li ilaambu hiinene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mty 22.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Muutu mumosi mu ba baaba mu udya ŋa metse amana uyuha, ni uleele Yisu maambu mo maniima: «Kinya yili huli muutu wu udya mu mukungi ipfumu hya Nzambi!»<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Na Yisu atidi nde sahu moli: «Bahala limosi avangimisi ilaambu hiinene na atsihi baatu ba banzuhisini. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Tangu yi udya yito, nde ni utsindaha musalili a nde mu uyaleele huli ba baatsiha: “Yaani mu tooni ati byosi bya mivangama!” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ka bo boosi, mumosi mumosi abisi na aviidi ikalu. Watsomi aleeli nde: “Me atsumba ngundu mosi na me apfwana mu uyamono yo. Me mipondo mu usa me kolo-kolo.” <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Mukima aleeli nde: “Me mipondo mu usa me kolo-kolo! Me miitsuumba kuumi li bangombe, me maanzanzyehele usalila bo.” <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Wuna ka aleeli: “Me ŋa ni ŋa miikwele, ni mu buuna me upelenza.”<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Ŋa musalili hayafutaha, nde ayabisi pfumu a nde maamvutu moosi. Buuna nga nzo afwengi na aleeli musalili a nde: “Yene mawasa mu mambuha ma baatu ba banzuhisini na mu maluuha ma mutso musyenge, na behe biyaha, banga bipiha, binzimana na banga matsode.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Mwana taangu yivyoho, musalili ayaleele: “Pfumu, me miitsa bu we tumi me, ka mambuha makini.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Nga nzo ni uleele nde: “Yene mu manzila ma mu mala, mu misoho, sa mukonono, mana baatu baya, nzo a me yiluula. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Me ndeele benu: A huli a muutu tso mumosi mu ba me atsiha, udya ilaambu hi mukungi a me ve.”»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buni mu uba muyihi a Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mty 10.37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Yisu bu haba mu nzila, konge a baatu yakayene na nde. Nde akinguha ni uleele bo: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Tso muutu yidi huli me, na nde velibelele: taata a nde ngu a nde. Mukadi a nde, baana ba nde, baana ba ngu a nde. Baakedi ba nde, napa idiingu hya nde mo. Nde utwala uba muyihi a me ve. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Na pasi wu uvelebita mupfuna a kuruwa a nde na uduukala me, utwala uba muyihi a me ve. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Tso muutu tondi utuunga nzo yi mutaabu, nde afwana umaatsahala mu utsima tso nde li na mbahili yi yakuha mu umana tuungili a yo. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Tso a buuna ve, nde atunga yene hwavele umana nzo, boosi babumono yo, sa basyebe nde <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />na uleele: “Muutu mo wunuuwu abaandiha utuunga nzo, ka a hatwala umana yo ve.”<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Ni buuna ka, tso pfumu mumosi tondi uyene mu uyalwana mudiingu na pfumu mukima, nde afwana umatsahala mu umaatsikaha tso nde utwala ubiingala pfumu wuna. Nde afwana mu utaala tso mu kuumi li biveeve (1 0000) li balwani ba nde, nde ubiingala mutumi nga maku moole (2 0000) ma biveeve ma balwani. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Nde amono ti a hutwala ve, nde sa atsindaha biluumbi huli mutumi wuna, bu nde akini lala, mu uyuhasana na nde mu uvanga hyenze. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ni buuna ka mu benu, woosi wu avelevangama mu usiisa bya nde byosi, a hayelemene mu uba muyihi a me ve.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tso mungwa dimbisi livu la nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mty 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9.50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Mungwa li isiha hibwe; ka tso mungwa dimbisi livu la nde, buni hwafwana mu ufutala nde lo? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Nde a hasaali na tsoongo tso mu toto ve, tso mu mbolese ve. Bafwana ubuma nde hu mbadi. Nga matswi ma uyuha, nyaha ayuha.»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Sahu li lindombo li laadimbala, li misoloho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mty 18.12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Bakaambi baa limandu na baatu ba baasumaha, baayasusaha boosi hu pedu a Yisu mu uyuha ma nde hakaleele. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bafarisi na milongisi mi Mikele baakaŋono, na baakaleele: «Muutu mo wunuuwu li mu uyaka banga masumu na nde li mu udya na bo.»<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yisu atiidi bo sahu mo linili: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Tso muutu ŋa hati la benu li na kama li madombo, na tso dimbisi limosi, nde a humasiisa maku ipfwa na mandombo ipfwa ŋa kumu ve? Eeye, nde usiisa mo, mu uyasaha lindombo li laadimbala, natee bu nde husoolo lo. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Ŋa nde amiisoolo lo na kinya yoosi, nde sa atsyete na ususa lo ŋa yulu bisambaha bya nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Bu nde hufutaha hu nzo, nde sa ateele bambaahi ba nde, na baa mu mivaanga mya nzo a nde, na uleele bo: “Baanaani mu kinya na me, bu me miitsoolo lindombo la me lili beedi laadimbala.” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ni buuna ka, me ndeele benu, kinya yi yafulala sa yiba hu yulu huli Nzambi mu muutu mumosi wu misobo mbiili a nde. Kinya mo yiina yaluta ya baatu maku ipfwa na ipfwa ba baavelesobo mbiili a bo.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sahu li likuta la mbongo li laadimbala, li misoloho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Buuve, tso mukaasu li na kuumi li makuta, tso nde dimbisi limosi, nde sa abaangisa mwinda, na ukoombolo nzo, na usaha mu bukuhu natee bu nde husoolo lo. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ŋa nde amiisoolo lo, nde sa atsiha bambaahi na baa mu mivaanga mya nzo a nde, na uleele: “Baani mu kinya na me, bu me mitsoolo likuta li me mbeedi andimbasa.” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ni bumosi ka, me ndeele benu, huli na kinya ŋa hati li bapofi ba Nzambi mu tooni a nga masumu mumosi wu misobo mbiili.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sahu la taata na baana boole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yisu abweleele: «Muutu mumosi aba na baana boole ba babahala. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Wa ngebe aleeli huli taata a nde: “Taata, va la me kabu li mukobe li me apfwana ubaha.” Na taata akabili bo baboole busina bwa nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Mwa bilumbu bivyoho, mwaana wa ngebe asumbisi bya nde byosi na ayeni hu tsi yalala na mbongo a nde. Huuna, nde anyambisini busina bwa nde, bu nde hakoti mu mbiili yi yavelefwana. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Bu nde hamani unyabasana byosi, nzala yinene yaakoti mu tsi mo yiina. Nde akimi mu bi ufuuhala mu idiingu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Nde asahi isalu huli muutu mumosi mu bisu tsi mo yiina. Muutu mowuna atsindihi nde hu kumu a nde, hu uyakeelese bangulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Nde aba na nzala udya mbutu yi bangulu baakadya. Ka nde a habahi tso hahima ve. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Bu nde atsimi bubwe nde aleeli bu: “Basalili ba taata boosi bali na byudya bi bilahi, ka me huni, me aka ukwa mu nzala. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Me tsa pfutaha huli taata a me na me tsa ndeele nde: ‘Taata, me atsumaha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi na ŋa busu bwa we. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />A hwafwana ti we bweteele me mwaana a we ve. Volo me we mumosi mu basalili ba we.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Na nde afutihi huli taata a nde. Bu nde haba kini lala na nzo, taata a nde atalili nde, na amoni lingebe li lilahi. Taata ayeni tiinu huli mwaana a nde, ayabumba na avivi nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwana aleeli nde: “Taata, me atsumaha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi na ŋa busu bwa we. Me a tsaali wu afwana ti we bweteele me mwaana a we ve.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ka taata aleeli huli basalili ba nde: “Mu mawasa behelaani nde ikutu hi hyafulala bubwe na lwatisaani nde hyo! Lwatisaani nde muluunga mu mulembo, na bikoodi mu miilu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Behaani mukole a ngombe wa tsoongo na dubaani nde, laambani! Lidyanani na lisaanani muyali. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Mu tooni ati mwaana a me wu beedi amiikwa, miisuuha; nde beedi amiidimbala, miisoloho.” Na bo baabandihi mukungi.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Mu taangu mo yiina, mwaana a muutu mowuna wu mukuutu aba hu mangundu. Ŋa nde hayafutaha, na ayato ŋa pedu a nzo, nde ayuhi kele a nyimbu na makinu. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Nde ateeli musalili mumosi, afuuli nde ki mambu mali mu uvyoho. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Musalili afutili nde: “Muhehe a we miyafutaha. Na taata a we miituma uduba mukole a ngombe a tsoongo, mu tooni ati mwaana a ngu a we miyafutaha polo.” <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Ka mwaana wu mukuutu abahi kesi na a hatondi ukoto mu nzo ve. Taata a nde apali mu uyabondo nde mu ukoto. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Na nde afutili huli taata a nde: “Taata! Huka bilima bi bilahi me ndi mu utsalila we. Me kini a hambisili we ve. Ka we kini a havidi me tso mukole a taba me kaka tsiidi mukungi na bambaahi ba me ve. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ka bu mwaana a we wunuwu amiiya, nde wu ayanyambasana busina bwa we na bimbembo, mu tooni a nde, we tumi uduba mukole a ngombe wa tsoongo!” <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Taata a nde afutili: “Mwana a me, we li na me taangu yoosi, na byosi bi me ndi na byo bili bya we. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Hufwani huli bisu mu uvanga mukungi, na uba mu kinya mu tooni ati, muhehe a we wu beedi amiikwa, nde miisuha. Nde beedi amiidimbala, nde miisoloho.”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Sahu li ikanga-koome nga upfuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yisu atiidi sahu mo linili huli bayihi ba nde: «Isina imosi hyaba na ikanga-koome. Baayakese hyo ŋa busu bu isina ti nde ubaabiyasa busina bwa nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Isina ni uteele musalili a nde na uleele: “Ki mambu me ndi mu nzuha mu nduhi a we? Mweese me tsalili a we, mu tooni ati we a ubweba muswehi bisiha bya me ve.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Ikanga-koome atsimi hutso mutima a nde: “Pfumu a me ka mu umaasa me mu isalu. Me buni utsa? Me a ndi na mifudi mi myakuha musala tooto ve. Me tsamba na tsonyi mu usa musohi. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Me nzaabi bu me utsa! Me tsa paanga ma musa ti, Humbisa hu bamiimaasa me mu isalu, baatu ba baayaka me mu manzo ma bo.”<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Nde ni utsiha mumosi mumosi, mu boosi ba baaba baasombo isiha huli pfumu a nde. Nde aleeli huli watsomi: “We kwe asombo huli pfumu a me?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Nde afutili: “Kama li mingungu mya maadi ma oliive.” Ikanga-koome mo ni uleele nde: “Mono muhanda wa tsiingili mukanu, tsahala mawasa na sonehe maku mataanu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Nde abweleele huli mukima: “Ka we, we kwe asombo?” Nde afutili: “Kama li basaahu baa mbutu.” Musalili aleeli nde: “Volo muhanda wa tsiingili mukanu a we, sonehe maku poombo.” <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Pfumu asilisi ikanga-koome nga upfuta mu ma nde havangi na lisuunga. Mu tooni ati baatu ba tsi moyi buyedi bwa pangili a mambu, bele buyedi bwa baatu ba liyalala ve.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Na Yisu abwebwese: «Na me, me ndeele benu, salilaani busina bu upfuta mu uvanga bumbaahi na baatu. Mana bu busina mo bufwa, bambaahi bayaka benu hutso manzo ma mu ukwilala bilima na bilima. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Muutu nga imbuli mu mwa bisiha bibikeehe, nde li ka na imbuli mu bisiha bibinene. Muutu nga upfuta mu bisiha bibikeehe, nde li ka na upfuta mu bisiha bibinene. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ni mu buuna, tso benu a lili na imbuli mu busina bu upfuta ve, na uva benu busina bwa mbuli? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Na tso benu a lili na imbuli mu hi hyabaha mukima ve, na uva benu bi bili bya benu mo?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Musalili tso mumosi utwala usalila bapfumu boole ve. Nde sa abelele mumosi na utondo wuna. Buuve, nde sa akatita mu mumosi na urokolo wuna. Benu utwala usalila Nzambi na mbongo ve.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu alongisi mikele na Ipfumu hya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mty 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10.11-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Bafarisi bu baaba baasinzatondo mbongo, baakasyebe Yisu Humbisa uyuha maana moosi. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Benu libaasaha umonehele babaakuha ŋa busu bwa baatu, ka Nzambi yabi mitima mya benu. Mu tooni ati bi bili bibibwe ŋa busu bwa baatu, a bili na kaluha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi ve. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Mikele mya Moose na mabuuku ma Mimbihuli mya diingi natee mu taangu Yowani Mutondihi. Umata taangu Yowani, bali mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe wu Ipfumu hya Nzambi. Na baatu boosi bali mu ukalana mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Yulu na toto sa bidimbala, ka isono tso imosi hi mukele a Nzambi a hyudimbala ve.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu alongisi mu mambu ma ndubili makweele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Pasi bahala li limiduba kwele na mukadi a nde na ukwele mukima, mi kwasa mayamba. Na bahala li lukwele mukaasu wu miduba kwele na mulumi a nde, si mayamba.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sahu li isina na Laazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yisu atiidi ka sahu mo linili: «Hwaba na bahala limosi li isina wu akabaalwata bikutu bya talu na bibibwe. Idiingu hya nde aba pasi ilumbu mikungi na makinya. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Iyaha imosi nduhi a nde aba Laazaro. Nyutu yoosi yaba yaluula mu mambaadi. Baatu baakasuusa nde ŋa busu bu munywa a nzo a isina mo hina. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Nde akatondo udya bipepesi bi byakabwa hu tsina a metse ma isina. Hwafula ni bamvwa baakayavele mambaadi ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Iyaha hyakwidi, na bapofi baabiti nde ŋa mbahala a Abrahami. Isina ka hyakwidi, na baadiihi nde.<verse eid="LUK 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Hu tsi a babaakwa, bu isina hyaba hutso munyongi, nde asuuli miisu na atalili Abrahami hu lala na Laazaro ŋa muvanga a nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Isina afulihi: “Taata Abrahami, kwila me lingebe. Na tsindaha Laazaro ayabootehe tsoso mulembo a nde mutso a mamba. Tsindaha nde avolemese me limi, mu tooni ati me mu pasi ndi hutso a mbaahu mo yiniiyi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ka Abrahami afutili: “Mwana a me, yibwala moonyi ti we abeedi mu maakinya mu idiingu hya we, ka Laazaro amoni mapasi ma malahi. Bunuubu, nde ka hutso a mbombisili a nde, we bu we ka mu umono pasi. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Titswene, huli na mbeenge yinene ŋa hati la benu na bisu, mana ba batondi umata huli bisu mu uvyoho huli benu baveletwala. Ni we benu ka mu umata hu benu lili, mu uyato huli bisu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Isina ni uleele: “Kolo-kolo a we taata, ka ni tsindaha ati Laazaro hu nzo a taata a me, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />mu tooni ati, huuna me na baana ba ngu bataanu. Nde ayayabisa bo, mana bo ka a baya hutso a mbuha munyongi yiniiyi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abrahami ni ukaala: “Baana baa ngu a we bo bali na Moose na mimbihuli mya Nzambi mu uyibusa bo. Nyaha bo bayuhala bo.” <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Isina ni uleele: “Buuna a bwa kuha ve, taata Abrahami. Ka tso muutu mati hu tsi a babaakwa na yeni huli bo, bo sa basobo mbiili na uyafutaha huli Nzambi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ka Abrahami aleeli nde: “Tso bo a bayuhili Moose na mimbihuli ve, bo utwala usiinga usobo mbiili a bo ve, tso muutu suhi hu tsi a babaakwa.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ulongese mu tsobili a mbiili mu ufutaha huli Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mty 18.6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk 9.42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yisu aleeli bayihi ba nde: «Matooni ma malahi mali ma mu baabwisa baatu mu masumu. Ka ni lingebe huli nde wuna wu uba tooni yi utahusa muutu na Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Hufwani bubwe huli nde wuna, bakutala nde manya lilinene mu likingu na ubwaha nde mu mubu. Hufwani buuna, ka a mu ubita tso mumosi mu bangebe mo baniiba mu utahuha na Nzambi ve.<verse eid="LUK 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Kebaani! Tso mwaana a ngu a we buuve kedi avanga lilibi, yibusa nde we bu hwafwana. Nde asobo mbiili a nde, sa nde kolo-kolo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Tso nde siidi we bubi tsa tsambu mu ilumbu, na tso nde yamonehele huli we monehele tsambu na uleele: “Me miitsobo mbiili a me.” Sa nde kolo-kolo.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiitu mu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Bayihi baaleeli huli Pfumu: «Kulasa hiitu hya bisu mu Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Pfumu aleeli: «Tsimaani ti hiitu mu Nzambi hili we mwa libutu la mutade. Tso benu na hiitu hya pila yina, benu utwala utuma muti we mbuyu: “Tuupama, na yamene hutso mubu.” Nde sa asiingala benu.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mupfuna musalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Tsimaani ti mumosi mu benu li na ngamba wuli mu usala toto. Buuve ngamba wuli mu ukeelese biboodi. Bu nde humata mangundu, nde uleele nde: “Yanga mawasa yatsahala ŋa metse?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Naana! Ka nde sa aleele nde: “Lamba byudya bya me, na sobo bikutu mu usalila me natee bu me umana udya na unywa. Humbisa we sa dya na unywa mu ya we taangu.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />A hwafwana huli nde mu ufutala matondo huli ngamba mo wunuuwu ve, mu tooni ati nde vaangi ma baatumi nde. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ni we benu ka, ŋa benu limiivaanga ma baatumi benu, leelaani: “Bisu lili bangamba ba baavele a tsoongo, bisu limiivaanga mamaakuha huli bisu mu usa.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abeelusi kuumi la banga bwatsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Bu Yisu hakayene hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, nde ataangili mandilu ma bitaanzi bya Samariya na Ngalili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Bu nde hakakoto hu bula bumosi, kuumi la baatu banga bwatsi bayabwana na nde. Bo baatelimi hu lala. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Bo baabwi mu ufulaha: «Yisu, Mulongisi, kwila bisu lingebe.» <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yisu amono bo, nde aleeli: «Yamweesaani nyutu a benu huli bangaanga ba Nzambi.» Na bu baaba mudwe huuna, bo baabeeluhi. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Mumosi mu bo, bu hamoni ti nde miibeeloho, ayafutaha, na ayusi Nzambi na mifudi myosi. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Nde abwidi mbalanga mu toto, ŋa busu bwa Yisu na afutili nde matondo. Muutu mo wunuuwu aba musi Samariya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yisu aleeli: «A kuumi la baatu babeeluhi ve? Ka ipfwa hina huni bali? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ŋa hati la bo boosi, ndulu ni mwenyi mo wunuuwu tsimi uyafutaha mu ufutala matondo huli Nzambi!» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Titswene, Yisu abweleele nde: «Teleme yene! Hiitu hya we mu Nzambi himiifuuhasa we.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nziili Ipfumu hya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mty 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Bafarisi baafuuli Yisu: «Ki taangu Ipfumu hya Nzambi hi uya?» Nde afutili bo: «Ipfumu hya Nzambi a hili we iliimbu hi bubaamono mu uya ve. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Mu taangu mo yiina baatu a bu uleele ve: “Hyo hyohiniihi ŋaniiŋa!” Buuve: “Hyo hyohina huna!” Mu tooni ati Ipfumu hya Nzambi ŋa hati la benu hili.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Na nde aleeli huli bayihi: «Bilumbu bi byuya, benu luusaha umono tso ilumbu imosi mu bilumbu bya Mwana a muutu. Ka benu a luumono hyo ve. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Sa baleele benu: “Nde ŋa ali!” – Buuve “Nde huuna ali!” A liyene maatiinu ve! A liduukala bo ve! <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />We bu muvedyavedi ubaamwedeme na uyalusa mayulu tsoso moyi natee yina, ni buuna ka bu uba mu Mwana a muutu mu ilumbu hi nde hu uya. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ka nde afwana umaamono pasi bunzuhisini, na baatu ba tungi mo linili sa babisa nde.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Mambu ma maabwiidi mu taangu a Nowa, sa mavyoho bumosi kaka we mu bilumbu bya nziili a Mwana a muutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Baatu baakadya na baakanywa, baakakwele na baakakwelese baana ba bo, natee mu ilumbu hi Nowa hakoti mutso likuumbi. Humbisa, nyamba yayidi na yanyambisini bo boosi. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Sa huba bumosi ka we mu taangu Loti: baatu baakadya na baakanywa, baakasumba na baakasumbasa, baakakuna mbutu na baakatunga manzo. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ka ilumbu hi Loti hapali mu musyenge a Sodoomo, mbaahu na mamanya ma mbaahu maakanoho we mvula na boosi baanyambihini. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Sa huba kaka bumosi mu ilumbu hi Mwana a muutu huyamonehele. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Mu ilumbu mo hina, woosi wu uba ŋa yulu ibaanga, aba na bisiha mutso a nzo, a nyaha usutaha mu uvolo byo. Bumosi ka, wuna wu uba hutso matsyehe, avelefutaha hu nzo. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Yibwalaani moonyi mu mukadi a Loti. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Woosi wu usaha ukeelese muvumu a nde sa anyambasana nde, na woosi wu unyambasana muvumu a nde sa akeelese nde. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Me ndeele benu, mu butsuhu mo buuna, baatu boole baa bu uba ŋa taangi mosi, mumosi sa babita, na wuna sa basiisa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bakaasu boole baa bu uba mu unyiha mbutu mu itwadi, mumosi sa babita, na wuna sa basiisa. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itsudu mohi hyo ve mu mabuuku makima: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Boole baa bu uba hutso a tsyehe, mumosi sa babita, na wuna sa basiisa. </char></note>]»<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Bayihi baafuuli Yisu: «Pfumu, maana mbadi huni mutswiha?» Nde afutili: «Ŋa huuba mvumbi, ni huuna kaka bambida bu ukuukama.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Sahu li mukwili na nzonzi wu baamiisumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yisu atiidi bo sahu limosi, mu umweese bo ti bafwana ubaasambila taangu yoosi, na uveleba na ikolili. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Nde aleeli: «Hwaba na nzonzi mu musyenge mumosi, wu akavelekiinza Nzambi, na uvelekiinza pasi muutu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Hwaba ka hutso musyenge mowuna, mukwili mumosi wu akayaleele nde taangu yoosi: “Biingasa me ŋa busu bu muboho a me.” <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Tangu yoosi nzonzi akabisa. Titswene, nde ni utsima: “Eye, me nzaabi ti me a mbakiinza Nzambi, na ukiinza pasi muutu ve. <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Ka bu mukwili mo wunuuwu ali mu uyakwamisa me, me apfwana ubiingasa nde mu musamu a nde, mana nde abweveleyakwamisa me.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Pfumu abweleele: «Yuhaani ma nzonzi wu baamiisumba wunuwu ali mu uleele. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Nzambi ubiingisa ba nde hasoolo, mu tooni ati, bali mu ufulaha huli nde butsuhu na nyangu. Nde a hudiinga mu uyakumbasa bo ve. <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Me ndeele benu, nde ubiingasa bo mu mawasa. Ka ŋa Mwana a muutu hu uya ŋa toto, nde uyabiisa baatu babali na hiitu mu Nzambi?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sahu li Mufarisi na mukambi limandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yisu abweta sahu mo linili, mu tooni a baatu ba baakatsima ti, bo baasungama ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Baatu mo baana baakarokolo bana. Yisu aleeli: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Babahala boole baakumi hu nzo a Nzambi mu usambila. Mumosi aba Mufarisi, na wuna mukambi limandu. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mufarisi akasambila mu tele hutso mutima a nde bunuubu: “Nzambi a me, me ndi mu upfutala we matondo, bu me avele we baatu bakima: ba bali bayibi, bababi, na banga mayamba. Baatu mo baana bali we mukambi limandu mo wunuuwu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Me umbaandya ikaandi ndya yole mu limiingu, me umbaapa ikuuku hya kuumi-kuumi mu byosi bi me umbaambaha.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Mukambi limandu atelimi ŋa lala, a hayehili tso usuula miisu hu yulu ve. Ka nde akabula tulu na uleele: “Nzambi a me, kwila me lingebe, me wu uli nga masumu.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yisu abweleele: «Me ndeele benu, bahala mo linili afutihi hu nzo a nde, na Nzambi amoni nde wu akuha, ka a Mufarisi mo wunuuwu ve. Ka pasi nde wuuna wu ubaasyenoho sa bakulamasa; pasi nde wuuna wu ubaakulamana, sa basyenolo.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu asyemi bibabana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mty 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10.13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Baatu baabehi ka bibabana huli Yisu mana nde asuusala byo myoho. Ka bayihi bamono buuna, bo basyembi ba baabehili nde bibabana. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ka Yisu avondi ti babehele nde bibabana na aleeli: «Nyahaani bibabana biya huli me, na a liliha byove. Mu tooni ati, Ipfumu hya Nzambi hili hya ba baafwanina na bo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, pasi nde wuuna wu uveleyaka Ipfumu hya Nzambi we imwa-mwana, a hukoto mu hyo ve.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisina na Ipfumu hya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mty 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10.17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mumosi mu bakuutu ba Bayudaayo afuuli Yisu: «Mulongisi wu mubwe, hima me apfwana usa, mana Nzambi ava me moonyi wu bilima na bilima?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yisu afutili nde: «Mu hima we li mu uteele me “wu mubwe”? Wu uli wu mubwe ndulu Nzambi siha. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />We yabi mikele mya Nzambi: “A hasa mayamba ve, a haduba muutu ve, a hayiba ve, a hata imbangi hi upfuta mu mbaahi a we ve, kiinza taata a we na ngu a we.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Bahala laafutili: «Me atsingili matumili mo maana moosi umata bufudu bwa me.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Bu Yisu hayuhi maana, nde aleeli: «Hyamiivele huli we isiha imosi: sumbasa byosi bi we li na byo, kaba kaluha a fwanda huli biyaha. Vanga buuna, we ubaha busina bwa hu mayulu. Titswene yaanga na duukala me.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Bu muutu mo wunuuwu hayuhi mambu mo maana, nde akoti mu lingebe mu tooni ati, nde aba isina hiinene. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yisu amono ti nde ka mu lingebe, nde aleeli: «Huli na pasi yindahi huli bisina mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Hwaleenge huli buuru nga irunga mu uvyoho ŋa vulu la tsongi. Ka hwafula pasi huli isina mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Ba baakayuha nde, baaleeli: «A li buni! Ka na utwala uyoboho?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yisu akaali: «Mambu ma baatu bu ukondo, Nzambi ubaatwala.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Buuna Peetelo ni uleele: «Mono, bisu laatimbi byosi bi bisu labeedi na byo mu uduukala we.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yisu ni uleele bo: «Me ndeele benu lo. Ni mbuli, muutu utimba nzo a nde, buuve mukadi a nde, baana ba ngu a nde, ikuta hya nde, baana ba nde, mu tooni Ipfumu hya Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />Tso nde tiimbi bo, Nzambi uva nde bi byafulala mu taangu mo yiniiyi, na hubusu, nde ubaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uyabisa lipfu na tsuuhili a nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mty 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10.32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yisu avoli bayihi kuumi boole, bo baayeni ŋa muvanga na aleeli bo: «Yuhaani, likumasaani hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. Bu lutonwani huuna, moosi ma mimbihuli mya Nzambi myasonihi mu tooni a Mwana a muutu, mu utswiha. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Ka bu uyeholo nde ŋa myoho mi lituma la byenyi baa bukwede nde, baa butuha nde na baa bu utuulala nde maate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Humbisa utete bikooti, bu uduba nde. Mu ilumbu hi bitatu nde usuuha mu lipfu.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ka bayihi a baatsikihi dyaambu tso limosi, mu ma nde haleeli bo ve. Mbindulili a maana yaba yasweme huli bo. Na bo a baakatsikaha ma Yisu hakayabisa bo ve.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abeelusi inzimana hu musyenge a Yeriko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mty 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10.46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Bu Yisu haba bebele na musyenge a Yeriko, inzimana imosi hyaba hyatsahala ŋa muvanga a nzila, na hyakasa musohi. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Bu inzimana hyayuhi konge a baatu mu uvyoho, hyo hyafuuli: «Lo lima?» <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Baaleeli nde: «Yisu musi Nazareti li mu uvyoho.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Na nde afulihi: «Yisu, Mwana a Davidi, kwila me lingebe!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Ba baaba hu busu baakapfubasa nde mana nde aba swii. Ka nde arangili ufulaha: «Mwana a Davidi, kwila me lingebe!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yisu atsikimi na atumi baatu mu ubehele nde inzimana. Na bu nde hayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde, Yisu afuuli nde: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Hima we tondi ti me tsiila we?» Nde afutili: «Pfumu, sa ti me mbwemono.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Na Yisu aleeli nde: «Nyaha we bwemono! Hiitu hya we himiibeeloso we.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Mawasa-mawasa, miisu ma nde maadibumi, nde aduukili Yisu na ubaayusa Nzambi. Bu baatu boosi baamoni buuna, bo kaka baayusi Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Zakaayi miyaka Yisu hu nzo a nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yisu akoti mu musyenge a Yeriko na ataangili nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Huuna hwaba na bahala limosi la nduhi a Zakaayi. Nde aba mukuutu bakambi baa limandu na nde aba isina. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Nde akasaha umono Yisu, ka nde a hakatwala ve mu tooni a konge a baatu. Zakaayi aba mukusi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Nde ayeni tiinu hu busu, na avati hu yulu muti wa sikomore mana nde amono Yisu wu akavyohele ŋana.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Bu Yisu hatoodi ŋa mbuha mo yiina, nde asuuli miisu na aleeli nde: «Zakaayi, sutaha mawasa! Loloyi me apfwana uba hu nzo a we.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakaayi asutihi mu mawasa na ayaki nde na kinya yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Baatu bamono buuna, boosi baakaŋono na baakaleele: «Muutu mo wunuuwu miyabala mupaaku huli wu asumaha.» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ka Zakaayi, mu tele, ŋa busu bwa Pfumu, ni uleele nde: «Pfumu! Me tsapa ibadi hi busina bwa me huli biyaha. Tso me apolo mbongo yindahi huli muutu ŋa me akakamba limandu, me tsapfutala nde byetso bina ŋa yulu a bi me apoli.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Loloyi Nzambi miiyobolo baatu babali mu nzo moyi, mu tooni ati muutu mo wunuuwu ka li wu imbisa hya Abrahami. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Eye, Mwana a muutu aya mu usaha na uyobolo ba baadimbala.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sahu li bikuuku bya wolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mty 25.14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Yisu abweta sahu likima huli ba baabeedi baamiiyuha mambu mo maana. Nde aba bebele na musyenge a Yeruselemi. Nde hatiidi sahu mo liina, mu tooni ati baatu baakatsima ti Ipfumu hya Nzambi a hyakibwetamba mu umonehele ve. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Yisu ni uleele: «Bahala limosi la nzo bapfumu, layeni hu tsi a lala hu uyabaha bupfumu. Ka Humbisa nde akiyafutaha. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Teehele nde mu uyene, ateeli kuumi ŋa hati li basalili ba nde, na aviidi pasi nde ikuuku hya wolo imosi hya talu yindahi. Nde aleeli bo: “Saani mumbungu, natee bu me unzapfutaha.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ka baatu ba bula bwa nde baaba baabelele nde. Bo baatsindihi konge biluumbi ŋa mbisa a nde mu uyaleele: “Bisu a litondi ti nde aba pfumu a bisu ve.” <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Baabyalisi nde bupfumu. Bu nde hayafutaha, nde hatsihi basalili ba nde, ba nde havidi mbongo, mu uyaba ki kaluha bo baabahi. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Wu a tsomi ayamonehele na aleeli: “Pfumu, ikuuku hi we ava me hyabuta bikuuku kuumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Pfumu aleeli nde: “We siidi bubwe. We musalili wu mubwe, mu tooni ati we mi mweese imbuli mu mwa bisiha bya hole. Me piidi we lituma li misyenge kuumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Waboole ayidi na aleeli: “Pfumu, ikuuku hi we ava me hyabuta bikuuku bitaanu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Pfumu aleeli huli nde wu: “We kaka, me miipa we lituma li misyenge mitaanu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Mukima ayidi na aleeli: “Pfumu, mono ikuuku hya we hya wolo hi me mbeedi atswehe hutso a itini hya tsanda. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Me tsiidi buuna, bu me mbeedi na boomo bwa we. We li muutu nga likondinakaali, mu tooni ati we ubaavolo bi we aveleswehe na we ubaakuukaha bi we avelekuna.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Pfumu aleeli nde: “Musalili wu mubi! Me tsa tsundasa we ŋa yulu mukuma a we mwakulu. We ayaba ti me muutu nga likondinakaali, ti me umbaapolo bi me avele tswehe, me umbaakuukaha bi me avelekuna. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Mu hima we avelesuusa mbongo a me hutso a nzo iswehili hya mbongo? Humbisa a pfutihili a me, me kipolo yo na kaluha ŋa yulu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Titswene nde aleeli huli baatu ba nde ba baaba ŋana: “Patulaani nde ikuuku hya nde hya wolo, na vaani hyo huli nga bikuuku kuumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Bo baaleeli huli nde: “Pfumu, a li buni! Nde ti amiikwabaha bikuuku kuumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Pfumu akaali: “Me ndeele benu, sa basinzava huli wuna wu abaha. Ka huli wu avelebaha, sa bapatula pa bi nde ali na byo. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Titswene, behelaani me baboho ba me, ba baavelitondo ti me mba pfumu a bo, na baduba bo, ŋa busu bwa me.”» <verse eid="LUK 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Nde amana utoyo buuna, Yisu avyohi ŋa busu, na nde akumi hu tsyelo musyenge a Yeruselemi.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miikoto mu musyenge a Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ŋa Yisu hayato hupedu a mala ma Betefage na Betanya hu tsyelo Isyelo hya Olive<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isyelo hya Olive </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aba mbuha a ngundu miti mi mibaabuta mbutu a «olive».</char></note>, nde atsindihi bayihi boole. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Yenaani hu bula bwa hu busu. Ŋa benu luuto huuna, benu lu umono ibubuuru baakutala. Ibubuuru mo hiina kini a hyabiti muutu ve. Nyangulaani hyo na behelaani me hyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Tso muutu fuuli benu: “Mu hima benu lili mu unyangula hyo?” Benu lifutili nde: “Pfumu li na nzala hyo.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Ba baatsindihi bayene, baabiisi we bu Yisu hayabisi. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Bu bo baakanyangula ibubuuru, banga hyo baaleeli bo: «Mu hima benu lili mu unyangula ibubuuru?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Bayihi ba boole bafutili: «Pfumu li na nzala a hyo.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Na bo baabitili Yisu ibubuuru. Bo baabwahi biyunga bya bo ŋa yulu iboodi, na baakumbisi Yisu mu uvata ŋa yulu hyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ŋa nde hakabita ibubuuru, baatu baakayala biyunga bya bo mu nzila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yisu ayato hupedu musyenge a Yeruselemi. Nzila yi nde haba, ni yi yakakulamana isyelo hya Olive. Konge bayihi boosi, hutso a kinya, yakayusa Nzambi mu ndaha yi mifudi, mu tooni bipadi bi bo baamoni. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bo baakaleele: «Nyaha Pfumu Nzambi asyeme pfumu a bisu wuli mu uya mu nduhi a nde! Hyenze ŋa toto, na muyusu huli Nzambi hu hati mayulu.» <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Mwana kabu li Bafarisi, ŋa hati la konge baaleeli Yisu: «Mulongisi, liha bayihi ba we kele.» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Na Yisu afutili bo: «Me ndeele benu, tso bo badibuhi minywa, mamanya sa masa muyali!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu alili mu tooni a bisu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Bu Yisu hakayasusaha hupedu musyenge, nde atalila Yeruselemi, abwi mu ulila mu tooni a nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Nde aleeli: «Tso we kaka beedi ayaba buni we usoolo hyenze loloyi! Ka mu taangu moyi, hyo hyasweme ŋa miisu ma we. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Bilumbu sa biya, bambeene ba we sa bayadiinga we na utelemese bikahu mu manzila ma we. Bo bu uvinyala na uswekemese we matsyelo moosi. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bo sa banyihula we woosi, we na bisu bula boosi. Bo a busiisa ŋa hati la we, manya ŋa yulu a manya ve. Mu tooni ati, we a hatsikaha taangu yi Nzambi hu uyakumbasa we ve.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu abingi banga mumbungu ba baaba mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mty 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:13-22">Yow 12.13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yisu akoti mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi, na nde abwi mu ubinga banga mumbungu. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Nde aleeli bo: «Mambu ma Ngidi mali mu uleele bu: “Nzo a me yili nzo lisambulu.” Ka benu laamiikitusa yo iswemili hya biibi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Esa 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yel 7.11</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yisu akabaalongese bilumbu byosi mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, milongisi mi Mikele na bakuutu ba bibandu, baakasaha uduba nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ka bo a baabahi nzila ve, mu tooni ati baatu baakasilasa ma nde hakaleele na isuusi hyoosi.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Lituma la Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mty 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11.27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Ilumbu imosi, Yisu akalongese baatu mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi, na nde akayabisa musamu wu mubwe. Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, milongisi mi Mikele na bakuutu ba bibandu, baayasusaha huli Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Bo baayafuula nde bu: «Leele bisu mu ki lituma we li mu usa mavaanga mo maniima, na ava we lituma mo linili?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yisu afutili bo: «Nyaha me pa benu ka hyuhu imosi. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Leelaani me, mu ki lituma Yowani hakatondehe baatu? Lituma mo liina huli Nzambi laamati, vo huli baatu?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Ka bo mwakulu baakafuulasana bu: «Tso lileeli ti: “Huli Nzambi”, nde sa afuula: “Mu hima benu laavelisa imiinu mu ma Yowani haleeli?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ka tso lileeli ti: “Huli baatu”, baatu boosi sa balanga mamanya mu uduba bisu a benu. Mu tooni ati bo aba basiinga ti Yowani aba mumbihuli.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Bo baafutili bu: «Bisu a liyabi na atuma Yowani mu utondehe ve.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Na Yisu afutili bo: «Me kaka a ndeele benu ve, mu ki lituma me ndi mu utsa mavaanga mo maniima.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sahu li basali bababi mu ngundu a vinye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mty 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Humbisa Yisu abweta baatu sahu mo linili: «Bahala limosi laakuni ngundu a nde miti mya vinye. Bahala mo, nga ngundu, lasiisi yo ŋa myoho mi basali ba ngundu a vinye, na nde adyengi hu tsi kima mu taangu yinda. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Bu taangu yi utsonzehe mbutu a vinye yatoodi, nga ngundu atsindihi musalili mumosi huli basali mana bo bava la nde kabu li muhunu a ngundu. Ka bo baarambi nde kuba na bo baafutili nde myoho bunyanga.<figure style="fig" alt="Miti mya Vinye" file="HK00109B.TIF" size="col" loc="Luk 20.10-12" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="20.9">Miti mya Vinye</figure> <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Nga ngundu abwetsindaha musalili mukima. Ka basali baabweramba ka wuna kuba. Baayitili nde misaabu na baafutili nde myoho bunyanga. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Nde abwetsindaha musalili wu mutatu. Bo baanemisi nde na baabingi nde. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Nga ngundu ka ni uleele bu: “Hima me utsa? Me ka mwaana a me wu litondo me utsindaha, peleve bo bu ukiinza nde.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ka bu basali ba ngundu baamoni nde, bo baatsimi na baalelisini: “Nde wu ni nga mukobe! Lidubaani nde, mana mukobe aba wa bisu!” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Buuna bo baabwahi nde hu mbadi a ngundu a vinye, na baadubi nde. Hima nga ngundu a vinye husa huli baatu mobaniba? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Nde sa aya, sa aduba basali mobana, na sa asombese ngundu huli basali bakima.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Baatu ba baadukili sahu bayuha buuna, bo baaleeli: «Lo utwala uvangama buuna ve!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ka Yisu atali bo na aleeli: «Mabasonehe ma Ngidi ma, hima matondi uleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Manya li batungi baabumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">laakituhi la ngu ŋa itungu hya nzo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Mkg 118.22</ref></char></note>”?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Pasi nde wu ubwa ŋa yulu a manya mo lina sa asumbaha, na tso lo libwidi ŋa yulu a muutu, lo sa lihesolo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutu a Yisu mu limandu la Kayisaali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mty 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Milongisi mi Mikele na Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, baasahi ukaanga Yisu masulubete. Ka bo baakabata kungi la baatu. Bo baayaabi ti kuma mo yiina mu bo Yisu hatiidi yo. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Buuna, bo baakakete Yisu. Mono bu bo baatsindihi nde baatu ba baakamonehele we banga butsitu, mu ubaayuha ma nde hakalongese. Baatu mo baana baatehi nde mweto mu hyuhu, mana bo babahila nde tooni mu bitoyili bya nde, yi uyeholo nde huli lituma li bapfumu ba tsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Baatu mo baana bavidi nde hyuhu mo hinihi: «Mulongisi, bisu liyaabi ti ma we ubaaleele na ubaalongese mali ma mabwe. We ali na buraandu ve. Ka we ubaalongese nzila a Nzambi mu imbuli. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Ka leele bisu, baava muswa mu ufuta limandu huli pfumu Kayisaali vo naana?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yisu ayaba dyeele la bo, aleeli bo: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Mwesaani me likuta limosi la mbongo. Hiinzi na bisono mo biniibi bya na?» Bo baafutili: «Bya Kayisaali.»<figure style="fig" alt="Likuta la mboongo" file="HK00168B.TIF" size="col" loc="20.24" copy="Horace Knowles Bible Illustrations" ref="20.24">Likuta la mbongo</figure> <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Na Yisu aleeli bo: «Aka! Bi bili bya Kayisaali futalaani huli Kayisaali, bi bili bya Nzambi futalaani huli Nzambi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Bo a baatwali ubaha lilibi mu ma nde haleeli ŋa busu bwa baatu ve. Ka mvutu a nde yakimusi bo. Bo baasi swi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutu a Yisu mu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mty 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12.18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Mwana kabu li Basaduki laayidi huli Yisu. Ni bo bali mu usilasa ti tsuuhili a babaakwa a yili ve. Bo baafuuli nde: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Mulongisi, Moose asiisa bisu mukele: “Muutu li na mwaana a ngu wu akwele. Nde miikwa na usiisa mukadi a nde wu avele na mwaana. Muutu mowuna afwana ukwele mukwili mana nde abutala wu akwa baana<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Pfu 25.5-6</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ka, hwaba na baana ba ngu tsambu. Mukulu akweli mukadi na nde akwidi hwavele usiisa mwaana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Waboole akweli mukwili. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Ni buuna ka hwaba mu wu mutatu. Tsambu loosi, baakweli mukwili, baakwidi hwavele usiisa mwaana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Humbisa, mukaasu kaka akwidi. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Mu tsuuhili a babaakwa, na uba mulumi mukaasu mo wunuuwu? Mu tooni ati tsambu la baana ba ngu loosi bakweli nde.»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yisu afutili bo: «Babahala na bakaasu ba tungi mo linili bali mukwelesene. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ka ba baayelemene mu uba moonyi mu tungi li uya, Humbisa a tsuuhili ŋa hati la babaakwa, utwala ubwekwele ve. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bo utwala ubwekwa ve, bo sa bafwanina na bapofi. Bo bu uba baana ba Nzambi, bu nde husuula bo mu babaakwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Moose li mu umweese paayalala ti babaakwa sa basuuha. Mu mambu ma nde hasonihi mu muti wuli mu ululaha mbaahu, Moose aleeli ti Pfumu li “Nzambi a Abrahami, Nzambi a Isaki, Nzambi a Yakobi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Pal 3.6</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Nzambi a hali Nzambi a babaakwa ve, ka Nzambi a ba bali moonyi, mu tooni ati boosi bali moonyi mu nde.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bakima ŋa hati li milongisi mi Mikele baaleeli: «We mitoyo bubwe Mulongisi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Na bo a baabweyehele uva nde byuhu bikima ve.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo ni Pfumu na mwaana a Davidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-45">Mty 22.41-45</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12.35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yisu ni uleele bo: «Buni bu utwala usilasa ti Kristo mwaana a Davidi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Davidi nde mwakulu li mu uleele mu muhanda Mikuunga ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Pfumu aleeli huli Pfumu a me:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Tsahala ŋa mbahala a me,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />natee bu me ukitusa baboho ba we</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">isuusili hya miilu mya we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Tso Davidi li mu uteele Kristo “Pfumu”: Buni Kristo hutwala ubweba mwaana a nde?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ukebese Bangeele baa mikele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mty 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Baatu boosi baakayuha ma nde hakayabisa. Yisu aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Kebaani na milongisi mi Mikele. Baatu mo baana baatondo umonehele na biyunga bi bibwe. Bo bubaatondo ti bava bo mabwehe ma mafula butsitu ŋa miisu ma baatu. Bo bubaasaha bitsiha bya busu mu manzo ma masambulu ma Bayudaayo. Mu mikungi miminene mya ndiili ya ŋa tsitsaha, bo ubasaha mambuha matsomi. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bo bubaapatula bisiha bi manzo ma bakwili na, bubaasa masambulu ma mala mu umonehele ba babwe ŋa miisu maa baatu. Nzambi sa asyembe bo na bukanyi.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Bungodu bu mukwili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk 12.41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yisu asuuli miisu, nde amoni bisina bi byakasuusa bungodu bwa bo mu itunga hi bungodu hi hyaba hutso a nzo a Nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Nde amoni ka mukaasu, mukwili wu iyaha wu ayasuusa mwa bakuta boole. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Na nde aleeli: «Mu mbuli, me ndeele benu, mukwili wu iyaha mo wunuuwu vidi hwaluta bana boosi. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Ka baatu mobaniba boosi, baayasuusa tsyetsyengu busina bwa bo. Mukwili mo wunuuwu hutso buyaha bwa nde, suusi byosi bi nde abeedi na byo mu uba moonyi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ayabisi baatu tsalili a nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mty 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13.1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Kabu la baatu laakatoyo mu tooni a nzo a Nzambi. Bo baamoni bubwe bwa yo, bu baaba bayolo yo mu mamanya ma talu na bisiha bi baakava bungodu huli Nzambi. Ka Yisu aleeli:<verse eid="LUK 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Hubusu, bi benu lili mu umono bi, a husaala tso manya limosi ŋa yulu a manya ve. Byosi sa batsala.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ayibusi bayihi mu tooni lingebe na mapasi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mty 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13.3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bo baafuuli nde: «Mulongisi, ki taangu mambu mo maniima mu utswiha na ki iliimbu humweese bisu ti mambu mo maniima mu utswiha?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yisu afutili bo: «Kebaani, muutu a hapfuta benu ve. Mu tooni ati ba banzuhisini bu uya mu nduhi a me, na ubaaleele: “Ni me Masiya!” – Na “Tangu yamito.” Ka a liduuka bo ve. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Ŋa benu luyuha tsangu midiingu na miyungu, a liba na boomo ve, mu tooni ati misamu mo miina myafwana umavangama. Ka yina kini a ni tsukusu a tsi ve.» <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Na Yisu abweleele: «Baatu ba tsi mosi sa balwanisa baatu ba tsi kima, na baatu ba ipfumu imosi sa balwanisa baatu ba ipfumu ikima. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Toto sa yinyingama mu mifudi, na mu bitaanzi bi bilahi, sa uba na limbunga na mabeedu ma tsisu. Sa huba ka na misamu mya tsisu, na biliimbu bi binene bi umonehele hu yulu.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ka tswamina mambu mo maana mavangama, sa bakaanga benu, sa batsuta benu. Sa bayeholo benu hu tsundusu mu manzo ma lisambulu ma Bayudaayo. Sa babwaha benu mu kondaayi. Sa babita benu ŋa busu bu bapfumu na lituma la tsi mu tooni a nduhi a me. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Sa huba huli benu nzila yi uta imbangi mu nduhi a me. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Yaabaani li: benu a lu utehele uvangimasa ma benu lu uleele mu ukalila nyutu a benu ve, tso ki mambu benu luupalisa ve. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Me mwakulu upa benu mambu na tsiki mana muutu tso mumosi ŋa hati li bambeene ba benu, avelesa paha na uleele ti benu na mapfuta. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Bataata na bangu ba benu, baana ba ngu ba benu, baakedi ba benu, ikuta na bambaahi ba benu, buusuumbasa benu, na buuduba ba balahi mu benu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Baatu boosi sa babelele benu mu tooni a me. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ka tso linanga limosi li mutswe a benu a luudimbala ve. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Hwadaani! Ni mu mukami a benu, benu luyobolo moonyi a benu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uyabisa utsala hu musyenge a Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mty 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk 13.14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />«Ŋa benu luumono mabundu ma balwani ma midiinga musyenge a Yeruselemi, benu sa liyaba mu taangu mo yiina, ti utsala hwa yo huka bebele. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Buuna, baa bu uba hu itaanzi hya Yuda, nyaha bo babata hu yulu bisyelo. Boosi ba bu uba hutso musyenge a Yeruselemi nyaha bo bapala na batahuha hu lala. Boosi ba bu uba mu mala, nyaha bavelekoto mu musyenge. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Bilumbu mo biina sa biba bilumbu bi Nzambi husyembe bisu Yeruselemi. Moosi Mabasonehe ma Ngidi sa matswiha. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Ni lingebe huli bakaasu banga mayimi, buuve banga a baana ŋa beelo mu taangu mo yiina. Mu tooni ati, baatu ba tsi sa bakoto hutso lingebe, na kesi a Nzambi sa yibwa ŋa yulu a baatu mobana. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Sa baduba bo mu basabila, buuve sa babita bo hu buviha mu matsi moosi. Mabuli ma matsi makima sa mayabyalila Yeruselemi, natee bu taangu tumili a mo yi usuka.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nziili a Mwana a muutu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mty 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Sa huba na biliimbu bya kimuhili hutso a taangu, hutso a tsuungi na hutso bamvwelele. Mabuli ma matsi makima sa maaba hutso a tsisu na munyongo, mu tooni a kele a nyamba yi yili mu umata hu tsyelo mibu. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Ba banzuhisini sa bakoto mu ikolili mu tooni a ma muubwa ŋa toto yoosi, mu tooni matwala ma mu nyingama hu mayulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Humbisa, sa bamono Mwana a muutu mu uya hutso mayidu na matwala na muyusu a nde woosi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Na bu misamu mo minimi myubaandiha uvangama, hwadaani mu teele na suulaani mutswe, mu tooni ati liyobolo la benu lika bebele.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongisili muti a fiinge</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mty 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13.28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Nde abweta bo sahu mo linili: «Monwaani muti a fiinge, tso pasi muti. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Bu benu luumono ti miti mika mu ufula makaya, benu limiyaba ti taangu yimbwe yika mu uya. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Ni bumosi ka, bu benu luumono bisiha mo biina mu uya, yaabaani ti Ipfumu hi mayulu hika bebele. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Me ndeele benu mu mbuli, tungi la baatu mo linili a bukwa boosi ve, na mamoosi sa matswiha. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Yulu na toto sa bidimbala, ka mambu ma me a mundimbala ve.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambilaani taangu yoosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />«Liba likanda! A lilemese mivumu mya benu mu mikungi ve, mu udya, mu ukolo malamu na mu tooni minyongo mu mya idiingu mohi ve. Tso likuhisi maana, ilumbu mo hina sa hipadumasa benu, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />we mweto. Mu tooni ati hyo sa hibwa ŋa yulu a baatu ba ŋa toto yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />A libwamina matolo ve, sambilaani taangu yoosi. Lisa buuna mana benu libaha mifudi mu upala mutso a moosi mamali mu uya, na uyamonehele mu tele ŋa busu bwa Mwana a muutu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Bilumbu byosi ŋa nyangu, Yisu akalongese mu nzo a Nzambi. Butsuhu nde akayene hu isyelo hya Olive hu nde hakabaaba butsuhu boosi. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Na baatu boosi, ŋa hati a ngwali, baakayene hu litandala la nzo a Nzambi mu uya duukala ndongisili a nde.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Bakuutu ba Bayudaayo baakoti pfuundu yimbi mu Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Mukungi mapa ma maaveledaana, wu bubateele «mukungi a Paake» aba aka bebele. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele baakasaha manzila ma uduba Yisu. Ka bo baaba na boomo bwa baatu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda asahi manzila ma usumbasa Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Mono buni Saatana hakoti mu Yuda, nga nduhi a Isikaryoti, wu aba mumosi ŋa hati la kuumi na biluumbi byole. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yuda ayayuhasana na bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, na bakuutu ba bakeedi baa nzo a Nzambi. Bo baayuhisini mu usaha buni nde hakisumbasa bo Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Bo baaba na kinya na bo baakuti mu uva Yuda mbongo. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda asiingi na abwi mu usaha nzila yimbwe mu usumbasa bo Yisu, hwavele baatu uyaba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu atumi mu uvangimasa metse ma mukungi a Paake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mty 26.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Mlk 14.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Ilumbu hi mukungi wu mapa ma maaveledaana, hi baakatsuha bungodu bwa Paake hyatoodi. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yisu atsindihi Peetelo na Yowani hu busu na aleeli bo: «Yavangimasaani bisu ilaambu hya Paake.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bo baafuuli nde: «Huni we tondi ti bisu liyavangimasa hyo?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Nde afutili bo: «Ŋa benu lu ukoto mu musyenge, bahala limosi, na lisanga li laaluula mu mamba, sa ayabwana benu. Duukalaani nde hutso a nzo yi nde hukoto, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />na benu lileele nga nzo bunuubu: “Mulongisi ti: ‘Itini hya nzo hi me undya Paake na bayihi ba me huni hili?’” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Buuna nde sa alaha benu itini hinene hi baamiivaanga hu yulu ibaanga. Ni huuna benu luvangimasa Paake.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bo boole baayeni, baamoni mambu we bu Yisu hayabisi bo mo. Peetelo buna Yowani baavangimisi ilaambu hya Paake.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilaambu hya Pfumu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20">Mty 26.20</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17">Mlk 14.17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">22-25</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-26">1Ko 11.23-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Tangu bu yatoodi, Yisu atsahili ŋa metse na biluumbi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Nde ni uleele bo: «Me mbeedi na lehemene mu udya ilaambu hya Paake mo yiina benu, tswamina me mono pasi. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ka, me ndeele benu, me a humbwendya hyo ve, natee bu Nzambi huva tsalu a hyo hu Ipfumu hya nde.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Nde avoli mbuungu, afutili matondo huli Nzambi, na aleeli: «Volwaani mbuungu moyi, na kabasanani yo. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Me ndeele benu, vaangaani buuna, mu tooni ati, me a umbwenywa vinye ve, natee bu Ipfumu hya Nzambi hyuya.» <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Titswene nde avoli lipa, hu mbisa ufutala matondo huli Nzambi, nde abukili lo, akabili bo na aleeli: «Yiniiyi ni nyutu a me yi me apiidi mu benu. Baasaani buuna mu uba yibuhala me moonyi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Nde asiidi ka bumosi mu mbuungu. Bu bo baamani udya, Yisu aviidi bo mbuungu na aleeli: «Mbuungu mo yiniiyi ni Nzuhisini yi Nyatihi, ŋa hati la Nzambi na baatu. Lahi mo liina baasiidi lo mu makila ma me, ma maatsamuhi mu benu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ka monwaani, nde wuna wu usumbasa me, ni ŋa metse ŋa ali na me. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mwana a muutu sa akwa we bu huli kesili a Nzambi. Ka ni lingebe huli nde wuna wu usumbasa nde!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Na biluumbi byabandihi ufulasana ŋa hati la bo: «Na akisa buuna?»<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Na afulala bukuutu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:24-28">Mty 20.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">19.28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:41-45">Mlk 10.41-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Ŋa hati li bayihi hwabwidi kele yinene, mu uyaba na ŋa hati la bo aba afulala bukuutu. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Bapfumu ba mabuli ma matsi makima, bubaatsahilala baatu ba bo. Na babali na lituma ŋa yulu a bo, bubaasa ti baateele bo “banga mavaanga ma mabwe”. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />A huyelemene buuna mu benu ve. Nyaha wu aluta bukuutu ŋa hati la benu, aba we ngebe a benu; wu ubaatuma benu, aba we musalili a benu. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Na fuli bukuutu, wuli ŋa metse vo musalili wuli mu uva nde byudya? Wuli ŋa metse, ni mukuutu. Ka me ndi ŋa hati la benu we musalili. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Benu likwilili na me hutso mapasi ma me. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Ni mu buuna, we bu Taata a me hava me lituma, me kaka ndi mu upa benu lituma, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Ni mu buuna benu lu udya na unywa na me, hutso Ipfumu hya me. Na benu sa litsahala ŋa makiti ma bupfumu, mu utsundasa bibandu kuumi na byole bya Isereli.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ayabisi ti Peetelo sa atuna nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mty 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:37-38">Yow 13.37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />«Simoni, Simoni! Kele! Saatana amiivondo muswa mu ususa benu ŋa iyengese, we bu bubayengese mbutu a looso. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ka me atsambili mu we, mana hiitu hya we mu Nzambi, hiveletsuda. Na ŋa we uyafutaha huli me, hwadisa baana ba ngu a we.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Peetelo aleeli nde: «Pfumu, me ndi wu avangama mu uyene na we hutso a kondaayi na ukwa na we.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yisu afutili nde: «Peetelo, me ndeele we, tsusu na maakohele loloyi, we sa tuna me tuna tatu.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbongo, koome na sabila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Nde abweleele bo: «Ŋa me atsindihi benu hwavele ipoholo hya mbongo, tso koome, tso bikoodi, benu laakiimi mu isiha?» Bo baafutili: «Isiha tso imosi ve.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Na nde aleeli bo: «Ka bunuubu, woosi nga ipoholo hya mbongo, nyaha avolo hyo. Ni we nga koome ka. Na wu avele na sabila, asumbasa ikutu hya nde na asumba sabila a nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ka me ndeele benu, hwafwana mu ukuhasa ma mumbihuli a Nzambi hasonehe mu me: “Baasuusi nde mu litangu la banga ma mabi, na dyaambu mo liinili lafwana utswiha mu tooni a me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Esa 53.12</ref></char></note>.” Mu tooni ati moosi ma baasonehe mu me, sa matswiha.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Bayihi baaleeli: «Pfumu, mono basabila boole.» Na nde afutili bo: «Baana tsiitsa!»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu asambili ŋa isyelo hya Olive</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mty 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14.32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Bu nde hapali, nde ayeni we bu hwaba ipfu hya nde hu isyelo hya Olive. Bayihi ba nde baaduukili nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Bu nde hatoodi ŋa mbuha mo yiina, nde aleeli bo: «Sambilaani, mana Nzambi akumbasa benu mu uvelenyahula hiitu mu nde.»<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Titswene nde atahuhi mwaana lala na bo, na asambili. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Yisu aleeli: «Taata, tso we tondi, maasila me mbuungu yi mapasi yiniiyi. Nyaha litondo la we livangama, ka a la me ve.» <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Na pofi amati huli Nzambi, ayamonehele na nde, mu uhwadisa nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Hutso maangongo, nde akasambila na mifudi mi myavyohelele. Hyunga hya nde hyakituhi we matangi ma makila ma maakabwa ŋa toto. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Bu nde hamani usambila buuna, Yisu atelimi, ayasusaha hu pedu bayihi ba nde. Nde abiisi bo tolo, hutso ikolili na lingebe. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Mu hima benu lili mu ubwamina? Telemaani, na sambilaani, mana Nzambi akumbasa benu mu uvelenyahula hiitu mu nde.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiiyakaanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mty 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yow 18.3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Nde a hamani utoyo ve, konge a baatu yayidi. Nga nduhi a Yuda, mumosi ŋa hati la kuumi na biluumbi byole, aba ŋa busu. Nde ayasusaha ŋa pedu a Yisu mu uviva nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Yuda, ni mu muvivu we misuumbasa Mwana a muutu!» <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Biluumbi bya Yisu, bu byamoni ma maaba mu uvyoho, baafuli nde: «Pfumu, litina bo mu basabila ba bisu?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Na, mumosi mu bo ateti musalili wu mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, na akesi nde tswi la mbahala. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ka Yisu aleeli: «Nyahaani! Buuna ka tsiitsa.» Yisu abembi tswi la bahala mo, na abeelusi nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Titswene nde aleeli huli bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, huli bakuutu ba bakeedi baa nzo a Nzambi, na huli bakuutu ba Bayudaayo ba baayidi, hu uyakanga nde: «Benu limiiya na basabila, na makooko we me wuli ipumbulu. <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Me kamba taangu yoosi na benu mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi, na benu a laakaangi me ve. Ka taangu mo yiniiyi ka ya benu na yi matwala ma piipidi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo atuni Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mty 26.57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mlk 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-17">Yow 18.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Bu bo baamani ukaanga Yisu, bo baabiti nde hu nzo mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi. Peetelo akadukala bo mu lilalala. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ŋa butima bu litandala la nzo, bo baaduuki mbaahu, na baatsahili. Peetelo atsahili ŋa hati la bo.<verse eid="LUK 22:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Musalili mumosi wu mukaasu wu abeedi na bo, mu liyalala la mbaahu adihuli Peetelo. Mukaasu asungimini nde na aleeli: «Bahala mo linili ka labeedi na Yisu!» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ka nde atuni na aleeli: «Mukaasu, me a nzaabi nde ve!» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Mwana a taangu hole yivyoho, muutu mukima amoni nde na aleeli: «We kaka li mumosi wa ŋa hati la bo.» Na Peetelo akaali: «Bahala, a me ve!» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Humbisa a bebele a ngunga mosi, mukima abwesilasa: «Mu mbuli, bahala mo linili kaka libeedi na nde, mu tooni ati nde musi Ngalili.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Peetelo akaali: «We, me a nzaabi ma we tondi uleele ve.» Mu taangu mo yiina, bu nde haba kini mu utoyo, tsusu akohili. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Pfumu akinguhi na atali Peetelo. Na Peetelo ayibwili moonyi mu mambu ma Pfumu haleeli nde: «Tsusu na maakohele loloyi, we utuna me tunala tatu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Peetelo apali mu litandala, nde abwi mu ulila mu mifudi.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baatu baakanyongese Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mty 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk 14.65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Baatu ba baakakeelese Yisu baakakwede nde, na baakatete nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bo baakafungala nde hiinzi, na baakava nde byuhu, na ubaaleele: «Bihula! Na leele na miitete we.» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Bo baahwadi mu usinzatuha nde.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ŋa busu bwa pfuundu banzonzi baa Bayudaayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mty 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yow 18.19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ŋa busi bwakiidi, bakuutu ba tungi la bula, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele, boosi baakuukimi. Baabiti Yisu ŋa busu bwa pfuundu a bo, pfuundu banzonzi yi Bayudaayo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Bo baleeli: «Tso we ni Kristo, leele bisu.» Yisu akaali bo: «Tso me ndeeli benu lo, benu a lusinga ve. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Tso me piidi benu hyuhu, benu a lukaala me ve. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Umata loloyi, Mwana a muutu sa atsahala ŋa mbahala a Nzambi a Pungu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Boosi baaleeli: «We kaahu Mwana a Nzambi we li?» Na nde afutili bo: «Benu mwakulu limileele lo.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Na bo baaleeli: «Bisu a lisaali na nzala bambangi ve. Mu tooni ati bisu limiyuha bisu mwakulu ma mamipala mu munywa a nde.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Bayudaayo bamiibita Yisu ŋa busu bu mutumi Pilaato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mty 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yow 18.28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Pfuundu banzonzi yoosi yatelimi na yabiti Yisu huli mutumi Pilaato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Huuna, bo baabandihi mu ukese nde na ubaaleele: «Bisu limiibiisa muutu mo wunuuwu mu ulobese tungi la bula: nde li mu uliha baatu mu ufuta limandu huli pfumu Kayisaali, na nde li mu ubamonehele nde mwakulu ti nde ni Kristo, pfumu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilaato afuuli nde bu: «We ni pfumu Bayudaayo?» Yisu akaali: «Ni we miileele lo.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilaato aleeli huli bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na huli konge a baatu: «Me a handi mu umono tooni yi yayelemene mu ubelese bahala mo linili ve.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ka bo baabweleele na mifudi myosi: «Mu ndongisili a nde, nde li mu utsindahala baatu ba itaanzi hya Yuda hyoosi mu uvelesiingala lituma la tsi. Nde abaandihi hu itaanzi hya Ngalili natee huni.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilaato miitsindaha Yisu huli pfumu Eloode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Bu mutumi Pilaato hayuhi buuna, nde afuuli bo: «Bahala mo linili musi Ngalili ali?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Pilaato ayuha buuna, nde ayaabi ti Yisu musi Ngalili ali. Itaanzi mo hina hyaba hutso lituma la pfumu Eloode. Titswene Pilaato atsindihi nde huli Eloode wu aba hu Yeruselemi, mu bilumbu mo biina.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Eloode aba na kinya yindahi mu umono Yisu. Mu tooni ati, umata beleve, nde akayuha tsangu a nde. Nde akasa hiitu ti Yisu sa asa ipadi ŋa miisu ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Nde aviidi nde bidoodo bi bilahi, ka Yisu a hafutili nde dyaambu tso limosi ve. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele baaba ŋana, baakakese Yisu na kesi yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Eloode na masadaadu ma nde, baakasyebe na utuha Yisu. Bo baalwatisi nde ikutu hi ibwe na baafutili nde huli Pilaato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Eloode na Pilaato aba baboho. Ka umata ilumbu mo hina bo baakituhi bambaahi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiibelese mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:11-26">Mty 27.11-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-15">Mlk 15.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yow 18.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19.16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilaato akungi bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, bakuutu ba Bayudaayo na baatu boosi. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Nde aleeli bo: «Benu limiibehele me muutu mo wunuuwu na uleele ti, nde li mu utsindahala baatu mu uvelesiingala lituma la tsi. Ka me mwakulu miipa nde byuhu, ŋa busu bwa benu, na me a hamono tooni mu nde, mu moosi ma benu lili mu ukese nde ve. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Eloode ka, a hamoni tooni mu nde ve. Nde miifutala bisu nde. Mu mbuli, muutu mo wunuuwu a hasa pasi dyaambu li nde hubaha kesili yi lipfu ve. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ni mu buuna, me utuma batete nde bikooti, humbisa me unyahula nde.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:16">[ <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pilaato haleeli buuna, mu tooni ati pasi mukungi a Paake, nde akabanyahula kondaayi imosi.</char></note>] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Bo baafulihi boosi mu itwadi: «Duba muutu mo wunuuwu, na nyahula bisu Barabasi!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Barabasi baakotisi kondaayi mu tooni midingu mi myabwidi hutso musyenge, na bu nde hadubi muutu. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilaato abweleele huli konge a baatu, bu haba na tsimi yi unyahula Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ka konge yoosi yafulihi: «Komene nde ŋa kuruwa! Komene nde ŋa kuruwa!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilaato abweleele leele li matatu: «Ki dyaambu lilibi nde hasa? Me a hamono tooni yi bu uduba nde ve. Ni mu buuna, me utuma batete nde bikooti, humbisa, me unyahula nde.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ka bo baasinzifulaha mu mifudi, na ubaavondo ti bakomene Yisu ŋa kuruwa. Na ufulaha hwa bo hwabiingi. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Pilaato avoli kesili yi ukuhasa litondo la bo. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Nde anyahuli wuna wu bo baakavondo. Ni wu abeedi mu kondaayi mu tooni midingu mi myabwidi hutso musyenge, na bu nde hadubi muutu. Pilaato ayehuli bo Yisu mu usa litondo la bo.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu baakomini ŋa kuruwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:31-44">Mty 27.31-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:20-32">Mlk 15.20-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yow 19.17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Bu bo baakabita Yisu, bo baabwani na muutu mumosi nduhi Simoni, musi Kilene, wu akamata hu matsyehe. Masadaadu maakangi nde na maakwihi nde kuruwa mu ubita humbisa a Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Konge a tungi la bula yinene yakaduukala nde. Hwaba ka na bakaasu ba baakalila na uyayana mu tooni a nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yisu akinguhi huli bo na aleeli: «Bamama baa Yeruselemi, a lilila mu me ve. Ka lilaani mu benu na baana ba benu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ka taangu yamiibeleme yi bu uleele: “Kinya huli bakaasu ba binguma, ba bakini a baabuti ve, na ba bakini a baaviidi mwaana beelo ve!” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Na baatu sa ba baaleele huli bisyelo: “Bwani ŋa yulu a bisu!” Na huli bikundahala: “Fungalaani bisu!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Tso bavangili maniima mu muti wu mubisu, buni bu uba mu muti wu akanya?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Baabiti ka biyahudi byole, mana baduba bo nzila mosi na Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ŋa baayato ŋa mbuha mosi yi baakateele «Ibanga», masadaadu maakomini Yisu ŋa kuruwa, nzila mosi na biyahudi bi byole. Mumosi ŋa mbahala a Yisu, wuna ŋa kaasu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />[Yisu aleeli: «Taata, sa bo kolo-kolo, mu tooni ati, bo a bayabi ma bali mu uvanga ve.»] Bo baatiidi ngodo mu ukaba bikutu bya nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Konge a baatu yaba ŋana na yakatala. Bakuutu ba Bayudaayo, bo, baakakwede Yisu na baakaleele: «Nde fuuhisi bakima, nyaha nde afuuhasa nde mwakulu. Tso mbuli nde ni Kristo, wu Nzambi hasoolo!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Masadaadu ka maakakwede nde na maayasusaha mu uva nde vinye a nganyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Na maaleeli: «Tso we ni pfumu Bayudaayo, nyaha we fuuhasa we mwakulu!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ŋa yulu mutswe a nde hwaba na baya libaasonehe bu: «Nde wunuwu ni pfumu Bayudaayo.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Mumosi mu biyahudi bi baakomini ŋa kuruwa, akatuha Yisu na ubaaleele: «We ali Kristo ve? Fuuhasa we mwakulu na bisu kaka!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ka hya byole hyasyembi wuna na uleele: «We tso boomo bwa Nzambi ve? We wu uli mu tsyembili mosi na nde! <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Mu bisu a we, tsyembili mo yiniiyi yayelemene. Mu tooni ati bisu a we, tsyembili mavaanga ma bisu a we lili mu uyaka. Ka nde wunuwu a hasa lilibi tso limosi ve.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Titswene nde abweleele: «Yisu, yibwala me moonyi, ŋa bu ubyalisa we mu Ipfumu hya we.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yisu afutili nde: «Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele we: loloyi, we uba itwadi na me hu paradiso.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu la Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mty 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yow 19.28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Hwaba hu pedu a ngunga ya mwangulu, na piipidi yabwidi mu tsi yoosi, na yakwilili te mu ngunga yi matatu ya humbisa a mwangulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Litadi laadyami loosi, na nguumbu a mu nzo a Nzambi yapasihi mu bitini byole.<figure style="fig" alt="Nguumbu a mu Nzo a Nzambi" file="CN01843B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C. Cook New Testament Illustrations" ref="23.45">Nguumbu a mu Nzo a Nzambi</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Buuna Yisu afulihi mu mifudi myosi: «Taata, me tsusi iluunzi hya me ŋa myoho mya we.» Na bu nde haleeli buuna, nde amani muvumu. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Hwaba na muutu mumosi, mukuutu a kama li balwani. Bu nde hamoni buuna, ayusi Nzambi na aleeli: «Ni mbuli, muutu mo wunuuwu a habeedi na tooni ve.» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Baatu ba baayidi mu konge, baamoni moosi ma maavyohi. Boosi baafutihi mu manzo, na ubaabula tulu mu lingebe. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Bambaahi baa Yisu boosi, na bakaasu ba baaduukili nde umata hu Ngalili, baaba baateleme, mu ubaatalila moosi ma maakavyoho.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndihili a Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mty 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yow 19.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Hwaba na bahala limosi, nduhi a nde Yosefi. Nde aba musi bula bu Bayudaayo bwa nduhi Arimate. Bahala mo liina aba muutu wu mubwe na wu asungama, na nde akakeele nziili Ipfumu hya Nzambi. Nde aba mumosi ŋa hati la pfuundu banzonzi baa Bayudaayo. Ka nde a hasiingi kesili na ma banzonzi bakima baasiidi ve. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Nde ayamono mutumi Pilaato na uvondo nde muswa mu uvolo mvumbi a Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Nde asutisi nyutu a Yisu ŋa kuruwa, nde apoti yo mu lileeso. Na nde asuusi yo hutso a ngila yi baaba baavala hutso a manya. Ngila mo yiina aba kini a baadiihi mvumbi mu yo ve. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Hu tsitsaha ilumbu hi bitaanu, baatu baakavangimasa mukungi mu tooni ati, ilumbu hya saba hyaba bebele.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bakaasu ba baakayene na Yisu umata hu Ngalili, baaduukili Yosefi. Bo baatali ngila na baamoni buni baasuusi mvumbi a Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Titswene bo baafutihi hu musyenge na baavangimisi maadi ma tsulu yimbwe na nyafi bya nyutu a Yisu. Mu ilumbu hya saba, bo baavumi, we bu hwaba tumili mukele a Moose.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Tsuuhili a Yisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mty 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-13">Yow 20.1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Mu ilumbu hi limiingu ŋa hati a ngwali, bakaasu baayeni hu ngila. Bo baabiti maadi ma tsulu a nyafi ma bo baavangimisi. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bo baamoni ti manya li baadibuhi munywa ikotili hya ngila, laaba baavengolo ŋa muvanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Bo baakoti hutso a ngila, ka a baamoni nyutu a Pfumu Yisu ve. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Bu matsimi ma bo maaba helini-helini, babahala boole mu bikutu bi bibaamwedeme, baayamonehele ŋa busu bwa bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Mu boomo, bakaasu baatsokihi biinzi bya bo mu toto. Babahala mo baaleeli bo: «Mu hima benu lili mu usaha ŋa hati la babaakwa wu uli moonyi? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Yisu a hali ŋa ve, ka nde amiisuuha ŋa hati la babaakwa. Yibwalaani ma nde haleeli benu ŋa nde haba hu Ngalili: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />“Baafwana uyeholo Mwana a muutu ŋa myoho mya banga masumu, na ukomene nde ŋa kuruwa, na nde sa asuuha mu lipfu mu ilumbu hi bitatu.”» <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Buuna bakaasu baayibwili moonyi mu mambu ma Yisu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Bo baamati hu ngila na baayayabisa moosi huli biluumbi kuumi na imosi na huli bana boosi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Hwabeedi Mariya musi Magadala, Yane, Mariya ngu a Yaki. Bakaasu bakima ba baabeedi na bo, bo kaka baatoosili musamu mo wunuuwu huli biluumbi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ka biluumbi byatsimi ti ma bakaasu baayaleele bo, a mali na lisunga ve. Bo a baasiidi hiitu mu mo ve. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ka Peetelo atelimi na ayeni tiinu hu ngila. Nde abaandimi na nde amoni ndulu birende bya tsanda ya lino. Titswene nde afutihi, hutso a kimuhili yindahi, a ma maabwidi.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu apfuuti nzila na bayihi boole ba baakayene hu bula bwa Emawusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ilumbu mo hina, bayihi boole baakayene hu bula bumosi nduhi Emawusi. Taha mu uto hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, mangunga moole mu dwe la miilu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Bo baakalelesene mu misamu myosi mi myabwidi. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Bu bo baakalelesene na baakatsotso mambu mo, Yisu nde mwakulu ayidi bebele na bo na apfuuti nzila na bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bo baakamono nde, ka Nzambi asi bo muyungu ti bo baveledihula nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yisu afuuli bo: «Benu ki mambu lili mu utsotso mu nzila?» Bo baatsikimi na baamweesi lingebe la bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Mumosi mu bo, nga nduhi a Kelopasi, akaali nde: «Mu boosi ba bali mu Yeruselemi, ndulu ni we dimbili ma mamiivyoho bilumbu mobiinibi?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yisu ti: «Mo ka ki mo?» Bo baafutili nde: «Ma maabwa mu tooni a Yisu, musi Nazareti, nde beedi mumbihuli a Nzambi wu matwala. Nde amweese mo mu mavaanga na mu mambu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi na ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na batumi ba bisu, baayehuli nde, batsundisi nde natee hu lipfu, na baakomini nde ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Bisu likasa hiitu ti nde ni wu kiiyobolo Isereli. Ka ŋa yulu a maana moosi, loloyi ka bilumbu bitatu umata bu maana mosi maabwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Ŋa hati la bisu mwa bakaasu hakwe, bali mu uleele mya kimuhili. Ni mbuli: bo baayeni hu ngila a nde ŋa hati a ngwali, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ka bo a baamoni mvumbi a nde ve. Bo baayafutaha, baayayabisa bisu ma bo baamoni mu imono-miisu. Mu imono-miisu mo, bapofi baayabisi bo, ti nde moonyi ali. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bakima ŋa hati la bisu, baayeni hu ngila. Bo baamoni mambu moosi we bu bakaasu baayabisi. Ka uto ti Yisu, bo a baamoni nde ve.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Buuna Yisu aleeli bo: «Baatu ba baavele buyedi, na banga matsika mu usa imiinu mu moosi ma mimbihuli mya Nzambi myayabisi! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Beedi hwafwana ti Kristo a maamono pasi, tswamina Nzambi ayusa nde?»<verse eid="LUK 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Na nde abinduli bo mambu moosi ma baasonehe mu nde mu Muhanda a Ngidi woosi, umata mu mabuuku ma Moose natee mu mabuuku moosi ma mimbihuli. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Bu bo baatoodi bebele na bula bu bo baakayene, Yisu asiidi we wu uvyoho bula mo buuna. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ka bo baayayiini nde na uleele: «Ba na bisu, mu tooni ati, ilumbu hi mikulamana na butsuhu bwaka bebele.» Nde akoti mu uba na bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Nde atsahili ŋa metse na bo, nde avoli lipa, asambili na asyemi lo. Titswene nde abukili lo na aviidi bo lo. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Buuna, miisu ma bo maadibumi na bo baadihuli Yisu. Ka nde adimbili ŋa busu bwa bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Na bo baalelisini: «Bisu laamono kinya we mbaahu hutso mitima mya bisu, ŋa nde akayambilanga na bisu mu nzila yoosi. Bisu laamono ka kinya ŋa nde akabindulanga bisu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi.»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Bayihi baboole baa, baatelimi mawasa-mawasa, baafutihi hu Yeruselemi. Na bo baayabiisa biluumbi kuumi na imosi bi byaba byakuukama na bakima. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Bayihi baboole, baaleeli bo: «Ni mbuli! Pfumu amiisuuha ŋa hati la babaakwa. Ni mbuli! Nde miyamonehele huli Simoni.» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Bo mwakulu baaviidi ikuumbu mu ma bo baamoni mu nzila, na buni bo baadihuli Yisu mu taangu a kabili lipa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mav 1.6-8</ref> </char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu amonihili huli bayihi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mty 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yow 20.19-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Bo baaba kini mu utoyo, ŋa Yisu nde mwakulu hayamonehele mu tele, ŋa hati la bo. Nde aleeli: «Nyaha hyenze hiba na benu.» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bo baaba na boomo, napa tsisu, mu tooni a bo baatsimi ti, bo bamiimono mukuyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Na Yisu aleeli huli bo: «Mu hima laaka pupa-pupa? Na mu hima lili na paha mo yiniiyi hutso mitima mya benu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Talaani makaka ma me, na miilu mya me. A wu ni me! Bembaani me, na monwaani! Mukuyi a hali na musunya ve, tso visi ve. Ka a huli buuna mu me muutu ve, benu limiimono ti me na byo.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Bu nde haleeli buuna, nde amweesi bo myoho na miilu mya nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Bo a baaba na hiitu ve mu tooni ati, bo baaba baaluula mu kinya na mu kimuhili. Yisu afuuli bo: «Benu lili na isiha hyudya ŋaniiŋa?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bo baaviidi nde itini hya tswi wu baakaanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Yisu avoli nde na adiidi ŋa miisu ma bo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Titswene nde aleeli bo: «Monwaani mambu ma me anzabisi benu ŋa me amba kini ŋa hati la benu. Hwafwana ti, mambu mo maniima moosi Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mu me, matswiha. Mambu mo mali mu mikele mya Moose, hutso mabuuku ma mimbihuli na mu libuuku la Mikuunga.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Buuna nde adibuli bo buyedi mana bo batsikaha mambu ma Ngidi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Na nde aleeli bo: «Ni mu buuna, baasonehe ti Kristo sa amono pasi yi lipfu. Na mu ilumbu hi bitatu, nde sa asuuha mu tsi a babaakwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Bo baabwesonehe ti, sa balongese mu nduhi a nde, Musamu wu Mubwe huli baatu ba matsi moosi. Mana bo basobo mbiili a bo, na bayaka nyahulili masumu. Bo sa batswamina ulongese mo hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Benu lili bambangi baa mambu mo maniima. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Buuna, me tsa tsindaha me mwakulu ŋa yulu a benu, wu Taata a me hasiidi lahi. Ka benu, kwilalaani hutso musyenge natee bu benu luuyaka matwala ma hu hati a yulu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu avati hu yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Titswene Yisu abiti bo hu mbadi musyenge, bebele na bula bwa Betanya. Na nde asyenuli myoho na asyemi bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Bu nde haba mu usyeme bo, nde atahuhi na bo, na avati hu yulu.<verse eid="LUK 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ka bo, humbisa a hu bo baakongimini mu uyusa nde, bo baafutihi hu Yeruselemi na kinya yi yafulala. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Bo baakapfuutana taangu yoosi mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi na baakayusa Nzambi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>